klyn food festival.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/01/things-to-do-this-week-new-nick-cave-sculptures-a-history-of-high-heels-and-more-from-the-cultural-calendar/', 'snippet': 'Plus, fall art openings in Chelsea, leather goods from Marlow & Sons at the Wythe Hotel and an outdoor Brooklyn food festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Monday, New YorkPick up prints from a duo of award-winning designers.Dexter Sinister is both an enterprise and an ethos. Stuart Bailey and David Reinfurt write, curate and publish their own boutique art books with a focus on power through efficiency. Their new presentation at the exhibition space of the bookstore McNally Jackson, “W.A.S.T.E,” offers nine\xa0lithographic prints coupled with essays and commentary on the profligate practices of today’s publishing industry.Picture Room at McNally Jackson, 236 Mulberry Street, mcnallyjacksonstore.com.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/t-magazine/02agenda-Magdaleno-1/02agenda-Magdaleno-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/02/t-magazine/02agenda-Magdaleno-1/02agenda-Magdaleno-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/t-magazine/02agenda-Magdaleno-1/02agenda-Magdaleno-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/t-magazine/02agenda-Magdaleno-1/02agenda-Magdaleno-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url