triggerfish.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/02/nyregion/on-rockaway-reef-hoisting-dinner-on-the-point-of-a-spear.html', 'snippet': 'Eschewing the traditional rod and reel, spear fishermen dive about 40 feet under brown-green water to capture bass, porgies and triggerfish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aboard a vessel known as the Spearboat on a recent Monday afternoon, the squeak of rubber fins on a fiberglass floor mixed with the wheeze of divers taking in big gulps of air. Tanned hands rubbed diluted hair conditioner onto the inside of neoprene suits. The boat’s captain, a steely Russian immigrant named Yuri Krainov, eyes striped by sunglass tan lines, quieted the engine as he steered toward a spot over the artificial Rockaway Reef, in the waters near Breezy Point.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/nyregion/01SUMMERSPEARFISHINGweb1/01SUMMERSPEARFISHINGweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/01/nyregion/01SUMMERSPEARFISHINGweb1/01SUMMERSPEARFISHINGweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/nyregion/01SUMMERSPEARFISHINGweb1/01SUMMERSPEARFISHINGweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/nyregion/01SUMMERSPEARFISHINGweb1/01SUMMERSPEARFISHINGweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/nyregion/01SUMMERSPEARFISHINGweb1