August, the pesh merga fled the front line, just a half-hour’s drive from the territorial capital, Erbil.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tarnishing a Reputation as Storied Warriors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tarnishing a Reputation as Storied Warriors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kurds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ahmed, Azam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pesh Merga', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kurdistan Democratic Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Patriotic Union of Kurdistan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Iraqi Army', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hussein, Saddam', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barzani, Massoud', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hussein, Fuad', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Erbil (Iraq)', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-02T00:25:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Azam Ahmed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Azam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ahmed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/604fd356-4870-5365-bd27-e