of “Big Hero 6,” the studio’s next animation release. Josh Gad, who lent his voice to Olaf, hosts.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On TV Tuesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Tuesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-02T05:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ad81327-fbd6-577c-9f2f-3f55d8890cae', 'word_count': 684, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ad81327-fbd6-577c-9f2f-3f55d8890cae'}, {'abstract': 'The running track atop the school building provides enough play and exercise space for 1,600 students at a time, the school’s principal told Chinese radio.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/02/with-land-scarce-chinese-school-builds-rooftop-track/', 'snippet': 'The running track atop the school building provides enough play and exercise space for 1,600 students at a time, the school’s principal told Chinese radio.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 12:27 a.m. ET| Space is at a premium in the cities of eastern China. Property prices have been surging for years. On Tuesday, the official Twitter accounts of People’s Daily, Xinhua and China Central Television, all state news organizations, posted striking photographs of how one primary school in Tiantai County, Zhejiang Province, is coping with the urban squeeze.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Land Scarce, Chinese School Builds Rooftop Track', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': Non