Tests and Examinations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBE Life Sciences Education (Journal)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-02T18:15:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb7626f4-a22b-548b-bc62-c7c244a92eb1', 'word_count': 619, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb7626f4-a22b-548b-bc62-c7c244a92eb1'}, {'abstract': 'Global awareness of the Ebola epidemic has not translated into effective action. As organizations such as Samaritan’s Purse and Doctors Without Borders continue to engage in the fight against the deadly virus, here are some lessons learned to date.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/02/lessons-learned-from-the-ebola-epidemic/', 'snippet': 'Global awareness of the Ebola epidemic has not translated into effective action. As organizations such as Samaritan’s Purse and Doctors Without Borders continue to engage in the fight against the deadly virus, here are some lessons learned to date...', 'lead_paragraph': 'On July 24, I wrote on this blog that the Ebola epidemic was spinning out of control and pleaded with the international community to join my organization, Samaritan’s Purse, on the front lines of the fight against this deadly disease.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/opinion/2kristof_ebola/2kristof_ebola-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/02/opinion/2kristof_ebola/2kristof_ebola-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/opinion/2kristof_ebola/2kristof_ebola-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/opinion/2kristof_ebola/2kristof_ebola-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 817, 'width': 1224, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/opinion/2kristof_ebola/2kristof_ebola-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/02/opinion/2kristof_ebola/2kristof_ebola-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/opinion/2kristof_ebola/2kristof_ebola-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lessons Learned from the Ebola Epidemic', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brantly, Kent', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Samaritan's Purse", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Monrovia (Liberia)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-02T18:22:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Isaacs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Isaacs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/52cbe6d9-244e-5743-a6e0-d58a232179b9', 'word_count': 1090, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52cbe6d9-244e-5743-a6e0-d58a232179b9'}, {'abstract': 'Will Power won his first IndyCar championship title; Alexis DeJoria beat John Force in the N.H.R.A. finals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/03/automobiles/motorsports-monday-labor-day-weekend-rewards-for-power-dejoria-kahne-and-marquez.html', 'snippet': 'Will Power won his first IndyCar championship title; Alexis DeJoria beat John Force in the N.H.R.A. finals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Will Power, capping what he said was 15 years of hard, often frustrating work, was officially crowned champion of the IndyCar series on Sunday at an awards ceremony in Los Angeles. Power had clinched the title by finishing ninth in the season finale Saturday in Fontana, Calif. His teammate, Helio Castroneves, needed to win the race to beat Power for the title. He came in second, foiled by a time-consuming stop-and-go penalty for a pit stop infraction. Tony Kanaan won the event.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/automobiles/03MOTORSPORTS-image/03MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/03/automobiles/03MOTORSPORTS-image/03MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/automobiles/03MOTORSPORTS-image/03MOTORSPORTS-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/automobiles/03MOTORSPORTS-image/03MOTORSPORTS-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 728,