yt://article/02a539ee-ff7e-56f8-ba7e-d7ebb27045fa', 'word_count': 2159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02a539ee-ff7e-56f8-ba7e-d7ebb27045fa'}, {'abstract': 'The designer, who has two children and is showing her spring/summer 2015 collection on Monday, shares recommendations for where to eat and hang out with youngsters (and how grown-ups can perk up, or at least look the part).', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/02/new-york-fashion-week-with-kids-travel-guide-milly-michelle-smith/', 'snippet': 'The designer, who has two children and is showing her spring/summer 2015 collection on Monday, shares recommendations for where to eat and hang out with youngsters (and how grown-ups can perk up, or at least look the part).', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York Fashion Week throws the work-life calculus into chaos for just about everyone in the industry. But its hectic schedule is especially challenging for parents of young children. The designer Michelle Smith of Milly, who will present her spring/summer 2015 collection on Monday and is also the mother of a seven-year-old girl\xa0and five-year-old boy, has more experience than most in navigating the unique demands of the week (which also coincides with back-to-school time).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/t-magazine/02milly-hartman/02milly-hartman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/02/t-magazine/02milly-hartman/02milly-hartman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/02/t-magazine/02milly-hartman/02milly-hartman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': N