s about articles in the newspaper that piqued his interest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gay Talese, best-selling author (and former Times reporter), has a white, low-slung 1957 TR3 convertible and a routine. “My routine is I get in the TR3 and drive to this gas station in Roxbury, Conn., early in the morning, get the paper and come back home. No one is up, the dogs are not up, the wife is not up, and for the next two and a half hours, I read the paper, alone.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/weekinreview/insider-talese/insider-talese-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 524, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/03/weekinreview/insider-talese/insider-talese-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 524}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/weekinreview/insider-talese/insider-talese-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 895, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/weekinreview/insider-talese/insider-talese-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1747, 'width': 1999, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/weekinreview/insider-talese/insider-talese-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/03/weekinreview/insider-talese/insider-talese-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/weekinreview/insider-talese/insider-talese-thumbLarge.j