/www.nytimes.com/2014/09/03/business/media/the-simpsons-marathon-lifts-ratings-for-fledgling-fxx.html', 'snippet': 'The 12-day, round-the-clock marathon, which also included the two-hour 2007 theatrical movie, produced ratings about three times as high as executives at the channel expected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A quarter-century ago, the animated comedy “The Simpsons” put the fledgling Fox network on the map as the fourth broadcast network. Now, with a much-promoted marathon of all 552 episodes that ended Monday, “The Simpsons” has repeated that feat, lifting a year-old cable channel called FXX to the top ranks of the 105 cable networks measured by the Nielsen Company.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/business/03SIMPSONS/03SIMPSONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 333, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/03/business/03SIMPSONS/03SIMPSONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 333}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/business/03SIMPSONS/03SIMPSONS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 568, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/business/03SIMPSONS/03SIMPSONS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1136, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/business/03SIMPSONS/03SIMPSONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/03/business/03SIMPSONS/03SIMPSONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/business/03SIMPSONS/03SIMPSONS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Simpsons’ Marathon Lifts Ratings for Fledgling FXX Network', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Homer’s Family Album Lifts Ratings for Fledgling FXX Network', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'FX (TV Network)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Simpsons (TV Program)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings (Audience Measurement)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-03T00:23:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cbf32b20-b667-5b05-959d-d8abf1cbd40b', 'word_count': 840, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cbf32b20-b667-5b05-959d-d8abf1cbd40b'}, {'abstract': 'The United States Justice Department said on Tuesday that it was investigating the death of Victor White III, 23, who died while in custody of Iberia Parish sheriff’s deputies in March.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/03/us/louisiana-us-joins-inquiry-into-death-in-police-car.html', 'snippet': 'The United States Justice Department said on Tuesday that it was investigating the death of Victor White III, 23, who died while in custody of Iberia Parish sheriff’s deputies in March.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States Justice Department said on Tuesday that it was investigating the death of Victor White III, 23, who died while in the custody of Iberia Parish sheriff’s deputies in March. The local coroner determined that his shooting death in the back of a police cruiser while his hands were cuffed was a suicide. His family has disputed details of the shooting and called for a federal investigation, comparing his death to the fatal police shooting of another young black man, Michael Brown, in Ferguson, Mo. The United States attorney for the Western District of Louisiana, Stephanie A. Finley, said on Tuesday that the F.B.I. had been “working parallel” with the current investigation by the Louisiana State Police, and that the federal investigation would “supplement, rather than supplant,” the state investigation. Officials from the F.B.I., the United States attorney’s office and the Justice Department’s Civil Rights Division will review the results of the investigation and determine whether to investigative further and whether any civil rights violation occurred, Ms. Finley said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Louisiana: U.S. Joins Inquiry Into Death in Police Car', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | South', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Louisiana: U.S. Joins Inquiry Into Death in Police Car', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fitzsimmons, Emma G', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Louisiana', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'White, Victor III', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-03T00:27:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emma G. Fitzsimmons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emma', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'Fitzsimmons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/c303cbdb-1888-50d4-a25c-a08e9ca17178', 'word_count': 171, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c303cbdb-1888-50d4-a25c-a08e9ca17178'}, {'abstract': 'Lida Moser excelled in capturing the realities of New York life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/09/03/arts/moser-lida-obit.html', 'snippet': 'Lida Moser excelled in capturing the realities of New York life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lida Moser excelled in capturing the realities of New York life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/arts/moser-lida-obit-slide-XC5U/moser-lida-obit-slide-XC5U-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 464, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/03/arts/moser-lida-obit-slide-XC5U/moser-lida-obit-slide-XC5U-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 464}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/arts/moser-lida-obit-slide-XC5U/moser-lida-obit-slide-XC5U-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 793, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/arts/moser-lida-obit-slide-XC5U/moser-lida-obit-slide-XC5U-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1585, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capt