 [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/a54d1c22-3b23-530c-8dcd-531c897f5be1', 'word_count': 891, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a54d1c22-3b23-530c-8dcd-531c897f5be1'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Moser’s photography captured the reality of life in New York City and she also created a classic series on rural Quebec in 1950.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/03/arts/lida-moser-photographer-with-an-urban-eye-dies-at-93.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Moser’s photography captured the reality of life in New York City and she also created a classic series on rural Quebec in 1950.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lida Moser, whose genre-spanning photographs appeared in magazines including Look, Esquire and Vogue during their heyday in the 1950s and ’60s and who went on to write about photography for The New York Times, died on Aug. 11 near her home in Rockville, Md. She was 93. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/arts/moser-lida-obit-slide-R8MS/moser-lida-obit-slide-R8MS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 557, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/03/arts/moser-lida-obit-slide-R8MS/moser-lida-obit-slide-R8MS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 557}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/arts/moser-lida-obit-slide-R8MS/moser-lida-obit-slide-R8MS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 951, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/arts/moser-lida-obit-slide-R8MS/moser-lida-obit-slide-