_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f87a45b4-6251-5e81-8a8b-f65a2e14ee77', 'word_count': 197, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f87a45b4-6251-5e81-8a8b-f65a2e14ee77'}, {'abstract': 'Television highlights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/03/arts/television/whats-on-tv-wednesday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '10 P.M. (Esquire) MY FRIENDS CALL ME JOHNNY Jean Pigozzi, below — the heir to a European automobile fortune, as well as a photographer, art collector, technology investor and creator of the men’s clothing brand LimoLand — hosts this new talk show, in which he interviews famous friends. In this premiere episode, he flies to Budapest for a small role in Brett Ratner’s latest film, “Hercules”; gets some tips in the art of seduction from the French writers Virginie Mouzat and Capucine Motte; and heads back to Los Angeles to interview Dov Charney, the recently deposed founder of American Apparel.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Wednesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Wednesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-03T05:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b2ad46e-0f0b-59d9-9fff-4e0266bdfaf7', 'word_count': 700, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b2ad46e-0f0b-59d9-9fff-4e0266bdfaf7'}, {'abstract': 'According to persons familiar with the league’s drug-testing results, the Denver Broncos’ wide receiver Wes Welker tested positive for a banned amphetamine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/03/sports/football/wes-welker-suspended-four-games-over-a-banned-substance.html', 'snippet': 'According to persons familiar with the league’s drug-testing results, the Denver Broncos’ wide receiver Wes Welker tested positive for a banned amphetamine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Less than a week before their season-opening clash with one of their principal rivals, the defending American Football Conference champion Denver Broncos learned Tuesday that wide receiver Wes Welker, a pivotal weapon in their offense, would be suspended four games for violating the N.F.L.’s policy on performing-enhancing substances.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/sports/Y-JP-WELKER/Y-JP-WELKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/03/sports/Y-JP-WELKER/Y-JP-WELKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/sports/Y-JP-WELKER/Y-JP-WELKER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 820, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/sports/Y-JP-WELKER/Y-JP-WELKER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1371, 'width': 1713, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/sports/Y-JP-WELKER/Y-JP-WELKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/03/sports/