battle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/04/business/international/lvmh-and-hermes-strike-deal-to-end-shareholder-dispute.html', 'snippet': 'The agreement would leave Bernard Arnault, the head of LVMH Moët Hennessy Louis Vuitton, with about 8.5 percent of Hermès International and end a bitter four-year battle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — It has been nearly four years since the fashion mogul Bernard Arnault shocked the French business world and added billions to his fortune by stealthily obtaining a large stake in Hermès, the jewel of the luxury world.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/business/04luxury-pic1/04luxury-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 924, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/04/business/04luxury-pic1/04luxury-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 924}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/business/04luxury-pic1/04luxury-pic1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 665, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/business/04luxury-pic1/04luxury-pic1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1330, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/business/04luxury-pic1/04luxury-pic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/04/business/04luxury-pic1/04luxury-pic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': N