roads, stone walls and little shops where the sales people know everyone by name.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/realestate/chappaqua-ny-a-hamlet-in-a-woodsy-setting.html', 'snippet': 'Changes may be on the horizon for this leafy hamlet with meandering country roads, stone walls and little shops where the sales people know everyone by name.', 'lead_paragraph': '“When I tell people we live in the woods, I really mean that,” said Paul Keyes, describing his life in Chappaqua in northern Westchester. “When I pull off the road after the long trip home from work and finally come up our driveway, I feel like I’ve gone on vacation to the Adirondacks.”', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chappaqua, N.Y.: A Hamlet in a Woodsy Setting', 'kicker': 'Living In', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Hamlet in a Woodsy Setting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chappaqua (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-03T15:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elsa Brenner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elsa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brenner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/25df90b7-ea9f-5447-9417-a3f7582adb99', 'word_count': 1304, 'uri': 'nyt://article/25df90b7-ea9f-5447-9417-a3f7582adb99'}, {'abstract': 'The New York Times continued our technology internship program this summer, and Danielle Rothermel, one of the interns in this year’s class, discusses what she learned.', 'web_url': 'https://open.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/03/real-world-development/', 'snippet': 'The New York Times continued our techno