 Kitsuné (in New York), Preen and Erdem (in London) and Ann Demeulemeester and Rick Owens (in Paris). An industry veteran who once ran the studio of the photographers Inez Van Lamsweerde and Vinoodh Matadin, Shelley divides his time between Vinegar Hill, Brooklyn, and the Venice Beach section of Los Angeles, where he escapes for regular surf trips. T caught up with Shelley between New York Fashion Week castings to hear his suggestions for on-the-go eating, dressing and functioning in style.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/t-magazine/03shelley-hartman-1/03shelley-hartman-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/03/t-magazine/03shelley-hartman-1/03shelley-hartman-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/t-magazine/03shelley-hartman-1/03shelley-hartman-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/t-magazine/03shelley-hartman-1/03shelley-hartman-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/t-magazine/03shelley-hartman-1/03shelley-hartman-1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/03/t-magazine/03shelley-hartman-1/03shelley-hartman-1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': 