p the steps and into their apartment. Chatting desultorily, weapon at the ready, the marauders steal money, photographs, letters, a watch, a cape, as their helpless victims look on, fearful and incredulous. The thieves are two “sexy” and “delectable” 16-year-old girls in tie-dye head scarves and lime-green earrings. Their names are Rainey Royal and Tina Dial, and they are best friends. The heist was a stunt, a game to test their loyalty to each other — “the wary warmth of equals” — a game that went too far.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/arts/04BOOKjp/04BOOKjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 734, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/04/arts/04BOOKjp/04BOOKjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 734}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/arts/04BOOKjp/04BOOKjp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 838, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/arts/04BOOKjp/04BOOKjp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1675, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/arts/04BOOKjp/04BOOKjp-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/04/arts/04BOOKjp/04BOOKjp-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/arts/04BOOKjp/04BOOKjp-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, '