Peter Dinklage!) and Fantasia: Music Evolved (Mozart! Lady Gaga!).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/arts/video-games/fall-arts-preview-destiny-alien-isolation-and-other-coming-releases.html', 'snippet': 'The new season comes with an array of promising video games, including Destiny (Paul McCartney! Peter Dinklage!) and Fantasia: Music Evolved (Mozart! Lady Gaga!).', 'lead_paragraph': 'Readers do not expect a year’s new crop of novels to eclipse the Western canon. Nor do filmgoers anticipate that this fall’s Oscar bait will surpass a century’s worth of cinema. Yet many video game players, wedded to notions of technological progress rather than artistic experimentation, believe that a new batch of consoles should be accompanied by a wave of games superior to all that came before.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '105', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07SUELLENTROP1/07SUELLENTROP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 355, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07SUELLENTROP1/07SUELLENTROP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 355}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07SUELLENTROP1/07SUELLENTROP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 606, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07SUELLENTROP1/07SUELLENTROP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1212, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07SUELLENTROP1/07SUELLENTROP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 