nt': 1236, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5baa7b2a-ff35-56af-b34d-ba692e63a865'}, {'abstract': 'Hollywood has finally realized that movies starring women can make major money, and a wave of sequels and new films with female protagonists is on its way.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/movies/fall-arts-preview-hollywood-has-realized-that-movies-starring-women-can-make-money.html', 'snippet': 'Hollywood has finally realized that movies starring women can make major money, and a wave of sequels and new films with female protagonists is on its way.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Hollywood has long known that women are better customers than men. It’s right there in the annual reports from the Motion Picture Association of America: Moviegoing in the United States and Canada was 52 percent female last year. Just as it was five years earlier.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '52', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07BARNES/07BARNES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 711, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07BARNES/07BARNES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 711}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07BARNES/07BARNES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 865, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07BARNES/07BARNES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1729, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07BARNES/07BARNES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_nam