nandez, Manny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Michael (1996-2014)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ferguson (Mo)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'St Louis Post-Dispatch', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Juvenile Delinquency', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Special Prosecutors (Independent Counsel)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCulloch, Robert P (1951- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-04T01:09:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manny Fernandez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fernandez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cdb70135-531f-5cc3-a6af-30e64f5430bd', 'word_count': 587, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cdb70135-531f-5cc3-a6af-30e64f5430bd'}, {'abstract': 'The Jewish roots and Israeli past of Steven J. Sotloff, a journalist from Miami, were kept hidden until hope for his survival was no longer possible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/04/world/middleeast/steven-sotloff-us-hostage-slain-by-isis-was-also-a-citizen-of-israel.html', 'snippet': 'The Jewish roots and Israeli past of Steven J. Sotloff, a journalist from Miami, were kept hidden until hope for his survival was no longer possible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — The beheading of Steven J. Sotloff, the American journalist from Miami who had been held hostage by the Islamic State in Iraq and Syria, suddenly loomed larger for many Israelis on Wednesday when it emerged that he held Israeli citizenship and had lived and studied in the country for a few years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/world/sotloff-2/sotloff-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/03/world/sotloff-2/sotloff-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/world/sotloff-2/sotloff-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/world/sotloff-2/sotloff-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/world/sotloff-2/sotloff-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/03/world/sotloff-2/sotloff-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/03/world/sotloff-2/sotloff-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Steven Sotloff, U.S. Hostage Slain by ISIS, Was Also a Citizen of Israel', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Hostage Killed by ISIS Was a Citizen of Israel, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sotloff, Steven J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations'