ct': 'The White Light Festival, which strives to explore the power of music and the arts to reveal a spiritual dimension, enters its fifth year with an enticing lineup.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/arts/music/fall-arts-preview-the-white-light-festival-seeks-the-cosmic-in-the-concert.html', 'snippet': 'The White Light Festival, which strives to explore the power of music and the arts to reveal a spiritual dimension, enters its fifth year with an enticing lineup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jane Moss, the artistic director of Lincoln Center, took a lot of kidding, even some carping, from concertgoers and critics when she inaugurated the White Light Festival in 2010. The lofty goal of this venture was to explore the power of music and the arts to reveal the dimensions of our inner lives. The programs, Ms. Moss asserted, would offer a “spectrum of artistic expression that moves us inward and expands our spirit.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '37', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07TOMMASINI1/07TOMMASINI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07TOMMASINI1/07TOMMASINI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07TOMMASINI1/07TOMMASINI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/arts/07TOMMASINI1/07TOMMASINI1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1455, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014