'}, {'abstract': 'Ali Hussein Kadhim, an Iraqi soldier, was captured with hundreds of other soldiers by Sunni militants in June. As a Shiite, he was marked for death. [Video includes graphic images.]', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/04/world/middleeast/surviving-isis-massacre-iraq-video.html', 'snippet': 'Ali Hussein Kadhim, an Iraqi soldier, was captured with hundreds of other soldiers by Sunni militants in June. As a Shiite, he was marked for death. [Video includes graphic images.]', 'lead_paragraph': 'DIWANIYA, Iraq — Ali Hussein Kadhim, an Iraqi soldier and a Shiite, was captured with hundreds of other soldiers by Sunni militants in June and taken to the grounds of a palace complex in Tikrit where Saddam Hussein once lived.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Escaping Death in Northern Iraq', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘A Great Will to Live’: How One Man Survived an ISIS Massacre', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arango, Tim', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kadhim, Ali Hussein', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tikrit (Iraq)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hussein, Saddam', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shiite Muslims', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sunni Muslims', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Iraqi Army', 'rank': 12