t': 'Murray used a barrage of baseline forehands to keep the match close, but he struggled through pain as Djokovic took command and advanced to his eighth straight semifinal in Flushing Meadows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andy Murray blasted forehands as he had perhaps never blasted forehands before. He played with fire and conviction, but there has rarely been a tennis champion better at absorbing pace and ambition than Novak Djokovic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/sports/tennis/05djokovic1/05djokovic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/05/sports/tennis/05djokovic1/05djokovic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 441}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/sports/tennis/05djokovic1/05djokovic1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/sports/tennis/05djokovic1/05djokovic1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1506, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/sports/tennis/05djokovic1/05djokovic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/05/sports/tennis/05djokovic1/05djokovic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/sports/tennis/05djokovic1/05djokovic1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge'