new-autocorrect-steal-your-soul/', 'snippet': 'A more sophisticated form of autocorrect is coming, and one philosopher worries it will harm the way we communicate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Autocorrect may fix some of your mistakes, and make some amusing ones of its own. But will its successor correct more than your spelling, essentially hijacking your personality?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Will the New Autocorrect Steal Your Soul?', 'kicker': 'Op-Talk', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-04T15:22:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anna North', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'North', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8e3cfa5-110e-58b4-af5e-d1818cdeefac', 'word_count': 870, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8e3cfa5-110e-58b4-af5e-d1818cdeefac'}, {'abstract': 'The hiring of a chief restructuring officer was part of a deal reached last month between the electric authority and its creditors.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/09/04/puerto-rico-said-to-hire-alixpartners-to-lead-restructuring-of-power-authority/', 'snippet': 'The hiring of a chief restructuring officer was part of a deal reached last month between the electric authority and its creditors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Puerto Rico’s electric power authority, which has been in negotiations with lenders over its debt burden, said on Thursday that it had hired the consulting firm AlixPartners to supervise its restructuring.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Rico/Rico-articleLarge-v2.jp