a', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shelton, Blake', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Country Music Assn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-04T16:21:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e2e83d2-a4f8-5434-b0da-13e17eb48a73', 'word_count': 258, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e2e83d2-a4f8-5434-b0da-13e17eb48a73'}, {'abstract': 'Jeff Alexander, president and chief executive of the Vancouver Symphony Orchestra, will take over as president of the Chicago Symphony Orchestra Association in January.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/04/chicago-symphony-association-names-a-new-president/', 'snippet': 'Jeff Alexander, president and chief executive of the Vancouver Symphony Orchestra, will take over as president of the Chicago Symphony Orchestra Association in January.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Chicago Symphony Orchestra Association had been searching for a new president since Deborah F. Rutter announced in December that she planned to leave in June to become president of the Kennedy Center. Now the board has named Jeff Alexander to the post, starting Jan. 12. The association oversees the orchestra and related entities.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chicago Symphony Association Names a New President', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alexander, Jeff', 