14/09/04/new-york-fashion-week-video-profile-rosetta-getty/', 'snippet': 'In this exclusive video, the designer gives T a glimpse into her creative process.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since launching her namesake ready-to-wear line last fall, the Los Angeles-based fashion designer Rosetta Getty has been quietly assembling a wardrobe of easy, elegant garments for women like her, who want to be able to seamlessly and stylishly transition from grade school drop-offs to after-work events. Instead of one-off looks, Getty creates collections that build off each previous season’s pieces, which lends a thoughtful cohesion to her line. As she prepared to unveil what’s next for spring 2015, Getty gave the filmmaker Marissa Kaiser a glimpse into her creative process on the eve of fashion week in New York.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rosetta Getty Prepares for New York Fashion Week', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-04T17:35:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kari Molvar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Molvar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/763bed60-b78d-5c13-ad39-1b2282cda5f6', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/763bed60-b78d-5c13-ad39-1b2282cda5f6'}, {'abstract': 'The Internet giant is the latest tech company to settle an FTC complaint that it didn’t do enough to block unexpected charges on smartphones.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/04/googles-f-t-c-tab-for-charges-rung-up-by-children-19-million/', 'snippet': 'The Internet giant is the latest tech company to settle an FTC complaint that it didn’t do enough to block unexpected charges on smartphones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here are some reasons people might not want children to play with their phones: They don’t want them to accidentally call their boss. They don’t want them to become mindless phone addicts like themselves. Also, they don’t want get stuck with a $200 bill for digital coins, virtual lives and other video game perks that cost real-world money.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Google/Google-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 443, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Google/Google-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 443}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Google/Google-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 756, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Google/Google-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1512, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Google/Google-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Google/Google-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Google/Google-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subT