nyt://article/463fd5a8-6463-509e-aafd-f3e596b7f32d'}, {'abstract': '“Kelly & Cal,” starring Juliette Lewis, centers on a punk rocker turned bored suburban mother who takes up with a 17-year-old in a wheelchair.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/05/movies/in-kelly-cal-a-restive-wife-bonds-with-a-teenager.html', 'snippet': '“Kelly & Cal,” starring Juliette Lewis, centers on a punk rocker turned bored suburban mother who takes up with a 17-year-old in a wheelchair.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The distance between riot grrrl and suburban mom is quite a stretch. But as middle age approaches, time has a way of landing mouthy young rebels in roles they never expected to inhabit. Take Juliette Lewis, the personification of scary defiance alongside Woody Harrelson as her partner in crime in “Natural Born Killers.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05KELLYCAL1/KELLYCAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05KELLYCAL1/KELLYCAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05KELLYCAL1/KELLYCAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05KELLYCAL1/KELLYCAL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05KELLYCAL1/KELLYCAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStand