article/422756e8-d042-57e4-bb85-3d17ee5926cf'}, {'abstract': 'Observers uncover how a combination of “unwitting racism” and unapologetic misogyny facilitated the sexual abuse of 1,400 minors in a North English town.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/04/how-rotherham-happened/', 'snippet': 'Observers uncover how a combination of “unwitting racism” and unapologetic misogyny facilitated the sexual abuse of 1,400 minors in a North English town.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the American ear, the town of Rotherham, nestled in the West Riding of Yorkshire, sounds romantically British. And while a cursory Google Image search reveals the redbrick rowhouses, idyllic front gardens and august churches one expects in such a locale, a quick glance at recent coverage of the town divulges its sinister underside.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/ROTHERDAM2/ROTHERDAM2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 598, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/ROTHERDAM2/ROTHERDAM2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 598}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/ROTHERDAM2/ROTHERDAM2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/ROTHERDAM2/ROTHERDAM2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/ROTHERDAM2/ROTHERDAM2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/