n India whose master plan was conceived by Le Corbusier and his team and built between 1951 and 1965.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amie Siegel: ‘Provenance’', 'kicker': 'Art in Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amie Siegel: ‘Provenance’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Siegel, Amie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-04T20:47:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/444f669b-9580-5bfb-8191-7d3ce18e34ff', 'word_count': 299, 'uri': 'nyt://article/444f669b-9580-5bfb-8191-7d3ce18e34ff'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Coffin uses them to recall utopian schemes from the ’60s and ’70s, from biospheres and eco-villages.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/05/arts/design/peter-coffin-living.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Coffin uses them to recall utopian schemes from the ’60s and ’70s, from biospheres and eco-villages.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the basement of Red Bull’s lavish studio facilities in Chelsea is the latest iteration of Peter Coffin’s best-known work: “Music for Plants,” a project started in 2002 in which a wall of plants, nestled under the sidewalk grating — the original version was actually a greenhouse — is accompanied by music specially commissioned from Pauline Oliveros, Yoko Ono, Alice Coltrane, Arto Lindsay, Laurie Anderson, Sonic Youth and other artists.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Peter Coffin: ‘Living’', 'kicker': 'Art in Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Peter Coffin: ‘Living’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coffin, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-04T20:47:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha Schwendener', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schwendener', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/32fe398b-8ef7-5d4b-8ff7-10728ae6e08d', 'word_count': 255, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32fe398b-8ef7-5d4b-8ff7-10728ae6e08d'}, {'abstract': 'Rory Kennedy’s documentary “Last Days in Vietnam” examines the fall of Saigon and the evacuation of Americans and Vietnamese.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/05/movies/last-days-in-vietnam-looks-at-fall-of-saigon.html', 'snippet': 'Rory Kennedy’s documentary “Last Days in Vietnam” examines the fall of Saigon and the evacuation of Americans and Vietnamese.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perhaps the most striking thing about “Last Days in Vietnam,” Rory Kennedy’s eye-opening documentary about the 1975 evacuation of the American Embassy in Saigon, is how calmly it surveys what was once among the angriest topics in American political life. The story is full of emotion and danger, heroism and treachery, but it is told in a mood of rueful retrospect rather than simmering partisan rage. Ms. Kennedy, whose uncle John F. Kennedy expanded American involvement in Vietnam and whose father, Robert F. Kennedy,  became one of the ensuing war’s most passionate critics, explores its final episode with an open mind and lively curiosity. There are old clips that have never been widely seen and pieces of information that may surprise many viewers.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05SUBJPLASTDAYS2/SUBJPLASTDAYS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05SUBJPLASTDAYS2/SUBJPLASTDAYS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05SUBJPLASTDAYS2/SUBJPLASTDAYS2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05SUBJPLASTDAYS2/SUBJPLASTDAYS2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1383, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05SUBJPLASTDAYS2/SUBJPLASTDAYS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05SUBJPLASTDAYS2/SUBJPLASTDAYS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/arts/05SUBJPLASTDAYS2/SUBJPLASTDAYS2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Witnesses to the Collapse', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Witnesses to the Collapse', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kennedy, Rory', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vietnam War', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Last Days in Vietnam (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-04T20:48:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/85230557-2367-5257-a616-d28053f876ee', 'word_count': 712, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85230557-2367-5257-a616-d28053f876ee'}, {'abstract': 'Photos from Ukraine, Germany, Indonesia and Brooklyn', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/04/pictures-of-the-day-ukraine-and-elsewhere-51/', 'snippet': 'Photos from Ukraine, Germany, Indonesia and Brooklyn', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photos from Ukraine, Germany, Indonesia and Brooklyn.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/20140904POD-slide-EDVN/20140904POD-slide-EDVN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/20140904POD-slide-EDVN/20140904POD-slide-EDVN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/20140904POD-slide-EDVN/20140904POD-slide-EDVN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/20140904POD-slide