54203a3'}, {'abstract': 'The rules the Federal Reserve approved this week are intended to ensure that banks have enough ready liquidity to survive a crisis of 30 days, which proved not to be the case in the 2008 crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/05/business/fed-rules-tighten-what-banks-can-count-as-an-asset.html', 'snippet': 'The rules the Federal Reserve approved this week are intended to ensure that banks have enough ready liquidity to survive a crisis of 30 days, which proved not to be the case in the 2008 crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The total capital ratio is well in excess of the 10 percent regulatory threshold.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Norris/Norris-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Norris/Norris-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Norris/Norris-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 820, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Norris/Norris-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1640, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Norris/Norris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/05/business/Norris/Norris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cr