ion Week was a busy one. Here’s a recap of what happened, traced through the Styles staff’s Twitter feeds.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/04/new-york-fashion-week-social-media-roundup-day-1/', 'snippet': 'The first day of New York Fashion Week was a busy one. Here’s a recap of what happened, traced through the Styles staff’s Twitter feeds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Though Thursday was the official beginning of New York Fashion Week, models walking the shows have had the event on their mind for weeks, if not for months. To prevent their excitement from turning into stress, Donna Karan hosted a healthy breakfast and reminded them to stay Zen. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Fashion Week Social Media Roundup, Day 1', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'September Fashion Week (2014)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-04T23:59:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Valeriya Safronova', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Valeriya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Safronova', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b00701c3-fe97-5719-8125-6d7ca2496857', 'word_count': 299, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b00701c3-fe97-5719-8125-6d7ca2496857'}, {'abstract': 'Vanessa Friedman, the fashion director and chief fashion critic for The Times and The International New York Times begins a month-long season of covering the new collections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2014/09/04/fashion-week-the-timess-fashion-director-revs-up-for-the-runways/', 'snippet': 'Vanessa Friedman, the fashion director and chief fashion critic for The Times and The International New York Times begins a month-long season of covering the new collections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s Fashion Week in New York City, which marks the beginning of a month-long season of runway shows and collection presentations in New York, London, Milan and Paris. Vanessa Friedman, the fashion director and chief fashion critic for The Times and The International New York Times will be there.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/insider-vanessa2/insider-vanessa2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/insider-vanessa2/insider-vanessa2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/insider-vanessa2/insider-vanessa2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/insider-vanessa2/insider-vanessa2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1096, 'width': 1645, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/insider-vanessa2/insider-vanessa2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/04/blogs/insider-vanessa2/insider-vanessa2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/04/