a, U.S. Reports', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Strikes Killed Militant Chief in Somalia, U.S. Reports', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Somalia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Shabab', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmitt, Eric', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Godane, Ahmed Abdi', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gettleman, Jeffrey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Targeted Killings', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-05T15:48:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helene Cooper, Eric Schmitt and Jeffrey Gettleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmitt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gettleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dbc36f14-7732-5957-b2d2-b82ba1a36ba2', 'word_count': 955, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dbc36f14-7732-5957-b2d2-b82ba1a36ba2'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama escalated the response to the Islamic State in Iraq and Syria on Friday, recruiting allies to help crush the group and outlining a strategy that echoes the war on terror.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/06/world/middleeast/us-and-allies-form-coalition-against-isis.htm