7-831a-dedb21ef6d76', 'word_count': 906, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1fd041d-2a0b-5d77-831a-dedb21ef6d76'}, {'abstract': 'The brand puts final touches on a retrospective exhibition, co-curated by Carolina Herrera, and introduces the 75th design in its numbered cuff series.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/05/american-jeweler-verdura-celebrates-75th-birthday-with-exhibit/', 'snippet': 'The brand puts final touches on a retrospective exhibition, co-curated by Carolina Herrera, and introduces the 75th design in its numbered cuff series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, the American fine jeweler Verdura celebrates its 75th anniversary. To mark the occasion, the brand is putting the final touches on “The Power of Style: Verdura at 75,” an exhibition that opens next month in a new gallery space adjacent to its Fifth Avenue flagship. Over 150 jewels and objets d’art by the company’s late founder, Duke Fulco di Verdura, will be on view alongside over a selection of designs, paintings and photographs from the company’s archives.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/5verdura_beddie/5verdura_beddie-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/5verdura_beddie/5verdura_beddie-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/5verdura_beddie/5verdura_beddie-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/5verdura_beddie/5verdura_beddie-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1514, 'width': 2048, 'subT