on in resolving problems that retail investors may have” with the agency.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/09/05/s-e-c-names-first-ombudsman/', 'snippet': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has chosen Tracey L. McNeil, an agency veteran and former corporate lawyer, to “act as a liaison in resolving problems that retail investors may have” with the agency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Investors are a fussy sort, quick to gripe about a shady broker here or a new regulation there. Now someone will actually have the job of listening to them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'S.E.C. Names First Ombudsman', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Madoff, Bernard L', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-05T19:41:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3af552e3-8cf5-5e3d-a082-7429899573ad', 'word_count': 378, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3af552e3-8cf5-5e3d-a082-7429899573ad'}, {'abstract': 'A photo tour of available condos and houses ranging in price from $1.75 to $3.695 million.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/realestate/homes-for-sale-in-san-francisco.html', 'snippet': 'A photo tour of available condos and houses ranging in price from $1.75 to $3.695 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Click on the slide show to see this week’s featured properties:', 'so