nippet': 'Images by the photographer Arlene Gottfried are featured in “East Village Our Village,” an exhibit that reopens at the Lower Eastside Girls Club on Sept. 11.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is a certain warmth in Arlene Gottfried’s photos of East Harlem, the Lower East Side of Manhattan and Williamsburg, Brooklyn. It is not necessarily nostalgia for a bygone era, but a true appreciation for the kind of neighborhood life that gave those places a distinct feel before waves of gentrification pushed up rents and pushed out locals.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Her Villages', 'kicker': 'Album', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Her Villages', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gonzalez, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gottfried, Arlene', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Village (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Williamsburg (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Harlem (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lower Eastside Girls Club', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-05T20:38:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gonzalez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gonzalez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/728bb1bd-02cd-5c18-9410-76a5bfe35bf5', 'word_count': 319, 'uri': 'nyt://article/728bb1bd-02cd-5c18-9410-76a5bfe35bf5'}, {'abstract': 'There is a lot to like about the 2014 Volkswagen Tiguan, but when stacked up against competi