'persons', 'value': 'Krauss, Clifford', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fines (Penalties)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gulf of Mexico Oil Spill (2010)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-05T23:18:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By Clifford Krauss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Clifford', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krauss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aac92a58-c2d4-53ad-bb8d-5fdfb4f02c5e', 'word_count': 880, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aac92a58-c2d4-53ad-bb8d-5fdfb4f02c5e'}, {'abstract': 'The makeup artist Diane Kendal created a dewy eyeliner effect for a gaze reminiscent of her current muse, the British actress Charlotte Rampling.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/05/new-york-fashion-week-spring-summer-2015-makeup-pointers-at-jason-wu/', 'snippet': 'The makeup artist Diane Kendal created a dewy eyeliner effect for a gaze reminiscent of her current muse, the British actress Charlotte Rampling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Makeup artists often slick on creams and colors in ways that seem natural to their tribe but are rather unexpected for the rest of us. Consider the British pro Diane Kendal. Backstage at Jason Wu this morning, she traced Lancôme Le Crayon Khôl in Black Coffee, a dark brown liner, around models’ eyes, then grabbed some Q-Tips, dipped them in face cream and partially removed the strokes she had just laid down. It was puzzling until Kendal explained what she was doing. “The cream takes off some of the liner and leaves a beautiful residue and sheen on the lid,” she said. “This gives you that soft, dewy effect.” Another surprise: dabbing on Lancôme Aquatique Waterproof Eyecolour Base in Sienne, a brown primer of sorts, in lieu of eye shadow to define the eyes, without being obvious about it. The final look hinted at the cool, smoldering gaze of Kendal’s muse-of-the-moment: British actress Charlotte Rampling. Or any woman, for that matter, who is “sexy but in a natural, effortless way,” Kendal added.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/05beauty-jasonwu/05beauty-jasonwu-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/05beauty-jasonwu/05beauty-jasonwu-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/05beauty-jasonwu/05beauty-jasonwu-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/05beauty-jasonwu/05beauty-jasonwu-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1287, 'width': 1931, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/05beauty-jasonwu/05beauty-jasonwu-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/05beauty-jasonwu/05beauty-jasonwu-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/05/t-magazine/05beauty-jasonwu/05beauty-jasonwu-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 15