7, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d43700cb-3025-5073-8485-7a0e8ce0a0c3'}, {'abstract': 'What is the lure of a finished relationship? And how do you get over it?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/fashion/how-to-get-over-that-ex.html', 'snippet': 'What is the lure of a finished relationship? And how do you get over it?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The God of Love, Plato wrote in “The Symposium,” “lives in a state of need.” Nowhere is this need more palpable and vibrant than in the lover who pines for an ex: to have once reached the mountaintop but now to find oneself deep in the valley is to fully apprehend the limited charms that lie at the intersection of flop sweat and a truculent burro.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/fashion/31CIRCANOW/31CIRCANOW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 189, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/31/fashion/31CIRCANOW/31CIRCANOW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 189}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/fashion/31CIRCANOW/31CIRCANOW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 322, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/fashion/31CIRCANOW/31CIRCANOW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/fashion/31CIRCANOW/31CIRCANOW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/31/fashion/31CIRCANOW/31CIRCANOW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidt