he crime rate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/06/opinion/the-secure-communities-illusion.html', 'snippet': 'A federal program intended to improve public safety by deporting unauthorized immigrants convicted of crimes had no effect on the crime rate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who could fault a program with a name like “Secure Communities”? This is the federal initiative, begun under President George W. Bush and vastly expanded by President Obama, to make sure that everyone arrested by local police anywhere in the country has his or her immigration status checked. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The ‘Secure Communities’ Illusion', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The ‘Secure Communities’ Illusion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crime and Criminals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deportation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Homeland Security Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-06T01:04:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/abb7b425-4090-5b47-b452-3d14412ecb2c', 'word_count': 540, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abb7b425-4090-5b47-b452-3d14412ecb2c'}, {'abstract': ' Having won her semifinal against Ekaterina Makarova in one hour, Williams is poised to capture her third U.S. Open title in a row. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/06/sports/tennis/with-a-youthful-ferocity-sere