had yet to meet two measures to ensure that their activities are peaceful.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/06/world/middleeast/iran-fails-to-address-all-nuclear-concerns-un-says.html', 'snippet': 'Prospects for an agreement over Iran’s nuclear program appeared to suffer a setback when a United Nations monitoring agency said the Iranians had yet to meet two measures to ensure that their activities are peaceful.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prospects for an international agreement over Iran’s disputed nuclear program appeared to suffer a setback Friday when a United Nations monitoring agency said the Iranians had yet to meet two of five confidence-building measures to ensure that their activities are purely peaceful.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iran Fails to Address All Nuclear Concerns, U.N. Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iran Fails to Address All Nuclear Concerns, U.N. Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Atomic Energy Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uranium', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Energy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rouhani, Hassan', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-06T01:20:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Harney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'repor