told reporters on Friday that he had been subpoenaed to testify at a court hearing related to efforts by his unofficial driver to recover a video showing the mayor smoking crack cocaine. The driver, Alexander Lisi, was charged with extortion in connection with his efforts to recover the video, apparently made by drug dealers. Mr. Ford, who declined to comment further, will be required to appear next spring at a hearing to determine if there is enough evidence to send Mr. Lisi’s case to trial. Mr. Ford has confessed to smoking crack and excessive drinking. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Toronto Mayor Called to Testify in Canada', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | The Americas', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Canada: Toronto Mayor Called to Testify', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ford, Robert B', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Austen, Ian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Toronto (Ontario)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocaine and Crack Cocaine', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-06T02:16:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Austen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Austen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/2ec76476-52c4-5f46-981f-7bddb37d3cc5', 'word_count': 101, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ec76476-52c4-5f46-981f-7bddb37d3cc5'}, {'abstract': 'Ordinary, a bar opened a year and a half ago in a vaunted historic space in New Haven, serves salty, savory dishes that stand up to complex cocktails and robust draft beers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/nyregion/a-review-of-ordinary-in-new-haven.html', 'snippet': 'Ordinary, a bar opened a year and a half ago in a vaunted historic space in New Haven, serves salty, savory dishes that stand up to complex cocktails and robust draft beers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Outside New York City, good bar food can be dismayingly hard to find. Manhattan and Brooklyn proprietors have been nudging their bar menus into artisanal territory for a while; in the suburbs, though, many offerings seem stuck in a pre-Food Network wasteland of greasy wings and defrosted mozzarella sticks. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 