hion Week in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/06/new-york-fashion-week-spring-summer-2015-model-josephine-van-delden-transforms-backstage-at-suno/', 'snippet': 'The photographer Greg Kessler captures behind-the-scenes beauty transformations during Spring 2015 Fashion Week in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The photographer Greg Kessler captures behind-the-scenes beauty transformations during Spring 2015 Fashion Week in New York. Here, the model Waleska Gorczevski before (left) and after (right) makeup by Alice Lane and hair by Odile Gilbert.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Josephine van Delden Transforms Backstage at Suno', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gilbert, Odile', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SUNO (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-06T16:04:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Greg Kessler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Greg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kessler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2c9c47f-a309-5b25-b6e6-ad6df08f101e', 'word_count': 56, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2c9c47f-a309-5b25-b6e6-ad6df08f101e'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The New York Herald remains in Paris, despite the War.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/06/1914-despite-war-new-york-herald-to-stay-in-paris/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The New York Herald remains in Paris, despite the War.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Beginning with this issue, the price of the HERALD will be 25 centimes daily, instead of 15 centimes. The reasons for the increase are obvious. Owing to the war, advertisements, the main source of revenue for a newspaper, have almost completely disappeared. The HERALD at present is, therefore, being run at a loss of close upon 35,000 francs a week. That may be journalism, but it is not business. Consequently, the HERALD has to choose between suspending publication or raising its price.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/blogs/08iht-Retrospective-Herald/08iht-Retrospective-Herald-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/08/blogs/08iht-Retrospective-Herald/08iht-Retrospective-Herald-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/blogs/08iht-Retrospective-Herald/08iht-Retrospective-Herald-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/blogs/08iht-Retrospective-Herald/08iht-Retrospective-Herald-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1470, 'width': 2036, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/blogs/08iht-Retrospective-Herald/08iht-Retrospective-Herald-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/08/blogs/08iht-Retrospective-Herald/08iht-Retrospective-Herald-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/blogs/08iht-Retrospective-Herald/08iht-Retrospective-Herald-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1914: Despite War, ‘New York Herald’ to Stay in Paris', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War I (1914-18)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-06T16:09:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a18b7109-56a7-570a-8338-752d4d5fcb0c', 'word_count': 324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a18b7109-56a7-570a-8338-752d4d5fcb0c'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama’s determination to move deliberately and line up support from allies before confronting threats means that he has sometimes appeared to be a spectator to events outside his control.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/world/europe/as-crises-pile-up-a-president-sticks-to-his-deliberative-approach.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama’s determination to move deliberately and line up support from allies before confronting threats means that he has sometimes appeared to be a specta