town where Michael Brown was killed should extend to neighboring towns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Justice Department took a much-needed step last week when it opened a broad civil rights investigation into police practices in Ferguson, Mo., where the killing of Michael Brown, an unarmed black teenager, by a white police officer last month sparked days of demonstrations and riots. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Justice in St. Louis County', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Justice in St. Louis County', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ferguson (Mo)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Michael (1996-2014)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'St Louis (Mo)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Maplewood (Mo)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holder, Eric H Jr', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search and Seizure', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Minorities', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-06T18:34:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id':