bstract': 'Chicago and Elena Delle Donne will face Phoenix and Brittney Griner in the W.N.B.A. finals when the best-of-five series begins Sunday in Arizona.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/sports/basketball/two-young-stars-lead-teams-to-wnba-finals.html', 'snippet': 'Chicago and Elena Delle Donne will face Phoenix and Brittney Griner in the W.N.B.A. finals when the best-of-five series begins Sunday in Arizona.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Travel perks are scarce in the W.N.B.A., which requires its teams to fly in coach class to limit costs. So Elena Delle Donne of the Chicago Sky, who has been bothered lately by a sore back, felt especially grateful Friday morning as she settled into her seat on the Sky’s flight to Phoenix.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/sports/DOG-wnba/DOG-wnba-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/07/sports/DOG-wnba/DOG-wnba-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/sports/DOG-wnba/DOG-wnba-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/sports/DOG-wnba/DOG-wnba-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/sports/DOG-wnba/DOG-wnba-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/07/sports/DOG-wnba/DOG-wnba-thumbStandard.jp