ing that her funeral took place in the middle of a period of high fashion, in between shows for Victoria Beckham and Diane von Furstenberg.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/one-last-appearance-at-fashion-week-for-joan-rivers/', 'snippet': 'It seemed fitting that her funeral took place in the middle of a period of high fashion, in between shows for Victoria Beckham and Diane von Furstenberg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was perhaps fitting that the funeral for Joan Rivers at Temple Emanu-El on Sunday morning took place smack dab in the middle of New York Fashion Week, in between shows for Victoria Beckham and Diane von Furstenberg.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Last Appearance at Fashion Week for Joan Rivers', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivers, Joan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fifth Avenue (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-07T18:34:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jacob Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jacob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5fd45e7c-bd5b-553b-8651-26716ceb132c', 'word_count': 475, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5fd45e7c-bd5b-553b-8651-26716ceb132c'}, {'abstract': 'For the designer’s spring/summer 2015 runway, the French makeup artist Tom Pecheux perfected natural violet eye makeup with layers of “bruisey” colors.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/07/new-york-fashion-week-spring-summer-2015-the-purple-haze-on-eyes-at-derek-lam/', 'snippet': 'For the designer’s spring/summer 2015 runway, the French makeup artist Tom Pecheux perfected natural violet eye makeup with layers of “bruisey” colors.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I like when beauty has a little twist to it,” said the French makeup artist Tom Pecheux backstage this morning. When workshopping the concept behind the beauty look at Derek Lam, Pecheux tried a few different options for the designer. “The first was all natural, no makeup, blah blah,” he said. “The girl looked like a flat wheel. So I said, ‘Let’s try a nude color,’ which was pretty but boring.” Eventually the face painter grabbed a rich violet color and smudged it over the lids: et voilà, that did the trick. “Derek said, ‘Oooh, I like that!’\u2009” exclaimed Pecheux, with an amused smile. Still, the “bruisey” shade, as Pecheux described it, required careful application. To avoid the illusion of being punched in the face, he traced MAC Fluidline in Deep Deep Brown along the upper lashes, then brushed on MAC Lipstick in Violetta, creating a soft pinky-lavender wash over the lids and up to the brows. “The lipstick is bright, so you only need a thin layer,” he insisted. To finish, he swept on a metallic taupe eye shadow, then etched a thin streak of white kohl pencil under the eyes to lend contrast. The last step: sheering out everything with his hands. “This is your best friend,” Pecheux said, waving his finger in the air. “Using your fingers with makeup brings so much sensuality and femininity to the face, and that’s what I want for spring and summer.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/t-magazine/07beauty-lam/07beauty-lam-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/07/t-magazine/07beauty-lam/07beauty-lam-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/t-magazine/07beauty-lam/07beauty-lam-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/t-magazine/07beauty-lam/07beauty-lam-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/t-magazine/07beauty-lam/07beauty-lam-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/07/t-magazine/07beauty-lam/07beauty-lam-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/t-magazine/07beauty-lam/07beauty-lam-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Get the Purple Hazy Eyes at Derek Lam', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lam, Derek', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-07T18:38:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kari Molvar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Molvar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3963ddf8-a25c-54c3-a219-6e514feb7432', 'word_count': 257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3963ddf8-a25c-54c3-a219-6e514feb7432'}, {'abstract': 'As a boy, Nishikori, now a finalist at the Open, left the comfort of Japan for the unfamiliar and more competitive American tennis scene.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/08/sports/tennis/us-open-2014-for-kei-nishikori-a-bold-move-to-chase-a-tennis-dream.html', 'snippet': 'As a boy, Nishikori, now a finalist at the Open, left the comfort of Japan for the unfamiliar and more competitive American tennis scene.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — Kei Nishikori is the first Japanese man to reach a Grand Slam singles final, but in Japan he is seen as a most un-Japanese sports hero.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/NISHIKORI/NISHIKORI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 789, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/NISHIKORI/NISHIKORI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 789}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/NISHIKORI/NISHIKORI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 780, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/NISHIKORI/NISHIKORI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1994, 'width': 1517, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/NISHIKORI/NISHIKORI-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':