2014/09/07/u-s-open-2014-caroline-wozniacki-vs-serena-williams-live-blog/', 'snippet': 'Serena Williams hopes to salvage what has been a disappointing year (by only her lofty standards) Sunday, looking to win her first Grand Slam title of the year, against Caroline Wozniacki in the United States Open women’s final.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Serena Williams further secured her place in history, winning her sixth United States Open title by defeating Caroline Wozniacki, 6-3, 6-3. The title was Williams’s 18th overall at a Grand Slam, matching the number won by Chris Evert and Martina Navratilova. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Open 2014: Caroline Wozniacki vs. Serena Williams Live Blog', 'kicker': 'Sports', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wozniacki, Caroline', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-07T19:56:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/487e7d9a-d3c7-514a-897a-d3810d9c94cf', 'word_count': 1549, 'uri': 'nyt://article/487e7d9a-d3c7-514a-897a-d3810d9c94cf'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama takes a moment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/08/opinion/heng-obama-the-thinker.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama takes a moment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Obama takes a moment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': Non