ches of bright color.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Making Art on the Spot and on the Fly', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Making Art on the Spot and on the Fly', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madison Square Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Madison Square Park Conservancy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Herring, Oliver', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-07T21:34:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Grimes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grimes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a41ece16-9e65-509d-b1fd-e8f01703089f', 'word_count': 1270, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a41ece16-9e65-509d-b1fd-e8f01703089f'}, {'abstract': 'A full and enthusiastic house showed up Saturday night for a performance by the Mazzini Dance Collective.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/08/arts/dance/mazzini-dance-brings-star-power-to-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'A full and enthusiastic house showed up Saturday night for a performance by the Mazzini Dance Collective.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a beloved former member of the Paul Taylor Dance Company, Annmaria Mazzini already has a loyal audience, or so it seemed on Saturday night at the Ailey Citigroup Theater, where a full and enthusiastic house turned out for a performance by her three-year-old troupe,