://article/73b2fcb8-eea5-5cad-adf0-f36b88dffa55'}, {'abstract': 'The disease appears to be on the rise again, and miners face addition distress over legalistic requirements that deny them benefits for years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/08/opinion/miners-battle-black-lung-and-bureaucracy.html', 'snippet': 'The disease appears to be on the rise again, and miners face addition distress over legalistic requirements that deny them benefits for years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Black lung disease, the lethal hazard for coal miners that was thought to be on the wane, is far from finished. Autopsies of 24 miners who died in the Upper Big Branch mine explosion four years ago found that 17 of them had black lung, the crippling respiratory disease that left generations of miners hooked up to oxygen tanks. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Miners Battle Black Lung, and Bureaucracy ', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Miners Battle Black Lung, and Bureaucracy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coal', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black Lung Disease', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-08T00:08:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/646f4e50-19e6-50b6-9056-02cd0cb6cd0b', 'word_count': 348, 'uri': 'nyt://article/646f4e50-19e6-50b6-9056-02cd0cb6cd0b'}, {'abstract': 'What Eli Manning and his new offensive coordinator can or cannot achieve is the major subplot of the Giants’ first game of the year (and it may be the story of their season).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/08/sports/football/giants-new-tandem-eager-to-prove-itself.html', 'snippet': 'What Eli Manning and his new offensive coordinator can or cannot achieve is the major subplot of the Giants’ first game of the year (and it may be the story of their season).', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Nine months ago, Eli Manning and Ben McAdoo barely knew each other. On Monday night in Detroit, though, their fates will be joined. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/GIANTS/GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/GIANTS/GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 467}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/GIANTS/GIANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 797, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/GIANTS/GIANTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1285, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/GIANTS/GIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/GIANTS/GIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/sports/GIANT