/2014/09/08/new-york-fashion-week-social-media-roundup-days-3-and-4/', 'snippet': 'It was a steamy weekend filled with fashion-related excitement. Here’s a recap of what happened, traced through the Styles staff’s Twitter feeds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this weekend’s heat and humidity, walking even short distances drew the risk of profuse outbreaks of sweat. Undeterred, fashion’s devotees took over the streets of Manhattan, their outfits unaffected by the weather. After all, there were shows to see — and at which to be seen. Saturday began with Lacoste and moved through Prabal Gurung, Ralph Rucci, Alexander Wang and Altuzarra. Sunday brought an even more packed schedule and a bevy of highlights: a model of the canine variety at Hood by Air; a dance performance at Tracy Reese; an unfortunate tumble at Thakoon; a supermodel from an earlier era at Diane von Furstenberg; and a one-act play at Opening Ceremony. The shows overflowed with celebrities, some of whom took a break to pay their respects to the queen of the red carpet, Joan Rivers, whose funeral took place Sunday afternoon. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Fashion Week Social Media Roundup, Days 3 and 4', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'September Fashion Week (2014)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Altuzarra, Joseph', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Campbell, Naomi', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fanning, Elle', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goldberg, Whoopi', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jonze, Spike', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': '