s on a Triangle discussion I realized it was probably time to run the challenge as our main feature. Here’s how the Canadian mathematician John McKay phrased the problem in a recent email to me:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/crosswords/bugs-on-square/bugs-on-square-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/07/crosswords/bugs-on-square/bugs-on-square-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/crosswords/bugs-on-square/bugs-on-square-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/crosswords/bugs-on-square/bugs-on-square-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/07/crosswords/bugs-on-square/bugs-on-square-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/07/crosswords/bugs-on-square/bugs-on-square-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bugs on a Square', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mathematics', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puzzles', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McKay, John (1939- )', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-08T16:00:55+0000', 'document_type': '