sed on Oct. 28.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Flaming Lips Reveal Guest List for ‘Sgt. Pepper’s’ Cover Album', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cyrus, Miley', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lennon, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beatles, The', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Flaming Lips (Music Group)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oklahoma', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-08T17:06:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7c536e8-1025-58f3-97ea-bdb73a107db4', 'word_count': 357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7c536e8-1025-58f3-97ea-bdb73a107db4'}, {'abstract': 'Denny’s adds cocktails to the menu of its first Manhattan restaurant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/10/dining/dennys-comes-to-manhattan-with-a-bar-menu.html', 'snippet': 'Denny’s adds cocktails to the menu of its first Manhattan restaurant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tommy’s Margarita. Denny’s. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/dining/10DENNYS1/10DENNYS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/10/dining/10DENNYS1/10DENNYS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight