g/white-lyan-in-east-london-a-bar-beyond-the-status-quo.html', 'snippet': 'A motivation for the White Lyan in East London was ingredient and production control, born of the question, “Is this the best version of the drinks we want to put out?”', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — More so than drinkers in American cocktail capitals like New York and San Francisco, barflies in London seem to like their drink with a side of theater. Artesian, a bar inside the luxe Langham Hotel, delivers its creations with a clown-car-full of circus tricks, from balloons filled with scent to actual smoke and mirrors. Nightjar, a speakeasy in East London, sends drinks out in vessels shaped like owls and top hats. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/dining/10LONDONSIDE/10LONDONSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/10/dining/10LONDONSIDE/10LONDONSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/dining/10LONDONSIDE/10LONDONSIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/dining/10LONDONSIDE/10LONDONSIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/dining/10LONDONSIDE/10LONDONSIDE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/10/dining/10LONDONSIDE/10LONDONSIDE-thumbStandard