aodong, a human rights activist accused of assembling a crowd to disrupt public order, will begin in southern China this week, his lawyer and his sister said on Tuesday. They said Mr. Yang, who has long been at the forefront of contentious causes, would fight the charge but acknowledged that he was likely to be convicted and imprisoned.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trial of Chinese Human Rights Campaigner Is to Begin', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yang Maodong', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-09T07:23:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0603b3ca-4982-553d-ab61-dbe3be019b91', 'word_count': 707, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0603b3ca-4982-553d-ab61-dbe3be019b91'}, {'abstract': 'Below are six paragraphs from the Aug. 29 essay about texting, “Bubbles Carry a Lot of Weight.” We have dropped a word in each paragraph. Can you choose the best one for each blank?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/09/test-yourself-texting-anxiety-caused-by-little-bubbles/', 'snippet': 'Below are six paragraphs from the Aug. 29 essay about texting, “Bubbles Carry a Lot of Weight.” We have dropped a word in each paragraph. Can you choose the best one for each blank?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Belo