s horrific news story after horrific news story. Does this inevitably lead to “compassion fatigue,” and if so, how can we fight it?', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/09/how-much-of-the-worst-summer-of-news-ever-can-you-take/', 'snippet': 'This summer has given us horrific news story after horrific news story. Does this inevitably lead to “compassion fatigue,” and if so, how can we fight it?', 'lead_paragraph': 'In case you’ve been living under a rock, this summer has been full of catastrophic news. Since June, Boko Haram has continued to kidnap girls and women in northeastern Nigeria, Ukrainian separatists shot down Malaysia Flight 17, the death toll in Syria surpassed 190,000 and thousands of children from Central America trekked to the United\xa0States border to flee unprecedented violence.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/opinion/nyto-open/nyto-open-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/08/opinion/nyto-open/nyto-open-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 601}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/opinion/nyto-open/nyto-open-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 861, 'width': 860, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/opinion/nyto-open/nyto-open-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 861, 'width': 860, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/08/opinion/nyto-open/nyto-open-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images