pg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Zac Posen: Seams, Shoulders and Sway', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Posen, Zac', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shipka, Kiernan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-09T13:20:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Jacobs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jacobs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/264ae217-71e6-5239-ac9c-87f4880ed06f', 'word_count': 400, 'uri': 'nyt://article/264ae217-71e6-5239-ac9c-87f4880ed06f'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Belgians flooded a battlefield to halt a German advance in 1914.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/09/1914-belgians-flood-battlefield/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Belgians flooded a battlefield to halt a German advance in 1914.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANTWERP\xa0— It is possible now to realize what took place on Saturday and on Sunday [Sept. 6] in the combat at Termonde. There were about 7,000 Belgians, and they had to retire after a stiff fight. Having been reinforced, they returned to the fray, and the Germans had to retire whence they had come. Then the defenders flooded the country by opening the dykes, and the retreating Teutons were caught. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Sept. 10, 1914', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multi