ng of the event.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Finally, Apple’s product announcements have arrived. But for anyone wanting to watch the live-streaming, well, it’s extremely awkward.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/blogs/apple-stream/apple-stream-articleLarge.png', 'height': 336, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/09/blogs/apple-stream/apple-stream-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 336}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/blogs/apple-stream/apple-stream-jumbo.png', 'height': 430, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/blogs/apple-stream/apple-stream-superJumbo.png', 'height': 430, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/blogs/apple-stream/apple-stream-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/09/blogs/apple-stream/apple-stream-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/blogs/apple-stream/apple-stream-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Apple’s Live-Streaming Is Terrible', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-09T17:57:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'B