ht-footed entrance by Kevin Kline as an American in Paris give the early scenes of “My Old Lady” the feel of a Franco-American comedy in the vein of Cédric Klapisch’s recent “Chinese Puzzle.” But the 75-year-old playwright Israel Horovitz’s screen adaptation of his own 2002 production is not what it initially appears to be. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/arts/MYOLD/MYOLD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 274, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/10/arts/MYOLD/MYOLD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 274}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/arts/MYOLD/MYOLD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/arts/MYOLD/MYOLD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 924, 'width': 2026, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/arts/MYOLD/MYOLD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/10/arts/MYOLD/MYOLD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/arts/MYOLD/MYOLD-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Apartment in the Marais, With Complications and Family Secrets ', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Apartment in the Marais, With Complications and Family Secrets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Horovitz, Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kline, Kevin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Maggie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'My Old Lady (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott Thomas, Kristin', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-09T17:58:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/2997deb5-7192-5f5f-bc8d-2c2552aefcb0', 'word_count': 539, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2997deb5-7192-5f5f-bc8d-2c2552aefcb0'}, {'abstract': 'Jordan Hart, 31, of New York, was charged on Tuesday in a conspiracy to sell prescription painkillers to Derek Boogaard, the former Rangers player who died of an overdose in 2011.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/10/sports/hockey/man-indicted-on-charges-of-selling-prescription-pills-to-derek-boogaard.html', 'snippet': 'Jordan Hart, 31, of New York, was charged on Tuesday in a conspiracy to sell prescription painkillers to Derek Boogaard, the former Rangers player who died of an overdose in 2011.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two weeks before he died of an overdose in 2011, Derek Boogaard of the Rangers was excused from his substance-abuse rehabilitation in California and returned to New York. He drove to Long Island, as he had done many times in the months before, and paid a man for illegally obtained prescription painkillers. This time, rather than cash, Boogaard paid with a personal check.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/sports/10boogaard/10boogaard-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/10/sports/10boogaard/10boogaard-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/sports/10boogaard/10boogaard-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/sports/10boogaard/10boogaard-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/sports/10boogaard/10boogaard-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/10/sports/10boogaard/10boogaard-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/sports/10boogaard/10boogaard-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Player Charged in Sale of Pills to Derek Boogaard', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ex-Player Charged in Sale of Pills to Boogaard', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hart, Jordon (1983- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'va