cker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Film Festival', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gere, Richard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hawke, Ethan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-09T18:13:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6fe3f09b-b708-50ce-968b-e9cef9d6ba1b', 'word_count': 224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6fe3f09b-b708-50ce-968b-e9cef9d6ba1b'}, {'abstract': 'A new surge of refugees has arrived in Tunisia as fighting has spread to the Libyan capital, Tripoli. Their accounts depict a country spiraling into chaos.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/10/world/africa/libya-refugees-tunisia-tripoli.html', 'snippet': 'A new surge of refugees has arrived in Tunisia as fighting has spread to the Libyan capital, Tripoli. Their accounts depict a country spiraling into chaos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SFAX, Tunisia — Libyans seeking medical care and a refuge from war are filling the private clinics in this coastal Tunisian city for the second time in three years, bringing with them fresh accounts of the violence racking their country.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Libyan Refugees Stream to Tunisia for Care, and Tell of a Home That Is Torn Apart', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Libyan Refugees Stream to Tunisia for Care, and Tell of a Home That Is Torn Apart', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gall, Carlotta', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Libya', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tunisia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Qaddafi, Muammar el-', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tripoli (Libya)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sfax (Tunisia)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-09T18:19:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carlotta Gall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carlotta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/455073b5-20f3-5f4c-9f66-043b1c8623ba', 'word_count': 894, 'uri': 'nyt://article/455073b5-20f3-5f4c-9f66-043b1c8623ba'}, {'abstract': 'In its latest monthly forecast, the federal Climate Prediction Center said that while El Niño was still expected, it would not bring the heavy rains California needs to end its drought.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/10/science/earth/el-nino-california-drought.html', 'snippet': 'In its latest monthly forecast, the federal Climate Prediction Center said that while El Niño was still expected, it would not bring the heavy rains California needs to end its drought.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Long-term weather forecasters say it is now unlikely that a strong El Niño will develop this fall, dimming hopes in California for heavy rains that might bring relief from a severe drought.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hopes for a Strong El Niño Fade in California', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hopes for a Strong El Niño Fade in California', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drought', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricanes and Tropical Storms', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'El Nino Southern Oscillation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-09T18:19:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Henry Fountain', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Henry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fountain', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6dd752af-4a38-5c18-b4ec-1a1427e429e7', 'word_count': 603, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6dd752af-4a38-5c18-b4ec-1a1427e429e7'}, {'abstract': 'The weather phenomenon known as El Niño can cause dramatic effects around the world. Henry Fountain explains where it comes from.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/science/100000003102629/how-it-happens-el-nio.html', 'snippet': 'The weather phenomenon known as El Niño can cause dramatic effects around the world. Henry Fountain explains where it comes from.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The weather phenomenon known as El Niño can cause dramatic effects around the world. Henry Fountain explains where it comes from.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/multimedia/how-it-happens-el-nino/how-it-happens-el-nino-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subTyp