ame': 'Henry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fountain', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Aaron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Byrd', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Laffin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/69d40665-eb72-5df3-806c-af510d39b046', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/69d40665-eb72-5df3-806c-af510d39b046'}, {'abstract': 'Backstage, the makeup artist James Kaliardos created a look infused with the designers’ own beauty tricks.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/09/rodarte-eyebrows-new-york-fashion-week-beauty-trends-spring-summer-2015/', 'snippet': 'Backstage, the makeup artist James Kaliardos created a look infused with the designers’ own beauty tricks.', 'lead_paragraph': "The makeup artist James Kaliardos has lent his face-painting skills to the Rodarte designers Kate and Laura Mulleavy for so many seasons now that he jokes, “we almost have a psychic connection.” And backstage at Rodarte’s spring/summer 2015 fashion show today, the runway look he created was evidence of that bond. On the eyes, he buffed a dark pink-brown tone from the new Nars St-Paul-De-Vence Duo Eyeshadow palette over the lid, pulling the shade around the outer corners in a downward arc. “It’s inspired by how Laura does her makeup,” Kaliardos noted of the quirky technique. “She does this thing where she drags down the corner of her eye shadow, and I thought, ‘That’s kinda cool.'” Underneath, he traced a thin line of Nars Larger Than Life Long-Wear Eyeliner in Rue Bonaparte to “lift up the eyes” and dusted on a gold metallic shade for a little glitz. But the real attention-getter: the faux piercings that half the models wore on their brows. “They’re just cool facial accessories,” Kaliardos said of the silver rings adhered with glue. The model Kristina Petrosiute appreciated the (temporary) shock value. “I took a photo and sent it to my boyfriend,” she said. “He was like, ‘You look weird!’ But I like it!” For Xiao Wen Ju, the experience might even lead to some real piercings. “The eyebrow is not my style, but maybe I would do the lip,” she said. “I think the lip is really sexy.”", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/t-magazine/09beauty-molvar/09beauty-molvar-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/09/t-magazine/09beauty-molvar/09beauty-molvar-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/t-magazine/09beauty-molvar/09beauty-molvar-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/t-magazine/09beauty-molvar/09beauty-molvar-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/t-magazine/09beauty-molvar/09beauty-molvar-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/09/t-magazine/09beauty-molvar/09beauty-molvar-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/09/t-magazine/09beauty-molvar/09beauty-molvar-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'h