ri': 'nyt://video/df1aa2fa-bf64-5967-b67a-4a1f716a4b69'}, {'abstract': 'The National Transportation Safety Board also found other errors that contributed to a crash that is reopening a debate about fatigue for pilots hauling packages.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/10/us/ups-plane-crash-ntsb.html', 'snippet': 'The National Transportation Safety Board also found other errors that contributed to a crash that is reopening a debate about fatigue for pilots hauling packages.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Short of sleep, confused about their altitude and relying on inaccurate weather information, the crew members of a UPS cargo plane trying to land at the airport in Birmingham, Ala., omitted several crucial steps that might have kept them from flying their aircraft into the ground in August 2013, investigators of the National Transportation Safety Board said Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/us/10CRASH/10CRASH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 348, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/10/us/10CRASH/10CRASH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 348}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/us/10CRASH/10CRASH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 593, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/us/10CRASH/10CRASH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1159, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/us/10CRASH/10CRASH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbn