onservation in one part of the country is not enough,” said Daniel M. Ashe, director of the Fish and Wildlife Service. “We have to see the larger picture of conservation.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Federal Report Describes Trouble for Some Birds', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Washington', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Federal Report Describes Trouble for Some Birds', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schneider, Elena', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Birds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North America', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fish and Wildlife Service', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Audubon Society, National', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-10T03:32:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elena Schneider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schneider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3f0ed48-c8b0-5e57-b8a6-94554393fc68', 'word_count': 149, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3f0ed48-c8b0-5e57-b8a6-94554393fc68'}, {'abstract': 'The executive editor of The Times answered questions from David Carr, a media columnist, and Times Premier subscribers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/10/insider/events/dean-baquet-on-israel-coverage-innovation-and-the-web.html', 'snippet': 'The executive editor of The Times answered questions from David Carr, a media columnist, and Times Premier subscribers.'