ken string of seasons in black.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — From a distance it is a blue speck in a sea of forest green at U.S. Cellular Field. Up close, near the left-field bullpen, the fourth seat in the seventh row of Section 159 is not much to see. It is an original model from this park, its color faded, its armrests lower than those of its neighbors. It sits a little more upright, too, and its back has no cup holder.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/sports/KONERKO/KONERKO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/11/sports/KONERKO/KONERKO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/sports/KONERKO/KONERKO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 626, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/sports/KONERKO/KONERKO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1251, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/sports/KONERKO/KONERKO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/11/sports/KONERKO/KONERKO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/sports/KONERKO/KONERKO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sou