-lost-love-emerges-amid-china-japan-tensions/', 'snippet': 'Nearly 70 years after they parted, a Chinese veteran is on a quest to find a Japanese woman he met shortly after World War II. His tale offers a warmer recollection of that era.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The story of a Chinese veteran’s love for a Japanese woman he met shortly after World War II and his quest nearly 70 years later to learn what happened to her has been widely circulating on Chinese websites in recent days.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Story of Lost Love Emerges Amid China-Japan Tensions', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cultural Revolution', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chiang Kai-shek', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East China Sea', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hangzhou (China)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Taiwan', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-10T10:44:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Austin Ramzy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Austin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramzy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/df4b5def-9017-544e-879a-dd6be9e10026', 'word_count': 728, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df4b5def-9017-544e-879a-dd6be9e10026'}, {'abstract': 'Shows from Michael Ko