3927, 'uri': 'nyt://article/193fcbac-b679-5133-90d5-127bc4dd03e7'}, {'abstract': 'A new report takes several countries to task for not following through on promises to research the background of art that may have been looted from Jews during World War II.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/11/arts/design/lax-efforts-on-wartime-looted-art-criticized-in-new-report.html', 'snippet': 'A new report takes several countries to task for not following through on promises to research the background of art that may have been looted from Jews during World War II.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Italian government has long used impassioned pleas, considerable research and international public pressure to support its demands, which were often successful, for the repatriation of its art and antiquities patrimony lost through looting. But in a report published Wednesday, Italy is identified as one of the countries doing the least to research or identify items that may been looted from Jews during World War II.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/arts/11LOOTED/11LOOTED-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 531, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/11/arts/11LOOTED/11LOOTED-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 531}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/arts/11LOOTED/11LOOTED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 907, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/arts/11LOOTED/11LOOTED-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1814, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit