country’s three big mobile service providers that the new devices would not be available on Sept. 19, when sales start elsewhere.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/11/business/international/release-of-iphone-6-delayed-in-china.html', 'snippet': 'Apple told the country’s three big mobile service providers that the new devices would not be available on Sept. 19, when sales start elsewhere.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Apple is facing a potential setback in China, one of its biggest and fastest-growing markets, after the much-anticipated introductions here of the new iPhone models were delayed.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/iPhonechina/iPhonechina-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 512, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/11/business/iPhonechina/iPhonechina-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 512}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/iPhonechina/iPhonechina-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 874, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/iPhonechina/iPhonechina-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1144, 'width': 1340, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/iPhonechina/iPhonechina-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/11/business/iPhonechina/iPhonechina-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLar