d on the Swedish Liberal Party member to focus on working toward “a reasonable and balanced” trans-Atlantic trade deal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/11/business/international/nomination-of-cecilia-malmstrom-to-be-eu-trade-envoy-signals-reviving-interest-in-us-talks.html', 'snippet': 'Jean-Claude Juncker called on the Swedish Liberal Party member to focus on working toward “a reasonable and balanced” trans-Atlantic trade deal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The selection of Cecilia Malmstrom on Wednesday to be Europe’s new trade chief suggests that Jean-Claude Juncker, the president-elect of the European Commission, is eager to restart stalled talks with the United States on the creation of a trade partnership.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11eucommissioner-malmstrom/11eucommissioner-malmstrom-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 922, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11eucommissioner-malmstrom/11eucommissioner-malmstrom-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 922}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11eucommissioner-malmstrom/11eucommissioner-malmstrom-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 667, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11eucommissioner-malmstrom/11eucommissioner-malmstrom-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1333, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11eucommissioner-malmstrom/11eucommissioner-malmstrom-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 