ional/jean-claude-juncker-seeks-to-streamline-brussels-bureaucracy.html', 'snippet': 'The incoming president of the European Union’s executive branch, in nominating a new cabinet of commissioners, aims to appease a disenchanted public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — Jean-Claude Juncker, the incoming president of the European Union’s executive branch, sought to make his mark on Brussels on Wednesday, nominating a slate of new commissioners. But he also reduced their autonomy by adding a layer of oversight.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11JUNCKER/11JUNCKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 498, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11JUNCKER/11JUNCKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 498}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11JUNCKER/11JUNCKER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 849, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11JUNCKER/11JUNCKER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1515, 'width': 1827, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11JUNCKER/11JUNCKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11JUNCKER/11JUNCKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/business/11JUNCKER/11JUNCKER-thumbLarge.jpg'