n-week-spring-summer-2015-normcore-locks-at-hugo-boss/', 'snippet': 'Jason Wu’s minimalist collection was complemented by the models’ perfectly tame, freshly combed hair.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The beauty looks seen at this New York Fashion Week have been romantic, fun and experimental (especially Rodarte’s pierced brows and Marc by Marc Jacobs’s Bjork-ish buns). For most of us mere mortals, though, spring is really about fresh, glowing skin and effortless locks. At today’s Hugo Boss show, Jason Wu’s minimalist collection was complemented by the models’ clean, dewy makeup: nude lips, a barely-there dusting of taupe shadow. And on day seven of shows, there was something undeniably palate-cleansing about the Abbey Lee’s perfectly tame, freshly combed blonde hair, parted down the middle like a schoolgirl’s.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/t-magazine/10do-boss-gilchrist/10do-boss-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/10/t-magazine/10do-boss-gilchrist/10do-boss-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/t-magazine/10do-boss-gilchrist/10do-boss-gilchrist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 750, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/t-magazine/10do-boss-gilchrist/10do-boss-gilchrist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 750, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/t-magazine/10do-boss-gilchrist/10do-boss-gilchrist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height