, intended to oust Taliban forces from a part of Kunar Province in Afghanistan, and the single-day strike that turned into nine days of intense combat, killing six American soldiers. (Above, a memorial service.) Mike Boettcher “knew those men, puts faces to their names,” Daniel M. Gold wrote in The New York Times about this documentary, directed by David Salzberg and Christian Tureaud. “As he says, every soldier’s story is different, and they all bear telling.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Thursday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Thursday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-11T05:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d7285d7-37db-5214-a356-1cbae1ace4bb', 'word_count': 695, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d7285d7-37db-5214-a356-1cbae1ace4bb'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, September 11, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/11/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-thursday-september-11-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, September 11, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“This is a core principle of my presidency: If you threaten America, you will find no safe haven.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, September 11, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date