en.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/11/when-laughter-is-bad-for-your-bank-account/', 'snippet': 'A new study suggests that watching a funny video could lead to financial mistakes — especially in men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Much coverage of money and happiness has focused on whether the former leads to the latter. But a new study\xa0suggests we might want to turn the question around: Could feeling good make you lose money?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/opinion/nyto-laugh/nyto-laugh-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/10/opinion/nyto-laugh/nyto-laugh-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/opinion/nyto-laugh/nyto-laugh-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1014, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/opinion/nyto-laugh/nyto-laugh-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2028, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/opinion/nyto-laugh/nyto-laugh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/10/opinion/nyto-laugh/nyto-laugh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/opinion/nyto-laugh/nyto-laugh-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Laughter Is Bad for Your Bank Account', 'kicker': 'Op-Talk', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pacific Standard (Magazine)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-11T09:00:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anna North', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'North', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d72c9691-662b-5ea5-9bcf-2915982ad176', 'word_count': 559, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d72c9691-662b-5ea5-9bcf-2915982ad176'}, {'abstract': 'Spurred by scenes of northern Iraq’s refugee crisis, Lynsey Addario soon found the story had become about the battle with violent Islamic fundamentalists.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/11/facing-isis-and-evil-in-iraq/', 'snippet': 'Spurred by scenes of northern Iraq’s refugee crisis, Lynsey Addario soon found the story had become about the battle with violent Islamic fundamentalists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometimes when I am photographing a major news event, I am suddenly overwhelmed by helplessness. One day I am at home, watching dramatic images of Iraqi Yazidis fleeing for their lives being aired nonstop on 24-hour news channels. Days later, I am there, staring at tens of thousands of displaced Iraqis and feeling a 35-millimeter frame cannot capture the scope of devastation and heartbreak before me. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/blogs/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/10/blogs/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/blogs/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/blogs/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1396, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/blogs/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/10/blogs/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/10/blogs/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY/20140910-lens-addario-slide-82VY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Facing ISIS and Evil in Iraq', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'valu