ceptions of China are at a record high in the study.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/11/signs-of-hope-in-chinese-attitudes-toward-japan/', 'snippet': 'An annual survey showed a slight improvement in the way Chinese respondents view their Asian neighbors. However, in Japan, negative perceptions of China are at a record high in the study.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago this week, protesters marched outside the Japanese Embassy in Beijing denouncing Japan’s nationalization of uninhabited islands in the East China Sea claimed by both China and Japan. In other Chinese cities, looters stormed Japanese businesses and owners of Japanese cars were attacked.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/world/11sino-japan01/11sino-japan01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/11/world/11sino-japan01/11sino-japan01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/world/11sino-japan01/11sino-japan01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/world/11sino-japan01/11sino-japan01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1305, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/world/11sino-japan01/11sino-japan01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/11/world/11sino-japan01/11sino-japan01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thum