{'abstract': 'Michael R. Roskam discusses a sequence from his film.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/11/toronto-2014-michael-r-roskam-narrates-a-scene-from-the-drop/', 'snippet': 'Michael R. Roskam discusses a sequence from his film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO —In the thriller “The Drop,” Tom Hardy plays a Brooklyn bartender with secrets. The film is adapted by Dennis Lehane from his short story “Animal Rescue.” In this video, the director Michael R. Roskam narrates a sequence from the film that reveals a little more to this bartender than meets the eye.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Toronto 2014: Michael R. Roskam Narrates a Scene From ‘The Drop’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hardy, Tom', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roskam, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-11T15:05:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9bb18c98-0c1c-57cd-bffa-29579680080f', 'word_count': 53, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9bb18c98-0c1c-57cd-bffa-29579680080f'}, {'abstract': 'Since 1995, the average number of Atlantic hurricanes has risen to eight, although the last two years have been relatively quiet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/upshot/a-hurricane-in-1964-and-what-came-after.html', 'snippet': 'Since 1995, the average number of Atlantic hurricanes has risen to eight, although the last two years have been relatively quiet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times has converted all of its 1964 issues into a digitized, searchable for