thern Delicacies, with the not-so-helpful English addendum China Local Cuisine. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Mystery of Chinatown', 'kicker': 'Hungry City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Mystery of Chinatown', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mishan, Ligaya', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chinatown (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taste of Northern China (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-11T17:33:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ligaya Mishan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ligaya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mishan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ca10802-5135-5195-9f12-dcf6eea3fdfd', 'word_count': 690, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ca10802-5135-5195-9f12-dcf6eea3fdfd'}, {'abstract': 'Ben Ratliff and Jon Pareles discuss the new U2 album, released this week for free in iTunes.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/11/popcast-u2s-songs-of-innocence-gift-or-spam/', 'snippet': 'Ben Ratliff and Jon Pareles discuss the new U2 album, released this week for free in iTunes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week on Popcast: Jon Pareles on the U2 album you most likely own, like it or not. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/arts/artsbeat-u2/artsbeat-u2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/arts/artsbeat-u