alth Organization said that the number of Ebola cases in the country was 62, up from 31 a week earlier, and that more than half the afflicted patients had died.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The number of Ebola cases in the Democratic Republic of Congo doubled over the past week to 62, the World Health Organization reported Thursday, and more than half the afflicted patients have died.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ebola Cases Rise Rapidly in Congo', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ebola Cases Rise Rapidly in Congo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Congo, Democratic Republic of (Congo-Kinshasa)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Liberia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sierra Leone', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guinea', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nigeria', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Monetary Fund', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-11T18:18:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f618b8c-a861-5414-b968-7298fa0e2b61', 'word_count': 325, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f618b8c-a861-5414-b968-7298fa0e2b61'}, {'abstract': 'It’s hard to win N.F.L. games in Denver, especially when you voluntarily give up possession of the ball.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/upshot/how-the-colts-hurt-themselves.html', 'snippet': 'It’s hard to win N.F.L. games in Denver, especially when you voluntarily give up possession of the ball.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Everything seemed to be going well for the Colts in the first minutes against the Broncos on Sunday. The Colts received the opening kickoff and needed only five plays to take the ball to the Broncos’ 36-yard line. Then the evils of fourth-down decision-making changed the game.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/upshot/12up-bot/12up-bot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/upshot/12up-bot/12up-bot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/upshot/12up-bot/12up-bot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/upshot/12up-bot/12up-bot-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/upshot/12up-bot/12up-bot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/12/upshot/12up-bot/12up-bot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/upshot/12up-bot/12up-bot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 15