exhibition at the Brooklyn Museum, drives home the notion that shoes are one of visual culture’s most freighted artifacts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/arts/design/a-feast-of-killer-shoes-at-the-brooklyn-museum.html', 'snippet': '“Killer Heels,” a sweeping exhibition at the Brooklyn Museum, drives home the notion that shoes are one of visual culture’s most freighted artifacts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For me, the high point of the recent Emmy Awards broadcast was the sight of Sarah Silverman gathering up the voluminous skirts of her stunning dark-green gown and, in bare feet, dashing up to the stage, taking the steps two at a time. There, she accepted a writing award for her HBO comedy special “We Are Miracles,” her physical exuberance having already conveyed her excitement and even gratitude.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fantasies From Pandora’s Shoe Box', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fantasies From Pandora’s Shoe Box', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Museum', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ferragamo, Salvatore, Italia SpA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miu Miu', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Prada SpA', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Louboutin, Christian', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-11T21:13:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roberta Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roberta', 'middlename': None, 'la