ove surprisingly engaging, and not so simple after all. A case in point is “I Am Eleven,” a charming documentary by Genevieve Bailey built of interviews with 11-year-olds in 15 countries.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/arts/IAMELEVEN3/IAMELEVEN3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 859, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/arts/IAMELEVEN3/IAMELEVEN3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 859}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/arts/IAMELEVEN3/IAMELEVEN3-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 716, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/arts/IAMELEVEN3/IAMELEVEN3-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2002, 'width': 1399, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/arts/IAMELEVEN3/IAMELEVEN3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/12/arts/IAMELEVEN3/IAMELEVEN3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/arts/IAMELEVEN3/IAMELEVEN3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Now 11 Is the New 14, and the New 8', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'I Am Eleven', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 