: 446, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab827877-c3f8-5bdd-be8d-80f87ff1b665'}, {'abstract': 'New York Fashion Week ended on Sept. 11 with shows from Hugo Boss, Calvin Klein and Proenza Schouler, and some oblique acknowledgment of the day. Boss held its show at 4 World Trade Center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/fashion/new-york-fashion-week-hugo-boss-calvin-klein-proenza-schouler.html', 'snippet': 'New York Fashion Week ended on Sept. 11 with shows from Hugo Boss, Calvin Klein and Proenza Schouler, and some oblique acknowledgment of the day. Boss held its show at 4 World Trade Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fact that the final day of the New York collections also happened to be Sept. 11 is the sort of jarring coincidence that portends a collision of worlds: On that day, in this city, a tragedy occurred. Remembering it, how can we sit merrily by and look at skirts? It seems an impossible disconnect.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/fashion/12REVIEW6/12REVIEW6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/fashion/12REVIEW6/12REVIEW6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/fashion/12REVIEW6/12REVIEW6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 715, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/fashion/12REVIEW6/12REVIEW6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1431, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/fashion/12REVIEW6/