ousands of city renters who rely on public subsidies are being forced to pay more for housing or move into smaller spaces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/nyregion/budget-cuts-reshape-new-yorks-public-housing.html', 'snippet': 'Thousands of city renters who rely on public subsidies are being forced to pay more for housing or move into smaller spaces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The crushing news came less than a year after Diane Robinson and her 24-year-old son moved into an airy two-bedroom apartment in the Bronx. The city, which helps pay her rent, wrote this summer to say she would have to downsize into a one-bedroom apartment or pay $240 more a month in rent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/nyregion/12DOWNSIZINGsub/12DOWNSIZINGsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/nyregion/12DOWNSIZINGsub/12DOWNSIZINGsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/nyregion/12DOWNSIZINGsub/12DOWNSIZINGsub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 657, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/nyregion/12DOWNSIZINGsub/12DOWNSIZINGsub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1313, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/nyregion/12DOWNSIZINGsub/12DOWNSIZINGsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/12/nyregion/12DOWNSIZINGs