 'nyt://article/9d069f6c-fa83-5aff-92dc-bd316a3eaae5'}, {'abstract': 'Sotheby’s is planning to auction a trove that once belonged to Rachel Lambert Mellon, the matriarch of a family whose holdings rivaled some of America’s most well-known dynasties.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/arts/design/bunny-mellon-good-taste-is-a-boon-to-sothebys.html', 'snippet': 'Sotheby’s is planning to auction a trove that once belonged to Rachel Lambert Mellon, the matriarch of a family whose holdings rivaled some of America’s most well-known dynasties.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UPPERVILLE, Va. — Few people have ever visited Oak Spring Farms, the grand home here of Rachel Lambert Mellon, better known as Bunny. If they had, they would have seen a Pissarro, unframed like a flea market find, above the living room fireplace. Upstairs, a still life by van Gogh hung above her bathtub. Antique porcelains — cabbages, asparagus, artichokes — were artfully arranged on practically every surface.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bunny Mellon’s Keen Eye Is a Boon to Sotheby’s', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bunny Mellon’s Keen Eye Is a Boon to Sotheby’s', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vogel, Carol', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mellon, Rachel Lambert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sotheby's", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wills and Estates', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-12T02:22:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72eaf89d-0840-5840-97b8-cbc2ab02649e', 'word_count': 1399, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72eaf89d-0840-5840-97b8-cbc2ab02649e'}, {'abstract': 'Oiselle, a women’s sports apparel brand, took the unusual approach of launching its spring 2015 line using professional runners on the runway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/sports/runners-take-the-place-of-models-during-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'Oiselle, a women’s sports apparel brand, took the unusual approach of launching its spring 2015 line using professional runners on the runway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The models at the Oiselle fashion show in New York this week were the first to admit it: They were more at home on a running track than on a runway.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/Y-RUNNERS-1/Y-RUNNERS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/Y-RUNNERS-1/Y-RUNNERS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/Y-RUNNERS-1/Y-RUNNERS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/Y-RUNNERS-1/Y-RUNNERS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1312, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/Y-RUNNERS-1/Y-RUNNERS-1-thu