o is pitching and if the team’s bullpen is spent.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1491, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/sports/CITY-METS/CITY-METS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nationals Help Turn Mets’ Thoughts to Next Year ', 'kicker': 'Nationals 6, Mets 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nationals Help Turn Mets’ Thoughts to Next Year', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National League', 'r