courage recruitment was announced amid a growing Western-led drive to galvanize countries around the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/13/world/europe/germany-bans-support-of-isis.html', 'snippet': 'The crackdown on displays of the ISIS flag and activities that encourage recruitment was announced amid a growing Western-led drive to galvanize countries around the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Germany on Friday announced a ban on activities that support the Islamic State in Iraq and Syria, including any displays of its black flag, as part of an effort to suppress the extremist group’s propaganda and recruitment work among Germans.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Germany Bans Support for ISIS', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Germany Bans Support of ISIS', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Maiziere, Thomas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-12T11:51:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Eddy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eddy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a975d5ed-bdad-5d40-985b-103b1965952d', 'word_count': 264, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a975d5ed-bdad-5d40-985b-103b1965952d'}, {'abstract': 'A Texas-based big data company says New York takes top billing this year.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/new-york-vs-london-which-city-wins-the-fashion-buzz-wars/', 'snippet': 'A Texas-based big data company says New York takes top billing this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the fashion flock moves to London and Part Two of the fashion marathon, competition is heating up between the two cities for the new-ish accolade “Top Fashion Buzzword for 201\u200b4.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/fashion/13runway/13runway-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/13/fashion/13runway/13runway-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/fashion/13runway/13runway-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/fashion/13runway/13runway-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1151, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/fashion/13runway/13runway-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/13/fashion/13runway/13runway-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/fashion/13runway/13runway-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Vs. London: Which City Wins the Fashion Buzz Wars?', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Data-Mining and Database 