', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonah Weiner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3d73394-0006-56a8-a9bd-339a0afa033a', 'word_count': 356, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3d73394-0006-56a8-a9bd-339a0afa033a'}, {'abstract': 'What my relatives and I found when we got lost.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/14/magazine/the-family-that-strays-together.html', 'snippet': 'What my relatives and I found when we got lost.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was 75 degrees out and sunny. My sister-in-law decided that the afternoon was perfect for a hike, so my mother consulted her woefully outdated Appalachian Mountain Club guide, which she treats with a reverence that others reserve for the Bible; to her, revelations are contained in its pages.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '66', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/magazine/14lives/14lives-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 438, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/14/magazine/14lives/14lives-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 438}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/magazine/14lives/14lives-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 748, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/magazine/14lives/14lives-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1203, 'width': 1647, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/magazine/14live