sician and producer combines samples from YouTube videos', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/kutiman-returns-with-more-youtube-sampling-madness/', 'snippet': 'A new piece by the stylistically omnivorous musician and producer combines samples from YouTube videos', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Ophir Kutiel, a stylistically omnivorous musician and producer based in Tel Aviv, conventional sampling – taking a musical fragment from an existing recording to help build a new one – is kids’ stuff. Mr. Kutiel, who performs and records under the name Kutiman, has transformed sampling into a multimedia art, building his songs from bits of YouTube clips – the video as well as the audio – with amateur and instructional videos as his favored sources. He plans to post “ThruYOU Too,” his second collection of these pieces, on his YouTube page on Oct. 1. In the meantime, he is posting one song, “Give It Up” today as a teaser.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kutiman Returns With More YouTube Sampling Madness', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Sampling Madness, as Seen on YouTube', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kutiman (1982- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-12T14:59:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57e037b4-a148-5203-90fa-7dd871857c4b', 'word_count': 455, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57e037b4-a148-5203-90fa-7dd871857c4b'}, {'abstract': 'As city’s 60-plus population grows, landlords and co-op boards are confronting a host of new challenges.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/14/realestate/elderly-new-yorkers-here-for-the-duration.html', 'snippet': 'As city’s 60-plus population grows, landlords and co-op boards are confronting a host of new challenges.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chuck and Cindy Nemser have lived in a townhouse in Park Slope for 47 years. Until she began suffering from unexplained nerve pain a few years ago, Ms. Nemser, 77, an art historian and writer, would happily retreat to her third-floor office where she could work undisturbed. There’s plenty of wall space for the couple’s art collection, and ample storage for Mr. Nemser’s cache of fishing poles.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Elderly New Yorkers, Here for the Duration', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Aging Around Us', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-12T15:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanne Kaufman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaufman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3743bb3b-dbd2-5ba7-bf42-718177534a8d', 'word_count': 2392, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3743bb3b-dbd2-5ba7-bf42-718177534a8d'}, {'