tps://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/12/london-fashion-week-spring-summer-2015-cara-delevingne-model-travel-guide/', 'snippet': 'The model shares her five favorite hometown hangouts, where she’s likely to spend downtime between the spring/summer 2015 shows there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today, the 22-year-old British model Cara Delevingne returns to her hometown of London to walk in the spring/summer 2015 shows there. The fashion-world darling, who introduced her eponymous Mulberry collection at an event in New York City on Monday and who stars in the new Burberry fragrance campaign alongside Kate Moss, is excited to be home with her family. When she has more time in London, she ventures out to Hackney Farm and London Zoo to frolic and play. But she has less ambitious plans for this whirlwind of a trip (including a pit stop at the Mulberry Store on New Bond Street “to look at my bags,” she says). Here, in five words or less, the girl with more Instagram followers than Lady Gaga shares her top 5 places to hang during London Fashion Week this season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/t-magazine/11london-delevingne/11london-delevingne-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/11/t-magazine/11london-delevingne/11london-delevingne-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/t-magazine/11london-delevingne/11london-delevingne-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/11/t-magazine/11london-delevingne/11london-delevingne-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width