hich a jury may be selected to hear the case against the defendant, Dzhokhar Tsarnaev.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Accord Calls for Jury Pool of 2,000 in Boston Bombing Trial', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jury Pool of 2,000 for Trial in Boston', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon Bombings (2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsarnaev, Dzhokhar A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jury System', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-12T18:55:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f8eaf54e-fc11-5a1f-8c0b-2f1f45bc4558', 'word_count': 327, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f8eaf54e-fc11-5a1f-8c0b-2f1f45bc4558'}, {'abstract': 'National elections will be held on Sunday, and the center-right government has lost some supporters to an anti-immigrant alternative.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/13/world/europe/rift-emerges-in-sweden-over-immigration.html', 'snippet': 'National elections will be held on Sunday, and the center-right government has lost some supporters to an anti-immigrant alternative.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TROLLHATTAN, Sweden — Refugees from Syria and Iraq are pouring into Sweden at a record pace, placing strains on welfare, schools and housing. With national elections imminent, the center-right government is watching some of its supporters desert it