dson Valley. Cole was 43, an established landscape painter who championed the majesty of the American wilderness. Not only was their time together formative for Church, who became one of the most acclaimed artists of the 19th century, but it also cemented what would later be called the Hudson River School, the country’s first cohesive art movement. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14ARTSWE1/14ARTSWE1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 602, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14ARTSWE1/14ARTSWE1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 602}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14ARTSWE1/14ARTSWE1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1022, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14ARTSWE1/14ARTSWE1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2043, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14ARTSWE1/14ARTSWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14ARTSWE1/14ARTSWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14ARTSWE1/14ARTSWE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Formative Lessons in the