tropolitan Opera is eliminating 22 of its 254 nonunion administrative jobs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/13/arts/music/met-opera-cuts-22-nonunion-jobs-mainly-through-layoffs.html', 'snippet': 'Three weeks after negotiating a deal for union pay cuts, the Metropolitan Opera is eliminating 22 of its 254 nonunion administrative jobs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Metropolitan Opera, which promised to match the pay cuts that its major unions agreed to last month with equivalent cuts to its nonunion payroll, said on Friday afternoon that it was eliminating 22 of its 254 administrative positions, mostly through layoffs. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Met Opera Cuts 22 Nonunion Jobs, Mainly Through Layoffs', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Met Opera Cuts 22 Nonunion Jobs, Mainly Through Layoffs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cooper, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Labor', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-12T21:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c0b592f-42c2-5cb8-9231-57f57edc9f56', 'word_count': 460, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c0b592f-42c2-5cb8-9231-57f57edc9f56'}, {'abstract': 'Get caught up on 