am manufacturer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/14/automobiles/autoreviews/a-family-sedan-for-the-speedway.html', 'snippet': 'The 2015 Charger Hellcat will have the same supercharged 707-horsepower Hemi V8 found in the Challenger Hellcat and will be the most powerful sedan from any mainstream manufacturer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Its wheelbase is 4.2 inches longer and it has two additional doors, but the Dodge Charger sedan is virtually a mechanical twin of the Challenger coupe. So it was straightforward enough to move the parts that turn a Challenger into a Hellcat over to the Charger. The 2015 Charger Hellcat, which arrives this fall at an expected price above $60,000, will be powered by the same supercharged 707-horsepower Hemi V8 found in the Challenger Hellcat.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/automobiles/CHARGER/CHARGER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 347, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/14/automobiles/CHARGER/CHARGER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 347}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/automobiles/CHARGER/CHARGER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/automobiles/CHARGER/CHARGER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1185, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/automobiles/CHARGER/CHARGER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail':