at London Fashion Week tomorrow, shares with T his photographs and words about his favorite things at his home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the six years since founding his label J.W. Anderson, the Northern Irish designer Jonathan Anderson has emerged as\xa0one of\xa0fashion’s leading lights. His cerebral collections — the newest of which will debut at London Fashion Week tomorrow — were recently anointed by an investment from LVMH. And his new role as the creative director of the venerable Spanish house Loewe has granted him membership to fashion’s most elite club: the small set of designers responsible for not one, but two, labels (Karl Lagerfeld, Alexander Wang).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/t-magazine/12anderson-hartman/12anderson-hartman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/t-magazine/12anderson-hartman/12anderson-hartman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/t-magazine/12anderson-hartman/12anderson-hartman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/t-magazine/12anderson-hartman/12anderson-hartman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/t-magazine/12anderson-hartman/12anderson-hartman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/12/t-magazine/12anderson-hartman/12and