y of Illinois voted on Thursday to block the appointment of Steven Salaita, a Palestinian-American professor who had been offered a tenured position last year, following a campaign by pro-Israel students, faculty members and donors who contended that his Twitter comments on the bombardment of Gaza this summer were anti-Semitic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Professor’s Angry Tweets on Gaza Cost Him a Job', 'kicker': 'Open Source', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salaita, Steven G', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACADEMIC FREEDOM', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-13T00:31:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0ecba9f8-f9a7-557a-b94f-53b43af2ec6c', 'word_count': 1249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0ecba9f8-f9a7-557a-b94f-53b43af2ec6c'}, {'abstract': 'When answering calls, firefighters don’t expect to find murder victims, but sometimes they do, as in a recent Queens murder-suicide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/13/nyregion/when-fighting-fires-becomes-something-else.html', 'snippet': 'When answering calls, firefighters don’t expect to find murder victims, but sometimes they do, as in a recent Queens murder-suicide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Firefighters from two houses in SoHo, Engine 55 and Ladder Company 20, rushed to Henr