e the headline for today’s post because it made me mist up a bit. Cluing COLUMNIST as “Paper job” is very clever, but a reminder for those of us who make a living writing that the print side of publishing is on its knees, if we’re going to be charitable. Whether it can be saved or whether it will stick around as an archaic reminder of the golden days of publishing is a question I will leave for better minds than mine.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paper Job', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-13T02:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e327aadd-d30f-573d-9e60-0f68c3d2538d', 'word_count': 282, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e327aadd-d30f-573d-9e60-0f68c3d2538d'}, {'abstract': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton has said that she will decide next year whether to undertake a presidential campaign. But the Clinton operation is already quietly laying the groundwork for a candidacy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/13/us/clinton-silent-on-2016-bid-as-campaign-style-actions-begin-to-speak-volumes.html', 'snippet': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton has said that she will decide next year whether to undertake a presidential campaign. But the Clinton operation is already quietly laying the groundwork for a candidacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'She is building stamina through tough new workouts with a personal trainer and yoga. She is talking about how to address income inequality without alienating corporate America. And she is reviewing who’s who in the Democratic Party in Iowa, a crucial early voting state in the presidential cycle.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/us/CLINTON/CLINTON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/13/us/CLINTON/CLINTON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/us/CLINTON/CLINTON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/us/CLINTON/CLINTON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/us/CLINTON/CLINTON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/13/us/CLINTON/CLINTON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/us/CLINTON/CLINTON-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Clinton Silent on 2016 Bid as Campaign-Style Actions Begin to Speak Volumes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clinton Silent on 2016 Bid as Campaign-Style Actions Begin to Speak Volumes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subj