tion': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/78d4c7b2-844d-5b2a-a2d4-19a75d91a0ce', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/78d4c7b2-844d-5b2a-a2d4-19a75d91a0ce'}, {'abstract': 'Television highlights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/13/arts/television/whats-on-tv-saturday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': ' 8 P.M. (HBO) DALLAS BUYERS CLUB (2013) A fiercely gaunt Matthew McConaughey, in an Oscar-winning role, portrays Ron Woodroof, a Texas electrician and rodeo rider who, after learning in 1985 that he is H.I.V. -positive, decides to treat himself by hunting down medication not then legal in the United States. Eventually, he begins a subscription service, selling contraband medicines for a monthly fee. Jared Leto (above left, with Mr. McConaughey), in another Oscar-winning performance, plays the transgendered Rayon, who becomes Ron’s business partner. And Jennifer Garner is the doctor who, after initially opposing the plan, turns into an ally. What is largely missing from this drama, directed by Jean-Marc Vallée and inspired by real events, “is the sense that Ron’s efforts are part of a larger movement,” A. O. Scott wrote in The New York Times. “Ron’s bravery and determination are entirely credible, thanks to Mr. McConaughey’s disciplined, high-spirited performance and the filmmakers’ interest in the complexity of the character. But his actions unfold in something of a vacuum.” He added, “There is warmth and intelligence here, and undeniable sincerity, but also a determination, in the face of much painful and fascinating history, to play it safe.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Saturday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Saturday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-13T05:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/134f98f3-4e2c-56a4-984b-e3801aca82a1', 'word_count': 664, 'uri': 'nyt://article/134f98f3-4e2c-56a4-984b-e3801aca82a1'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on September 13, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/13/pageoneplus/corrections-september-13-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on September 13, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRONT PAGE', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: September 13, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-13T05:43:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/510d4d55-58e0-5304-94a6-9cbcfcd52a08', 'word_count': 475, 'uri': 'nyt://article/510d4d55-58e0-5304-94a6-9cbcfcd52a08'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, September 13, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/13/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-saturday-september-13-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, September 13, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“We hope we’re wrong.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, September 13, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-