, 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mueller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/13b86d32-05f6-5e1d-9abf-c4c7f218006c', 'word_count': 251, 'uri': 'nyt://article/13b86d32-05f6-5e1d-9abf-c4c7f218006c'}, {'abstract': 'At the up-and-comer’s spring/summer 2015 show, the models sported low buns threaded with woven string and copper wire, smeared with glitter and topped with Lucite headpieces.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/13/artfully-collaged-coifs-at-phoebe-english/', 'snippet': 'At the up-and-comer’s spring/summer 2015 show, the models sported low buns threaded with woven string and copper wire, smeared with glitter and topped with Lucite headpieces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the up-and-comer\xa0Phoebe English‘s spring/summer 2015 show today, the coifs were as artfully constructed as the clothes, which featured colorful brushstrokes and handcrafted netting. The hair had a similarly bricolaged feeling: The sides of each model’s head were smeared with glittery gel, low buns were threaded through with woven string and copper wire, and\xa0a Lucite piece rested atop each crown like a vertebral column. The effect was something like what an art student might dream up for a particularly festive party.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/t-magazine/13do-english-gilchrist/13do-english-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/13/t-magazine/13do-english-gilchrist/13do-english-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/13/t-magazine/13do-english-