91', 'word_count': 97, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6f0bc8a-e550-5428-bfaa-6b47c4553f91'}, {'abstract': 'At When Pigs Fly South, a modest eatery in Sharon that resembles a Southern roadside barbecue shack, the pigs that matter most are those from which its plates of ribs and pork shoulders are derived.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/14/nyregion/a-review-of-when-pigs-fly-south-in-sharon.html', 'snippet': 'At When Pigs Fly South, a modest eatery in Sharon that resembles a Southern roadside barbecue shack, the pigs that matter most are those from which its plates of ribs and pork shoulders are derived.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pigs, and plenty of them, adorn the space at When Pigs Fly South. There’s a chubby one hanging just above the entrance, and another two, with wings, mounted on the wall inside. Others are on the counter, where food orders are placed, and still more rest on windowsills around the one-room dining area. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14DINECT2/14DINECT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14DINECT2/14DINECT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 522}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14DINECT2/14DINECT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 891, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/14DINECT2/14DINECT2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1782, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/