'word_count': 1217, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7470351f-f7d5-5620-b583-2efc99600437'}, {'abstract': 'The remains of Archbishop Fulton J. Sheen, who died in 1979, are in a crypt in Manhattan, but the Diocese of Peoria, Ill., is laying claim to them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/14/nyregion/archbishop-sheens-corpse-is-subject-of-long-running-dispute.html', 'snippet': 'The remains of Archbishop Fulton J. Sheen, who died in 1979, are in a crypt in Manhattan, but the Diocese of Peoria, Ill., is laying claim to them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Roman Catholic Diocese of Peoria, Ill., has already constructed a museum in honor of Archbishop Fulton J. Sheen, a native son whose Emmy-winning television show during the 1950s brought Catholicism to the American living room. It has documented several potential miracles by him and compiled a dossier on his good works for the Vatican.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/2D-SUB-SHEEN/2D-SUB-SHEEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/2D-SUB-SHEEN/2D-SUB-SHEEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 634}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/2D-SUB-SHEEN/2D-SUB-SHEEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 969, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/2D-SUB-SHEEN/2D-SUB-SHEEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1225, 'width': 1159, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/nyregion/2D-SUB-SHEEN/2