, but they did not begin dating until 2012.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/14/fashion/weddings/moira-weigel-benjamin-tarnoff.html', 'snippet': 'The bride and groom are graduates of Harvard, where they met, but they did not begin dating until 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Moira Gallagher Weigel, a daughter of Kathleen Gallagher Weigel and William H. Weigel of Brooklyn, was married Saturday to Benjamin Falco Tarnoff, a son of K. Mathea Falco and Peter Tarnoff of San Francisco. The Rev. Mark J. Lane performed the ceremony at the Oratory Church of St. Boniface, a Roman Catholic church in Brooklyn, with the Rev. Dennis M. Corrado, another Roman Catholic priest and the provost of the church, taking part.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/fashion/weddings/14WEIGEL/14WEIGELjpg-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/14/fashion/weddings/14WEIGEL/14WEIGELjpg-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/fashion/weddings/14WEIGEL/14WEIGELjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/fashion/weddings/14WEIGEL/14WEIGELjpg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 812, 'width': 1375, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/14/fashion/weddings/14WEIGEL/14WEIGELjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/14