'}, {'abstract': 'Today we think of fiction as the wholesome alternative to reading online — but a few centuries ago, novels were the suspect medium.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/14/when-novels-were-bad-for-you/', 'snippet': 'Today we think of fiction as the wholesome alternative to reading online — but a few centuries ago, novels were the suspect medium.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When people bemoan the alleged ill effects of reading online, they often hold up reading a good novel as the more wholesome alternative. But a few hundred years ago, novels were the suspect medium, accused of leading people astray and ruining them for real life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/12READER/12READER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 590, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/12READER/12READER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 590}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/12READER/12READER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/12READER/12READER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/12READER/12READER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/12READER/12READER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ