ny.html', 'snippet': 'The N.F.L. and Goodell are facing mounting criticism for the handling of Rice, who was suspended indefinitely only after the release of an unequivocal video of him assaulting a woman.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Linda Sánchez stood among her fellow members of Congress as she watched Roger Goodell enter the hearing room. It was October 2009, evidence of football damaging brains had been mounting for three years, and the House Judiciary Committee — along with many football fans — awaited what Goodell would say under oath about a subject shaking his sport.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/sports/15goodell/15goodell-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/15/sports/15goodell/15goodell-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/sports/15goodell/15goodell-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/sports/15goodell/15goodell-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1442, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/sports/15goodell/15goodell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/15/sports/15goodell/15goodell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/sports/15goodell/15goodell-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Handling of Ray Rice Case Puts Roger Goodell Under Heightened Level of Scrutiny', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cracks in His Shield', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwarz, Alan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goodell, Roger', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rice, Ray (1987- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Domestic Violence', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-14T19:07:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Schwarz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schwarz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/43fbdc5e-555b-5e95-ba14-9750684697de', 'word_count': 1271, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43fbdc5e-555b-5e95-ba14-9750684697de'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Roman Polanski was a rising star of international cinema in 1964.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/14/1964-director-a-success-both-sides-of-the-curtain/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Roman Polanski was a rising star of international cinema in 1964.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Roman Polanski, a pocket-sized, playful Puck of a youthful Pole, is bringing off the very neat feat of becoming a successful movie director in his native Communist homeland and in the highly competitive circles of the capitalist West movie world. His first feature film, ‘‘Knife in the Water,’’ shot in Warsaw, won him a prize at the Venice Film Festival two years ago and put him on the cover of an issue of ‘‘Time’’ magazine devoted to international moviemaking. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/blogs/15iht-old15-polanski/15iht-old15-polanski-articleLarge.png', 'height': 484, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/15/blogs/15iht-old15-polanski/15iht-old15-polanski-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 484}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/blogs/15iht-old15-polanski/15iht-old15-polanski-jumbo.png', 'height': 826, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/blogs/15iht-old15-polanski/15iht-old15-polanski-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1020, 'width': 1265, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/blogs/15iht-old15-polanski/15iht-old15-polanski-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/15/blogs/15iht-old15-polanski/15iht-old15-polanski-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/blogs/15iht-old15-polanski/15iht-old15-polanski-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1964: Directo