ng and Renewal', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Housing Authority (NYC)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peterson, Miriam', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rich, Nathan', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Golan, Sagi', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-14T21:45:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Kimmelman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kimmelman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/434331a8-ec80-55dd-9db6-2442c527ef26', 'word_count': 1112, 'uri': 'nyt://article/434331a8-ec80-55dd-9db6-2442c527ef26'}, {'abstract': 'Youssou N’Dour sang in four languages as he fronted the band Le Super Étoile in concert at the Brooklyn Academy of Music.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/15/arts/music/youssou-ndour-performs-at-the-brooklyn-academy-of-music.html', 'snippet': 'Youssou N’Dour sang in four languages as he fronted the band Le Super Étoile in concert at the Brooklyn Academy of Music.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ushers at the Brooklyn Academy of Music fought a brief, losing battle against concertgoers surging into the aisle to dance when the Senegalese singer and bandleader Youssou N’Dour performed there on Friday night. All the better: Mr. N’Dour — a superstar across Africa and the French-speaking world since the 1980s, a 2012 presidential candidate in Senegal and the winner of the 2013 Polar Music Prize — leads one of Africa’s greatest and most nimble bands, Le Super Étoile. With the audience on its feet, the synergy between performers and listeners only grew. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page'