-c264481592e5'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Chris Christie’s plan for casino betting on athletic events is unlikely to save Atlantic City, but it could damage the integrity of sports.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/15/opinion/gambling-on-the-games.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Chris Christie’s plan for casino betting on athletic events is unlikely to save Atlantic City, but it could damage the integrity of sports.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The gambling industry in New Jersey is in deep trouble. Five of Atlantic City’s major casinos are closing or threatening to close before the end of the year. Thousands of workers have been laid off, and more layoffs are expected, as competing casinos spring up in neighboring states like Pennsylvania and New York. New Jersey’s unemployment rate is 6.5 percent, higher than the national rate. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gambling on the Games', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gambling on the Games', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gambling', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Casinos', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-15T00:44:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/0af55e25-2b3c-52ce-abf5-b6f947a1b27b', 'word_count': 350, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0af55e25-2b3c-52ce-abf5-b6f947a1b27b'}, {'abstract': 'Thirty-five years after Etan Patz’s disappearance in Manhattan, a judge will consider the mental fitness of the confessor, Pedro Hernandez, and will also determine if his Miranda rights were properly issued.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/15/nyregion/judge-to-scrutinize-circumstances-of-suspects-confession-in-patz-case.html', 'snippet': 'Thirty-five years after Etan Patz’s disappearance in Manhattan, a judge will consider the mental fitness of the confessor, Pedro Hernandez, and will also determine if his Miranda rights were properly issued.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometime on the afternoon of May 23, 2012, Pedro Hernandez confessed to one of New York’s most infamous unsolved crimes of the 20th century — the disappearance of Etan Patz.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/nyregion/15PEDRO/15PEDRO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 536, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/15/nyregion/15PEDRO/15PEDRO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 536}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/nyregion/15PEDRO/15PEDRO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 915, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/nyregion/15PEDRO/15PEDRO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1094, 'width': 1224, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/nyregion/15PEDRO/15PEDRO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/15/nyregion/15PEDRO/15PEDRO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption'