/', 'snippet': 'So here we are in the home stretch with shows like Mulberry, Burberry, Christopher Kane, Tom Ford and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the nicest things about this city’s fashion week is that unlike in other cities, where the fashion “week” is usually at least seven days, bookended by little previews and after-spasms, this one is a whirlwind five. So here we are in the home stretch.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'London Fashion Week Morning Report, Day 4', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'London Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'September Fashion Week (2014)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bailey, Christopher (1971- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Delevingne, Cara', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ford, Tom', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kane, Christopher', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Parker, Dorothy', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Burberry', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-15T04:00:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Jacobs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jacobs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7297480c-36d2-5a95-a17e-031e99e873a9', 'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7297480c-36d2-5a95-a17e-031e99e873a9'}, {'abstract': 'Twelve active ingredients were involved in almost half of hospitalizations of children for prescription drug poisoning, a new study found.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/15/select-drugs-cause-most-childhood-poisonings/', 'snippet': 'Twelve active ingredients were involved in almost half of hospitalizations of children for prescription drug poisoning, a new study found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Almost all prescription medicines in the United States come in bottles with child-resistant caps. Still, more than 9,000 children younger than 6 are hospitalized annually for the accidental ingestion of prescription drugs; three-quarters of these are 1- and 2-year-olds,  a new study reports.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 219, 'width': 225, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 219, 'width': 225, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 149, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'l