ir and “Born to Be Wild” on the stereo. The road is about hardship. It’s the thing between the places we want to be — it’s where we are when we’re 50 miles from nowhere. Look at a typical car commercial, with a hot-looking red sedan carving beautiful S-curves on an empty highway: You’ll never, ever be on that road, any more than you’ll wind up at the end of it with the ad’s blonde supermodel. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1345, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/12/blogs/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV/20140912-lens-roadtrip-slide-3BOV-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capti