ation as a virtuosic guitarist, but his songwriting takes center stage on his album “Heigh Ho,” being released on Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/16/arts/music/blake-mills-releases-his-second-album-heigh-ho.html', 'snippet': 'Blake Mills has quickly grown a reputation as a virtuosic guitarist, but his songwriting takes center stage on his album “Heigh Ho,” being released on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eric Clapton recently called him “the last guitarist I heard that I thought was phenomenal.” The producer Don Was says he is “one of those rare musicians who come along once in a generation.” He has played with the likes of Beck, Lana Del Rey and Neil Diamond.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/arts/16MILLS/16MILLS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 855, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/16/arts/16MILLS/16MILLS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 855}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/arts/16MILLS/16MILLS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 719, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/arts/16MILLS/16MILLS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1437, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/arts/16MILLS/16MILLS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/16/arts/16MILLS/16MILLS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th