'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/15/biennale-des-antiquaires-paris-highlights/', 'snippet': 'The decorative arts fair at the Grand Palais has become less a guidebook on how to live once you’ve made it and more a show to be considered one object at a time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nobody turns out to support decorative arts like the French do, and every two years the beau monde of Paris show up en masse for the Biennale des Antiquaires. Once, this event was for Wall Street titans seeking to furnish their apartments on Park Avenue. Hubert de Givenchy could be seen squiring the wives of junk-bond kings, advising and conferring with the certainty that pretty much all of them wanted to live in environments like his.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/t-magazine/15netto-biennale/15netto-biennale-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/15/t-magazine/15netto-biennale/15netto-biennale-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/t-magazine/15netto-biennale/15netto-biennale-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/t-magazine/15netto-biennale/15netto-biennale-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/15/t-magazine/15netto-biennale/15netto-biennale-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/