2e1b0', 'word_count': 1131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10307927-2405-539c-9b5d-7fd5cfc2e1b0'}, {'abstract': 'The United Nations said it moved members of its Golan peacekeeping force to the Israeli-controlled side because the area had “deteriorated severely.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/16/world/middleeast/un-moves-peacekeepers-in-golan-over-safety-fears.html', 'snippet': 'The United Nations said it moved members of its Golan peacekeeping force to the Israeli-controlled side because the area had “deteriorated severely.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Concerned about another attack or mass abduction targeting its Golan Heights peacekeepers, the United Nations said Monday that it had withdrawn many of them to the Israeli-controlled side of the peacekeepers’ buffer zone after unidentified armed groups from Syria moved menacingly close to their positions on the Syrian side.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Moves Peacekeepers in Golan Over Safety Fears', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Moves Golan Peacekeepers Over Safety Fears', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Golan Heights', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ban Ki-moon', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-16T00:13:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladston