hen a domestic violence video emerged and a child abuse indictment was handed down, what stood out most were personal perspectives.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/16/sports/football/nfl-commentators-share-insights-on-ray-rice-and-adrian-peterson.html', 'snippet': 'In a week when a domestic violence video emerged and a child abuse indictment was handed down, what stood out most were personal perspectives.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a week when the definitive Ray Rice domestic violence video emerged and the child abuse indictment against Adrian Peterson was handed down, it became clear that wise voices were needed on sports networks. These are serious subjects, not highlights or game analysis, or the legal areas that sports outlets have built an expertise in, like drugs and concussions.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Game Day Reports: Off-the-Field Violence', 'kicker': 'TV Sports', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'N.F.L. Game Day Reports: Off-the-Field Violence', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Domestic Violence', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rice, Ray (1987- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peterson, Adrian', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carter, Cris', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oliver, Pam', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Bart', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Ravens', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Vikings', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-16T01:56: