smissed from the Baltimore Ravens and suspended indefinitely from the National Football League, the New Rochelle High School community is struggling to determine how to react.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/16/nyregion/new-rochelle-struggles-amid-rices-unraveling.html', 'snippet': 'Now that Ray Rice, a hometown football hero, has been dismissed from the Baltimore Ravens and suspended indefinitely from the National Football League, the New Rochelle High School community is struggling to determine how to react.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before the video of Ray Rice punching his future wife became public last week, he was a hometown football hero, a former star who brought bragging rights to New Rochelle High School. Mr. Rice, who grew up in a housing project in the city, led his squad to a state championship in 2003 and has donated duffel bags, compression shirts and headphones to his former team.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/nyregion/NEWROCHELLE1/NEWROCHELLE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/16/nyregion/NEWROCHELLE1/NEWROCHELLE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/nyregion/NEWROCHELLE1/NEWROCHELLE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/nyregion/NEWROCHELLE1/NEWROCHELLE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/