ally crowded with car and foot traffic at that hour.\xa0 ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghanistan: Bomb Explodes in Kabul Outside Gates of U.S. Military Base', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Afghanistan: Bomb Explodes in Kabul Outside Gates of U.S. Military Base', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kabul (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Military Bases and Installations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-16T04:42:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rod Nordland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rod', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nordland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/c39b501e-01e3-5522-982f-d291e2e63b90', 'word_count': 75, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c39b501e-01e3-5522-982f-d291e2e63b90'}, {'abstract': 'Prime Minister David Cameron of Britain visited Scotland on Monday, three days before an independence referendum, to tell Scots why they should remain a part of the United Kingdom.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/europe/100000003116319/cameron-implores-scots-to-stay-in-uk.html', 'snippet': 'Prime Minister David Cameron of Britain visited Scotland on Monday, three days before an independence referendum, to tell Scots why they should remain a part of the United Kingdom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prime Minister David Cameron of Britain visited Scotland on Monday, three days before an independence referendum, to tell Scots why they should remain a 