 Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1964: Madrid Blames U.S. for Raid', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cuba', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-16T14:19:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/879dfd22-a290-54f7-a630-cc580f46de1a', 'word_count': 126, 'uri': 'nyt://article/879dfd22-a290-54f7-a630-cc580f46de1a'}, {'abstract': 'Coincidentally, a number of fashion designers took inspiration from the German art and design school for their fall collections. The result: a strong set of graphic dresses and coats that hit at the knee.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/16/bauhaus-style-fashion-givenchy-prada-missoni-bottega-veneta/', 'snippet': 'Coincidentally, a number of fashion designers took inspiration from the German art and design school for their fall collections. The result: a strong set of graphic dresses and coats that hit at the knee.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/t-magazine/28design-look-bauhaus-1/28design-look-bauhaus-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/28/t-magazine/28desi