'}, {'abstract': 'Warren Sanderson, a professor of social and behavioral sciences at Stony Brook University, is working on ways to define aging other than the passing of years. “Everything is changing about 65-year-olds,” he said.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/16/on-new-measurements-of-aging/', 'snippet': 'Warren Sanderson, a professor of social and behavioral sciences at Stony Brook University, is working on ways to define aging other than the passing of years. “Everything is changing about 65-year-olds,” he said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pediatricians chart children’s growth at every visit, tracking how they conform to age-appropriate standards. What if standard measures of aging were similarly available?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On New Measurements of Aging', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Longevity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-16T18:43:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judith Graham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Graham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb185a1a-59df-5e10-b131-be75084ce4e7', 'word_count': 831, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb185a1a-59df-5e10-b131-be75084ce4e7'}, {'abstract': 'The census numbers on what American families made last year are as mediocre as they are predictable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/17/upshot/you-cant-feed-a-family-with-gdp.html', 'snippet': 'The census numbers on what American families made last year are as mediocre as th