ear, describes his cooking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Initially, Le Canon, a bistro that opened in Nice early this year, comes off as the sort of hipster restaurant that might easily be spotted in Brooklyn or Shoreditch in London: Edison bulbs overhead; ’50s-era cafe chairs and Formica-topped tables; a soundtrack heavy on funk. But when Sébastien Perinetti, the friendly owner and a Nice native, props the daily chalkboard menu up on a chair, it’s a great read that could be found only on the French Riviera.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/travel/21BITES/21BITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 834, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/21/travel/21BITES/21BITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 834}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/travel/21BITES/21BITES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/travel/21BITES/21BITES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1473, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/travel/21BITES/21BITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/21/travel/21BITES/21BITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/travel/21BITES/21BITES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thum