a8881-9976-5bf0-a89c-d58cc9c6fa4e'}, {'abstract': 'Over four months, dozens of victims were swindled for more than $60,000 in a scheme that took their money to secure apartments that were unavailable, the Manhattan district attorney’s office said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/17/nyregion/pair-charged-in-manhattan-apartment-rental-fraud.html', 'snippet': 'Over four months, dozens of victims were swindled for more than $60,000 in a scheme that took their money to secure apartments that were unavailable, the Manhattan district attorney’s office said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is a certain kind of desperation that just about anyone who has rented an apartment in Manhattan can recognize.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pair Charged in Manhattan Apartment Rental Fraud', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '2 Charged in Scheme to Defraud Renters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Renting and Leasing (Real Estate)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wada, Matthew', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'York, Jennifer (1987- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Craigslist', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-16T22:43:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marc Santora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marc', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Santora', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1888443-6b3c-5044-8b88-69c15a81103b', 'word_count': 553, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1888443-6b3c-5044-8b88-69c15a81103b'}, {'abstract': 'The combination of the savory, woody rosemary and the sweet fruit may inspire you to eat the breads at breakfast, lunch and dinner.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/16/healthy-homemade-whole-wheat-focaccia/', 'snippet': 'The combination of the savory, woody rosemary and the sweet fruit may inspire you to eat the breads at breakfast, lunch and dinner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A couple of months ago, at the height of the summer tomato season, I gave you a recipe for a delicious whole wheat focaccia with tomatoes and fontina. I was so enthralled with the bread that I decided I’d come back to it and post a week’s worth of focaccia recipes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/science/12recipehealthalt/12recipehealthalt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/16/science/12recipehealthalt/12recipehealthalt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/science/12recipehealthalt/12recipehealthalt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/science/12recipehealthalt/12recipehealthalt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/16/science/12recipehealthalt/12recipehealthalt-thumb