r prowess with a bat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/17/sports/baseball/a-batting-title-that-may-whisper.html', 'snippet': 'The National League batting title may fall this season to the Pirates’ Josh Harrison, who has a .317 average and is known more for versatility than for prowess with a bat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For all that the sabermetric community has given baseball, one thing it has taken away is the concept of a batting champion. The devaluation of batting average, and the emphasis on power, has made the yearly batting average leader, once one of the game’s top honors, somewhat irrelevant as people focus more on other statistics.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/17/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/17/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capti