l elements in perceptions of crime and translating contemporary Arab poetry, have been named the 2014 fellows of the John D. and Catherine T. MacArthur Foundation. The fellowships, based on achievement and potential, come with a stipend of $625,000 over five years and are among the most prestigious prizes for artists, scholars and professionals.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'MacArthur Awards Go to 21 Diverse Fellows', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'MacArthur Awards Go to 21 Diverse Fellows', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MacArthur, John D and Catherine T, Foundation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Felicia R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mathematics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bechdel, Alison', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coleman, Steve', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hayes, Terrance', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hunter, Samuel D', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lurie, Jacob', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oppenheimer, Joshua', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lowe, Rick', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-17T04:01:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Felicia R. Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Felicia', 'middlename'