th Israel for natural gas represents a remarkable tie for two nations with a history of tension, and reflects how badly Jordan needs energy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the oil gusher lottery came to the Middle East, Jordan seemed to have drawn a losing ticket. And now that some of the neighbors it depended on for fuel supplies, like Iraq and Egypt, have convulsed with political or sectarian strife, Jordan is frantically looking for other sources — and finding them in unexpected places.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jordan Finds Energy Sources in Unlikely Places', 'kicker': 'Green Column', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jordan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Energy and Power', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Renewable Energy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-17T14:16:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Galbraith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Galbraith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/98f4b5b7-e5d0-5fb1-acbc-30fd9f6f3438', 'word_count': 876, 'uri': 'nyt://article/98f4b5b7-e5d0-5fb1-acbc-30fd9f6f3438'}, {'abstract': 'Milan', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/09/17/fashion/runway-womens/gucci-spring-2015-rtw.html', 'snippet': 'Milan', 'lead_paragraph': 'Milan', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/fashion/runway-womens/gucci-fashion-week-slide-L9E3/gu