on week, the Italian-born recent New York transplant, who is gaining notice for her international editorial work and refined fashion sense, shares a comprehensive list of her favorite hometown hangouts.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/17/milan-fashion-week-spring-2015-where-to-eat-drink-shop-and-unwind-travel-ada-kokosar-stylist/', 'snippet': 'On the first day of the city’s fashion week, the Italian-born recent New York transplant, who is gaining notice for her international editorial work and refined fashion sense, shares a comprehensive list of her favorite hometown hangouts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A cursory glance at any leading street-style site will invariably turn up images of the freelance stylist Ada Kokosar, a striking blonde whose refined fashion sense and patrician looks call to mind a latter-day Carolyn Bessette Kennedy. The Slovenian-Italian is also gaining notice for her editorial shoots for a range of international glossies. And though she’s currently based in New York, she grew up outside Milan and lived there for 10 years. Here, to kick off Milan’s spring/summer 2015 fashion week, she shares a comprehensive list of her favorite haunts there.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/t-magazine/17ada-milan-hartman-3/17ada-milan-hartman-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/17/t-magazine/17ada-milan-hartman-3/17ada-milan-hartman-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/t-magazine/17ada-milan-hartman-3/17ada-milan-hartman-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,