furt, conducted with sweep and subtlety by Sebastian Weigle. The winning cast is headed by the gleaming, expressive soprano Eva-Maria Westbroek as Minnie, the title character. (Anthony Tommasini)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/artsbeat-classical/artsbeat-classical-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/artsbeat-classical/artsbeat-classical-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/artsbeat-classical/artsbeat-classical-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 653, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/artsbeat-classical/artsbeat-classical-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1306, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/artsbeat-classical/artsbeat-classical-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/artsbeat-classical/artsbeat-classical-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/artsbeat-classical/artsbeat-classical-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Classical Playlist: Puccini, Messiaen, Schubert and More', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': Non