a Fenley’s dances at Judson Memorial Church play on shifts between tension and tranquillity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/18/arts/dance/molissa-fenley-and-company-at-judson-memorial-church.html', 'snippet': 'Molissa Fenley’s dances at Judson Memorial Church play on shifts between tension and tranquillity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Molissa Fenley’s dances flourish in wide-open spaces, where the air around bodies becomes just as tangible as the sculptural shapes she creates for her dancers. It’s hard to say if that quality relates to her early years growing up in Nigeria, but an uncluttered space like Judson Memorial Church, where her company returned Tuesday evening, provides a luminous setting for the breadth of her movement in her refined and systematic modern dances. Somehow, it’s like gazing into the horizon of a foreign land. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/18MOLISSA/18MOLISSA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/18MOLISSA/18MOLISSA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/18MOLISSA/18MOLISSA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/18MOLISSA/18MOLISSA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1392, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/18MOLISSA/18MOLISSA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cr