 'A houseful of immigrant women, three of whom work the same, numbing factory job, are at the center of “To the Bone,” a play by Lisa Ramirez at the Cherry Lane Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/18/theater/to-the-bone-by-lisa-ramirez-about-immigrant-workers.html', 'snippet': 'A houseful of immigrant women, three of whom work the same, numbing factory job, are at the center of “To the Bone,” a play by Lisa Ramirez at the Cherry Lane Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Olga, Reina and Juana spend their days in an upstate factory, knifing breasts from chicken carcasses. At night they eat and pray and take Motrin to soothe their aching arms, still wearing layers of sweaters. After the factory’s chill, they can’t get warm. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/BONE-1410983453432x/BONE-1410983453432-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/BONE-1410983453432x/BONE-1410983453432-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 432}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/BONE-1410983453432x/BONE-1410983453432-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/BONE-1410983453432x/BONE-1410983453432-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1465, 'width': 2036, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/arts/BONE-1410983453432x/BONE-1410983453432-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumb