in light of the Ray Rice and Adrian Peterson abuse scandals. But who is ultimately responsible for change —\xa0the league, its sponsors or viewers like you?', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/18/boycott-the-n-f-l/', 'snippet': 'Some critics have called for a boycott of the league in light of the Ray Rice and Adrian Peterson abuse scandals. But who is ultimately responsible for change —\xa0the league, its sponsors or viewers like you?', 'lead_paragraph': '“Are you a decent person? Do you regard yourself as having a moral compass? Do you try to lead your everyday life in accordance with some basic ethical precepts, such as not countenancing brutality, greed and deception?” If so, Michael Tracey at Vice says “then please, for God’s sake, don’t watch the N.F.L.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/opinion/nyto-football/nyto-football-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/17/opinion/nyto-football/nyto-football-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/opinion/nyto-football/nyto-football-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1014, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/opinion/nyto-football/nyto-football-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 2020, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/17/opinion/nyto-football/nyto-football-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail':