3-94c9-56b1-a828-5e5e4cd62be7'}, {'abstract': 'At Fendi, the clothes conveyed confidence and a point of view that belonged to the present.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/19/fashion/milan-fashion-week-fendi-alberta-ferretti-max-mara.html', 'snippet': 'At Fendi, the clothes conveyed confidence and a point of view that belonged to the present.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILAN — Whether or not the pundits are right and the Scottish situation goes viral across Europe and beyond, with other nationalist groups announcing their intentions to leave whatever union they happen to be in (the Catalans, Spain; the Veneto, Italy; the Québécois, Canada; the Texans, the United States — it could happen), one thing is certain: Fashion has seen independence as a potential trend.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/fashion/18milan-A/18milan-A-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/18/fashion/18milan-A/18milan-A-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/fashion/18milan-A/18milan-A-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/fashion/18milan-A/18milan-A-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/fashion/18milan-A/18milan-A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2