, 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/c1e41dcb-563c-5277-bc11-838db4b8a568'}, {'abstract': 'There’s not much we can do to rush neurological maturation along in our teens, but we can help kids practice their burgeoning skills of self-control as they emerge.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/18/raising-teenagers-protect-when-you-must-permit-when-you-can/', 'snippet': 'There’s not much we can do to rush neurological maturation along in our teens, but we can help kids practice their burgeoning skills of self-control as they emerge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I don’t think this comes as news to anyone here, but it can be a real challenge to parent and to educate adolescents. My own specimens (boys, 11 and 15) spend their days vacillating between energetic and catatonic, optimistic and morose, ebullient and apathetic. Some days, I doubt that they will be able to forge a safe and successful path into adulthood without my constant help and intervention. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/us/motherlode-permit/motherlode-permit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/18/us/motherlode-permit/motherlode-permit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/us/motherlode-permit/motherlode-permit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/us/motherlode-permit/motherlode-permit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1308, 'width': 1978, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/us/motherlode-permit/motherlode-permit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/18/us/motherlode-permit/motherlode-permit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/us/motherlode-permit/motherlode-permit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Raising Teenagers: Protect When You Must, Permit When You Can', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steinberg, Laurence', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-18T18:02:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jessica Lahey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lahey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c117682-f106-59a9-9412-55c93d98e01b', 'word_count': 829, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c117682-f106-59a9-9412-55c93d98e01b'}, {'abstract': 'Carla Körbes, a principal dancer at Pacific Northwest Ballet and formerly with New York City Ballet, will retire at the end of the 2014-15 season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/19/arts/dance/carla-krbes-at-33-announces-retirement-from-ballet.html', 'snippet': 'Carla Körbes, a principal dancer at Pacific Northwest Ballet and formerly with New York City Ballet, will retire at the end of the 2014-15 season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When a ballerina of a certain age and stature — Alessandra Ferri, Kyra Nichols and, most recently, Wendy Whelan — announces her retirement, it’s heartbreaking, but makes sense. When a dancer, just 33, decides to do the same, it’s shattering, especially when that ballerina is Carla Körbes. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/18ballet-1/18ballet-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/18ballet-1/18ballet-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/18ballet-1/18ballet-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/18ballet-1/18ballet-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1737, 'width': 1737, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/18ballet-1/18ballet-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/18ballet-1/18ballet-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/18ballet-1/18ballet-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Carla Körbes, at 33, Announces Retirement From Ballet', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Star Ballerina, at 33, Decides It Is Time to Retire', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Korbes, Carla', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pacific Northwest Ballet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-18T18:05:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gia Kourlas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kourlas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d717c73-ccdc-51a5-88e6-9bc86b06be84', 'word_count': 747, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d717c73-ccdc-51a5-88e6-9bc86b06be84'}, {'abstract': 'In Guinea, Liberia and Sierra Leone, a total of 5,335 people have been infected and 2,622 have died, while the tally a month ago was 2,458 infections and 1,346 deaths.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/19/world/africa/ebola-deaths-doubled-in-a-month-health-group-says.html', 'snippet': 'In Guinea, Liberia and Sierra Leone, a total of 5,335 people have been infected and 2,622 have died, while the tally a month ago was 2,458 infections and 1,346 deaths.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — The number of people in West Africa who have contracted the Ebola virus and died from the hemorrhagic fever that it causes has doubled in the past month, the World Health Organization reported on Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ebola Deaths Doubled in a Month, Health Group Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subje