n with entertainment in the reality-television series “Human Resources.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'As we began filming TerraCycle’s reality-television show, “Human Resources,” we quickly became aware of the challenges of walking the line between promotion and entertainment. We wanted our clients, customers, vendors, investors and staff to be comfortable with the direction of the show. But we also wanted to keep the content engaging and entertaining enough for viewers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'TerraCycle’s Struggle to Turn Trash Into Compelling TV', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recycling of Waste Materials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Waste Materials and Disposal', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TerraCycle', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-18T20:20:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Szaky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Szaky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea36dd93-de0b-5122-97d0-d95006908f8d', 'word_count': 694, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea36dd93-de0b-5122-97d0-d95006908f8d'}, {'abstract': 'The PBS show “Moyers & Company” will come to a conclusion on Jan. 2.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/18/moyers-show-really-ending-this-time/', 'snippet': 'The PBS show “Moyers & Company” will come to a conclusion on Jan. 2.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 5:07 p.m. | Bill Moyers ha