ensnared by a trafficking and kidnapping ring.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/19/movies/reclaim-a-thriller-starring-john-cusack-and-jacki-weaver.html', 'snippet': 'In “Reclaim,” an American couple trying to adopt a Haitian girl find themselves ensnared by a trafficking and kidnapping ring.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The elements are familiar in Alan White’s thriller “Reclaim”: white, affluent Americans stuck in a lower-income tropical city with police officers of ambiguous morals (one played here by Luis Guzmán); foot pursuits through slums; and car chases with gunplay on winding country roads. There’s even an auto teetering on a cliff as the driver tries to yank the passengers out just in time.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/RECLAIM/RECLAIM-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/RECLAIM/RECLAIM-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/RECLAIM/RECLAIM-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/RECLAIM/RECLAIM-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/RECLAIM/RECLAIM-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/19/arts/RECLAIM/RECLAIM-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnail