e052c2e-11b9-5e86-b6f4-68c37bba7ef5'}, {'abstract': 'The photographer Greg Kessler captures behind-the-scenes beauty transformations during Spring 2015 Fashion Week in Milan.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/18/marta-placzek-transforms-backstage-at-prada/', 'snippet': 'The photographer Greg Kessler captures behind-the-scenes beauty transformations during Spring 2015 Fashion Week in Milan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The photographer Greg Kessler captures behind-the-scenes beauty transformations during Spring 2015 Fashion Week in Milan. Here, the model Marta Placzek before (left) and after (right) makeup by Pat McGrath and hair by Guido Palau.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Marta Placzek Transforms Backstage at Prada', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Milan Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGrath, Pat', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palau, Guido', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Prada SpA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Milan (Italy)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-18T23:02:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Greg Kessler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Greg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kessler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f594ec12-3140-53c9-8bf3-be91e49d84a8', 'word_count': 46, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f594ec12-3140-53c9-8bf3-be91e49d84a8'}, {'abstract': 'Dan Rice wasn’t just one of the most well-known entertainers of the 1860s. He used his circus career to vault into national politics.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/18/the-civil-wars-most-famous-clown/', 'snippet': 'Dan Rice wasn’t just one of the most well-known entertainers of the 1860s. He used his circus career to vault into national politics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A clown ran for public office – and no, that’s not the beginning of a joke. On Sept. 15, 1864, America’s most famous circus clown, Dan Rice, accepted the Democratic nomination for the Pennsylvania State Senate. And it was just his first foray into politics: Even while continuing his career as a clown, a state convention later considered him as a candidate for Congress, and, in 1867, he made a brief but legitimate run for president.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/opinion/18disunion2/18disunion2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 975, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/18/opinion/18disunion2/18disunion2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 975}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/opinion/18disunion2/18disunion2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 631, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/opinion/18disunion2/18disunion2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1025, 'width': 631, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/18/opinion/18disunion2/18disunion2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thu