 will be watching for clues about how well the new models will sell.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/19/mixed-predictions-for-opening-weekend-of-apples-iphone-6-and-6-plus/', 'snippet': 'Eager Apple fans have been lining up to experience the new iPhone 6 and 6 Plus, and investors will be watching for clues about how well the new models will sell.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Apple, the unveiling of the new iPhones is like the debut of a blockbuster movie. Eager fans lined up to be the first to experience the new gadgets. And investors will closely watch first-weekend sales, in much the same way movie producers track box office numbers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/business/19bits-iphone1/19bits-iphone1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 323, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/19/business/19bits-iphone1/19bits-iphone1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 323}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/business/19bits-iphone1/19bits-iphone1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 552, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/business/19bits-iphone1/19bits-iphone1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1104, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/19/business/19bits-iphone1/19bits-iphone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/19/business/19bits-iphone1/19bits-iphone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheig