allway by a gaggle of people in lanyards, followed by their manager and the photographer who travels with them and documents their every move — for their future presidential library, I have to assume. It was late June, and they had just come in from Canada, where they played another gig a few hours before. Had it not been for the double booking, their manager swears they would have been closer to the top of the bill.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '44', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/magazine/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/21/magazine/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/magazine/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/magazine/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/magazine/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/21/magazine/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM/21audience_ss-slide-ZEDM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': No