en granted automatic entry into the 2018 Olympic ice hockey tournament in Pyeongchang despite the country’s low ranking in the sport.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/20/sports/olympics/south-korea-awarded-berths-in-2018-olympic-hockey-tournaments.html', 'snippet': 'South Korea has been granted automatic entry into the 2018 Olympic ice hockey tournament in Pyeongchang despite the country’s low ranking in the sport.', 'lead_paragraph': 'South Korea’s men’s and women’s national teams have been granted automatic entry into the Olympic ice hockey tournaments at the 2018 Winter Games in Pyeongchang, the International Ice Hockey Federation announced Thursday, despite the country’s low ranking in the sport.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'South Korea Is Awarded Berths in 2018 Olympic Tournaments', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'South Korea Is Awarded Berths in 2018 Olympic Tournaments', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Jeff Z', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2018)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Korea', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Ice Hockey Federation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-19T16:20:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6de031b8-cd03-5b32-9a5e-88fc43be27a3'