lo.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/09/19/british-food-delivery-giant-forms-joint-venture-in-brazil/', 'snippet': 'Just Eat, which has been expanding globally, has agreed to merge its Brazil operations with iFood, owned by the mobile company Movile in São Paulo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SÃO PAULO, Brazil — Just Eat, the British online food-ordering giant that has been expanding globally, has decided to join the competition in Brazil rather than continue fighting it. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British Food Delivery Giant Forms Joint Venture in Brazil', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'iFood', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Just Eat PLC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Movile', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-19T16:53:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vinod Sreeharsha', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vinod', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sreeharsha', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02c07a59-aee6-5089-933e-037ae8a4b3de', 'word_count': 562, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02c07a59-aee6-5089-933e-037ae8a4b3de'}, {'abstract': 'Items including awards and even bottles of wine owned by Bradbury are to be auctioned this month.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/19/the-bradbury-chronicles-hundreds-of-items-owned-by-author-going-to-auction/', 'snippet': 'Items including awards and even bottles of wine owned by Bradbury are to be auctioned this month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'About 450 items owned by Ray Bradbury, the prolific science fiction author who died in 2012, are to be auctioned Sept. 25 by Nate D. Sanders, a Los Angeles auction house. The offerings include letters, contracts and other signed items; awards; personal memorabilia; and a collection devoted largely to animation and science fiction art. There is also furniture and even a couple of bottles of vintage wine. Bradbury’s estate expects the auction to bring between $800,000 and $1 million.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Bradbury Chronicles: Hundreds of Items Owned by Author Going to Auction', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bradbury, Ray', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-19T16:56:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9640c818-385b-532a-9342-4a6010826790', 'word_count': 280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9640c818-385b-532a-9342-4a6010826790'}, {'abstract': 'Plus, how to turn off alerts on your Kindle Fire HDX.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/19/technology/personaltech/reporting-bad-behavior-to-facebook.html', 'snippet': 'Plus, how to turn off alerts on your Kindle Fire HDX.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q. If I report hate speech from a “friend” on Facebook to the site, does that person get notified that I filed a complaint?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reporting Bad Behavior to Facebook', 'kicker': 'Q&A', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_he