': 'nyt://article/a0985ae5-940a-5110-951c-7c981dc8f2be'}, {'abstract': 'The veteran indie rock band, which reunited in 2010, is breaking up mid-tour.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/19/guided-by-voices-calls-it-quits-cancels-tour/', 'snippet': 'The veteran indie rock band, which reunited in 2010, is breaking up mid-tour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The innovative and often experimental indie band Guided by Voices announced on its website on Thursday that it was calling it quits, again. The band, led by the prolific singer and songwriter Robert Pollard, was founded in 1987 and broke up, the first time, in 2004. Mr. Pollard reconvened the group’s most successful lineup – the version that toured and recorded from 1993 to 1996 – in 2010, and made six albums with the band, including two (“Motivational Jumpsuit” and “Cool Planet”) released this year. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/artsbeat-voices/artsbeat-voices-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/artsbeat-voices/artsbeat-voices-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/artsbeat-voices/artsbeat-voices-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/artsbeat-voices/artsbeat-voices-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1291, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/artsbeat-voices/artsbeat-voices-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 