': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56b4ce15-f8a8-5bf7-8682-ec16b0a5d23d', 'word_count': 774, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56b4ce15-f8a8-5bf7-8682-ec16b0a5d23d'}, {'abstract': '“More Than Just a Piece of Sky,” inspired by “Yentl,” the 1983 Barbra Streisand film, is part of the Queer New York International Arts Festival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/20/arts/dance/more-than-just-a-piece-of-sky-examines-queer-identity.html', 'snippet': '“More Than Just a Piece of Sky,” inspired by “Yentl,” the 1983 Barbra Streisand film, is part of the Queer New York International Arts Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marissa Perel has a show at the Chocolate Factory Theater, but she won’t get out of bed. It isn’t a case of indolence, exactly, or even fatigue. The bed is onstage, and her lying in it is the central conceit of “More Than Just a Piece of Sky.” The work, which I saw on Thursday, is supposed to be like a dream.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20PEREL/20PEREL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20PEREL/20PEREL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20PEREL/20PEREL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20PEREL/20PEREL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1288, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20PEREL/20PEREL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20PEREL/20PEREL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20PEREL/20PEREL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In a Daze, Reaching for Clarity', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In a Daze, Reaching for Clarity', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perel, Marissa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-19T21:33:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Seibert', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Seibert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/6e25cffc-8150-5578-a02c-cf6063769dc9', 'word_count': 459, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6e25cffc-8150-5578-a02c-cf6063769dc9'}, {'abstract': 'The Miller Theater opened its new season on Thursday with a diverse program, including “Colombine’s Paradise Theater,” a fantasia featuring the new-music ensemble Eighth Blackbird.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/20/arts/music/eighth-blackbird-performs-colombines-paradise-theater.html', 'snippet': 'The Miller Theater opened its new season on Thursday with a diverse program, including “Colombine’s Paradise Theater,” a fantasia featuring the new-music ensemble Eighth Blackbird.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For centuries, the archetypal characters of commedia dell’arte have been mined so thoroughl