f-64d4297e9e61'}, {'abstract': 'Cuban music and jazz merged emphatically in a program that opened Jazz at Lincoln Center’s season on Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/20/arts/music/jazz-at-lincoln-center-opens-its-season-at-rose-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Cuban music and jazz merged emphatically in a program that opened Jazz at Lincoln Center’s season on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cuban music tends to involve a direct discussion: between voice and drums, between voice and chorus, between horn sections. Jazz tends to spread a discussion around, or build a hive of many discussions at once. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20JALC/20JALC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 971, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20JALC/20JALC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 971}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20JALC/20JALC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 633, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20JALC/20JALC-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1795, 'width': 1109, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20JALC/20JALC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/20/arts/20JALC/20JALC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/