 2014” presents 51 objects and installations, including brightly painted metal assemblages, 3D-printed creatures and massive stone constructions. Small ceramic heads clustered on a stone wall seem animated in conversation. In a shaded area, a chair is poised in the limbs of a tree.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/21WESPOT/21WESPOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 903, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/21WESPOT/21WESPOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 903}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/21WESPOT/21WESPOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 681, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/21WESPOT/21WESPOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1361, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/21WESPOT/21WESPOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/21WESPOT/21WESPOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/21WESPOT/21WESPOT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'But Will the Cows Like It? ', 'kicker': 'Spotlight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'But Will the Cows Like It?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Saunders Farm (Garrison, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Garrison (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Collaborative Concepts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-20T01:20:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Hodara', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hodara', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6545b576-b047-52b6-a22f-554389b256c8', 'word_count': 319, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6545b576-b047-52b6-a22f-554389b256c8'}, {'abstract': 'The Dodgers’ star is poised to lead the major leagues in earned run average for the fourth season in a row, something no pitcher has done.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/20/sports/baseball/clayton-kershaw-keeps-aiming-for-new-heights.html', 'snippet': 'The Dodgers’ star is poised to lead the major leagues in earned run average for the fourth season in a row, something no pitcher has done.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — There has been no doubt, for a while now, that Clayton Kershaw is the best pitcher in baseball. Dan Haren was aware of this when he joined the Los Angeles Dodgers this spring after more than a decade with other teams. But Haren still had to be reminded of just what he was about to witness.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/sports/KERSHAW/KERSHAW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/20/spor