rk Lightsey was a first-tier fixture on the New York jazz scene, at Greenwich Village clubs like Bradley’s and Sweet Basil. That time spanned roughly a decade, beginning with his arrival in the early 1980s and ending with his abrupt move to Paris in 1992. He has led a productive career in Europe since then, but his nearly total avoidance of New York has made him seem like that rarest of species: the one that got away. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/arts/21GUIDE2/21GUIDE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 549, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/arts/21GUIDE2/21GUIDE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 549, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/arts/21GUIDE2/21GUIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/21/arts/21GUIDE2/21GUIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Catching Up With an Old Hand', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pop: Catching Up With an Old Hand', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lightsey, Kirk', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Village Vanguard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewis, Victor', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reid, Rufus', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'per