ic motifs and simpler designs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The singular statement earring is all the rage this season; but come next spring, expect to resume wearing the complete pair again. On spring 2015 runways, big, flashy sets have given way to smaller, more delicate drop earrings. In New York, the Altuzarra designers enhanced their ultrafeminine collection with classic cameo drop earrings. Even Miuccia Prada, who is known for her love of statement jewels, scaled back the bling and instead sent modest clusters of crystals down the runway on models’ ears. And today at Bottega, the designer Tomas Maier complemented his cozy collection with small Southwest-inspired turquoise earrings.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20earrings_trend/20earrings_trend-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 235, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20earrings_trend/20earrings_trend-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 235}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20earrings_trend/20earrings_trend-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20earrings_trend/20earrings_trend-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 457, 'width': 1167, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20earrings_trend/20earrings_trend-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20earrings_tren