'}, {'abstract': 'The label invites women to come as they are, with everyday hair, and step into its spring 2015 collection.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/20/milan-fashion-week-spring-2015-a-casual-no-nonsense-updo-at-bottega-veneta/', 'snippet': 'The label invites women to come as they are, with everyday hair, and step into its spring 2015 collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For spring 2015, designers seem to invite women to “come as you are” with the messy, everyday hairstyles they’ve sent down the runway. At Bottega Veneta today, imperfect updos were a welcome break from the long, tousled, parted-down-the-middle waves trending down the runway. With a little length peeking out of the back, and strands of hair pulled out around the face, it’s a style any woman can pull off (if they don’t already) with little-to-no effort.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20dailydo/20dailydo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20dailydo/20dailydo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20dailydo/20dailydo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20dailydo/20dailydo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1325, 'width': 1987, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/20/t-magazine/20dailydo/20dailydo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_nam