 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e33e5dfc-f114-5474-aa64-6b827a863fdc', 'word_count': 1289, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e33e5dfc-f114-5474-aa64-6b827a863fdc'}, {'abstract': 'Congress approved funding for equipping Syrian rebels against Islamic States and lawmakers will discuss their votes on several of the Sunday shows.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/20/sunday-breakfast-menu-sept-21/', 'snippet': 'Congress approved funding for equipping Syrian rebels against Islamic States and lawmakers will discuss their votes on several of the Sunday shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Congress voted to back President Obama’s decision to train and equip the Syrian rebels to fight the militants of the Islamic State. At the United Nations, Secretary of State John Kerry added to the international coalition of countries joining the American-led campaign against the extremists in Iraq and Syria.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunday Breakfast Menu, Sept. 21', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-20T18:55:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elena Schneider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schneider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d0d7bed8-93fb-509b-9cd2-bc40e31bd856', 'word_count': 443, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0d7bed8-93fb-509b-9cd2-bc40e31bd856'}, {'abstract': 'The seascapes program director for Conservation International says she has learned much “from the ocean and from the people whose lives are connected to it.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/21/jobs/underwater-inspiration.html', 'snippet': 'The seascapes program director for Conservation International says she has learned much “from the ocean and from the people whose lives are connected to it.”', 'lead_paragraph': ' Laure S. Katz, 30, is the seascapes program director for Conservation International, based in Arlington, Va., where her job includes leading scuba expeditions across the Asia-Pacific region to help develop marine protection programs.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/business/21-VOCATIONS/21-VOCATIONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/21/business/21-VOCATIONS/21-VOCATIONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/business/21-VOCATIONS/21-VOCATIONS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/business/21-VOCATIONS/21-VOCATIONS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/business/21-VOCATIONS/21-VOCATIONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/21/business/21-VOCATIONS/21-VOCATIONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/business/21-VOCATIONS/21-VOCATIONS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge