ermine the winner.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/21/sports/golf/a-rich-history-of-duels-between-ryder-cup-captains-picks.html', 'snippet': 'The success or failure of the picks by Tom Watson of the United States and Paul McGinley of Europe may well help to determine the winner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In assembling the Ryder Cup teams representing the United States and Europe, the captains made picks that were treated as afterthoughts: the three golfers joining the nine who qualified on a points-for-performance basis in weekly tournaments worldwide over two years. But in the aftermath of the matches that begin Friday at Gleneagles in Scotland, the success or failure of the picks by Tom Watson of the United States and Paul McGinley of Europe may well have helped to determine the winner.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/sports/DOG-anderson-1/DOG-anderson-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 823, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/21/sports/DOG-anderson-1/DOG-anderson-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 823}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/sports/DOG-anderson-1/DOG-anderson-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 747, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/sports/DOG-anderson-1/DOG-anderson-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1493, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/sports/DOG-anderson-1/DOG-anderson-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 