able to influence our behavior on them, for good and ill.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/21/can-we-build-a-safer-internet/', 'snippet': 'We sometimes assume the Internet is a naturally cruel and lawless place. But social networks may be able to influence our behavior on them, for good and ill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We often take it as a given that the Internet is a cruel place, a natural haven for those who seek to harass and threaten others. But to some people, social networks are not mere conduits for our worst impulses. They’re structures whose design can influence how we behave,\xa0for good as well as for ill.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21SAFEWEB/21SAFEWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21SAFEWEB/21SAFEWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21SAFEWEB/21SAFEWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 638, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21SAFEWEB/21SAFEWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 638, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21SAFEWEB/21SAFEWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21SAFEWEB/21SAFEWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image'