l', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/22/fashion/22qanda/22qanda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/fashion/22qanda/22qanda-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Q&A With Rodolfo Paglialunga, the New Designer of Jil Sander', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Minimalism That Has Jil Sander All Over It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Milan Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'September Fashion Week (2014)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paglialunga, Rodolfo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sander, Jil', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-21T16:52:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Koblin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Koblin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a76ba5f-1d76-5799-b40c-5c24bcae20c0', 'word_count': 815, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a76ba5f-1d76-5799-b40c-5c24bcae20c0'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The East German prime minister died in 1964.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/21/1964-otto-grotewohl-dies-at-70/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The East German prime minister died in 1964.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — East German Premier Otto Grotewohl died of a stroke today after a long illness that had kept him politically inactive for several years. He was 70. It was expected he would be succeeded by Willi Stoph, who has been acting premier. Mr. Grotewohl, a former Social Democrat, was regarded as a traitor by West European socialists because of his leading role in merging the Social Democratic party with the Communist party in 1946 to form the Communist-run Socialist Union party. A spokesman for the West German Socialist party said Mr. Grotewohl will always bear the stigma of sacrificing the Social Democratic party in the Soviet zone of Germany. ‘‘He was also responsible for the death and imprisonment of thousands of fellow Social Democrats,’’ the spokesman said. ‘‘Politically, he has been a dead man for the past few years,’’ he said, ‘‘but he still served as bait for the regime.’’ — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Sept. 22, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21iht-old22/21iht-old22-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21iht-old22/21iht-old22-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 633}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21iht-old22/21iht-old22-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 758, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21iht-old22/21iht-old22-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 758, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/blogs/21iht-old22/21iht-old22-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail',