], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/0886ecc4-322b-53f0-bc98-d848cac1c956', 'word_count': 1231, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0886ecc4-322b-53f0-bc98-d848cac1c956'}, {'abstract': 'Critics hailed the ingenuity of Mr. Wheeler’s compositions, which were unfailingly melodic but often veered in unexpected directions, and the understated grace of his playing style.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/22/arts/music/kenny-wheeler-influential-sound-in-jazz-dies-at-84.html', 'snippet': 'Critics hailed the ingenuity of Mr. Wheeler’s compositions, which were unfailingly melodic but often veered in unexpected directions, and the understated grace of his playing style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kenny Wheeler, a jazz trumpeter, flugelhornist and composer who was as comfortable improvising with uncompromising avant-gardists like the saxophonist Anthony Braxton as he was writing challenging arrangements for a big band, died on Thursday in London. He was 84.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/arts/wheeler-obit/wheeler-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/22/arts/wheeler-obit/wheeler-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/arts/wheeler-obit/wheeler-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/arts/wheeler-obit/wheeler-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/arts/wheeler-obit/wheeler-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/22/arts/wheeler-obit/wheeler-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/arts/wheeler-obit/wheeler-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Kenny Wheeler, Influential Sound in Jazz, Dies at 84', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kenny Wheeler, 84, Influential Jazz Sound', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wheeler, Kenny (1930-2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keepnews, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ECM (Record Label)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-22T03:45:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Keepnews', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keepnews', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/1cd9959d-9d6a-53ac-9242-94906735e9f6', 'word_count': 599, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1cd9959d-9d6a-53ac-9242-94906735e9f6'}, {'abstract': 'Rahua adds a trio of items to its existing lineup of natural hair products.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/22/t-magazine/rahua-body-wash-amazon-rain-forest.html', 'snippet': 'Rahua adds a trio of items to its existing lineup of natural hair products.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The eco-conscious brand Rahua boasts the ultimate in natural resources, the Amazon rain forest, as the foundation of its hair products. There, women in the Quechua-Shuar tribes have cultivated rahua oil, derived from the rare Ungurahua nut, for centuries. That they have long, silky hair is no coincidence — the oil tames and fortifies strands, even in the region’s hot and humid climate. About two decades ago, the hairstylist Fabian Lliguin began using it on his clients in New York. He even bottled it to create a 100 percent natural line of hair products: shampoos, conditioners, treatments and sprays. And today, his company introduces its first set of potions for the body — a shower gel ($30), body lotion ($48) and oil ($57) — infused with additional ingredients indigenous to the Amazon rain forest such as Sacha Inchi and Buriti oils.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22rahua/22rahua-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 578, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22rahua/22rahua-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 578}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22rahua/22rahua-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 987, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22rahua/22rahua-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1570, 'width': 1629, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22rahua/22rahua-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, '