iticism for conducting head-of-state-style reviews of students participating in military-style training.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/22/schools-under-fire-for-too-much-pomp-in-military-training/', 'snippet': 'College administrators in the eastern Chinese province of Anhui have come under criticism for conducting head-of-state-style reviews of students participating in military-style training.', 'lead_paragraph': 'College administrators in the eastern Chinese province of Anhui have come under criticism for conducting reviews of students participating in military-style training in a style reminiscent of a head of state. At two private colleges in Hefei, school officials rode in black Audis, the car favored by government cadres, and one of the officials parroted lines that could have come from the Chinese president’s mouth on a National Day celebration.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Schools Under Fire for Too Much Pomp in Military Training', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hu Jintao', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shi Xiuhe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Audi Division of Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "People's Liberation Army (China)", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Anhui (China)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hunan Province (China)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-22T11:44:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_na