e': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33552c63-aefd-5df4-8483-702ef91f4b58', 'word_count': 1365, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33552c63-aefd-5df4-8483-702ef91f4b58'}, {'abstract': 'The giant climate march in Manhattan was just one facet of humanity’s long climate and energy march.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/22/humanitys-long-climate-and-energy-march/', 'snippet': 'The giant climate march in Manhattan was just one facet of humanity’s long climate and energy march.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The People’s Climate March, a globe-spanning set of demonstrations centered in Manhattan, was a testament to environmentalists’ fortitude and organizational skills and a spreading sense that humanity’s fossil-fueled path — and, for some, the economic model underpinning it — is not sustainable.\xa0I\xa0was glad to see big contingents of students in the crowds, representing the generation that inherits the epic task of shifting humanity’s energy menu.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/20140921-MARCH-slide-RUW0/20140921-MARCH-slide-RUW0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/20140921-MARCH-slide-RUW0/20140921-MARCH-slide-RUW0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/20140921-MARCH-slide-RUW0/20140921-MARCH-slide-RUW0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/21/nyregion/20140921-MARCH-slide-RUW0/20140921-MARCH-slide-RUW0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 13