European strategy until the end of this year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/23/business/international/air-france-pilots-vow-to-extend-strike-indefinitely.html', 'snippet': 'The pilots’ union dismissed an offer by management to postpone the implementation of a new European strategy until the end of this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Air France pilots rejected a proposal from management on Monday and vowed to extend indefinitely a strike that has grounded tens of thousands of passengers over the last week and threatens to wipe out tens of millions of dollars in revenue.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Air France Pilots Vow to Extend Strike Indefinitely', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Air France Pilots Vow to Continue Their Strike', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AIR FRANCE-KLM', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Strikes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pilots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-22T18:46:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicola Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicola', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dde0ac4d-256d-5247-b416-4532425fa47f', 'word_count': 621, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dde0ac4d-256d-5247-b416-4532425fa47f'}, {'abstract': 'Jon Caramanica and Ben Ratliff discuss the challenges of appraising Chris Brown.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2014/09/19/arts/music/19popcast_pod.html', 'snippet': 'Jon Caramanica and Ben Ratliff discuss the challenges of appraising Chris Brown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jon Caramanica and Ben Ratliff discuss the challenges of appraising Chris Brown.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We Talk About When We Talk About Chris Brown', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-22T18:50:07+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/34be360e-4dd9-5b09-be51-22a048eb4433', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/34be360e-4dd9-5b09-be51-22a048eb4433'}, {'abstract': 'An exclusive interview with Jennifer Whalen, who is serving time for ordering pills online for her 16-year-old daughter to induce a miscarriage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/22/magazine/a-mother-in-jail-for-helping-her-daughter-have-an-abortion.html', 'snippet': 'An exclusive interview with Jennifer Whalen, who is serving time for ordering pills online for her 16-year-old daughter to induce a miscarriage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Sept. 12th, Jennifer Whalen, a 39-year-old mother of three in the rural town of Washingtonville, Pa., went to jail to begin serving a 9-to-18-month sentence. Whalen’s crime was, in effect, ordering pills online that her older daughter took in the first several weeks of an unplanned pregnancy, when she was 16, to induce a miscarriage. The medication was a combination of mifepristone (formerly called RU-486) and misoprostol. The drugs have been available from a doctor with a prescription in the United States since 2000 and are used around the world to induce miscarriage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/magazine/22abortion-pill-copy/22abortion-pill-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 326, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge