 'word_count': 655, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dfaa172d-a898-5fd1-b410-aad1bc8ca24d'}, {'abstract': 'Several hundred protesters gathered outside the Met on Monday for a noisy demonstration calling for it to cancel its performances of John Adams’s “The Death of Klinghoffer.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/23/arts/music/protests-over-klinghoffer-planned-for-mets-opening-night.html', 'snippet': 'Several hundred protesters gathered outside the Met on Monday for a noisy demonstration calling for it to cancel its performances of John Adams’s “The Death of Klinghoffer.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some traditions of opening night at the Metropolitan Opera go back decades, like beginning with “The Star-Spangled Banner,” while others are more recent, like showing the operas free on outdoor movie screens at Lincoln Center and Times Square. When operagoers arrived for opening night on Monday, they were greeted with an even newer tradition: street protests.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/arts/23METOPERA/23METOPERA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/23/arts/23METOPERA/23METOPERA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/arts/23METOPERA/23METOPERA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 703, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/arts/23METOPERA/23METOPERA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1407, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': '