iddleeast/un-food-program-warns-of-coming-cuts-to-aid.html', 'snippet': 'The World Food Program says that because of reduced resources, rations for refugees from Syria and elsewhere will be reduced.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNITED NATIONS — Just months after a United Nations Security Council resolution pressed Syria to open several of its border crossings to humanitarian aid convoys, money has dried up and allotments of grain and lentils are set to shrink significantly next month, the head of the World Food Program said Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Food Program Warns of Cuts to Its Relief Efforts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'United Nations Food Program Warns of Cuts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Food Program', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sierra Leone', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Liberia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guinea', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Aid', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cousin, Ertharin', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-22T20:27:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_mate