broken nation came a step closer to healing as Lincoln announced that he would issue the Emancipation Proclamation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/09/22/on-this-day-emancipation-is-announced/', 'snippet': 'On this day in 1862, less than a week after Antietam, the bloodiest day of battle in American history, a broken nation came a step closer to healing as Lincoln announced that he would issue the Emancipation Proclamation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PhotoCredit ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On This Day: Lincoln Frees (Some of) the Slaves', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Emancipation Proclamation (1863)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Slavery', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lincoln, Abraham', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-22T21:32:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Rappeport', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rappeport', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cbb7901d-b6f6-51f4-88b9-bff5fee5235e', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cbb7901d-b6f6-51f4-88b9-bff5fee5235e'}, {'abstract': 'Hotel managers are relying more and more on reviews from websites like TripAdvisor for direction regarding renovations and upgrades of their facilities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/23/business/hotels-use-online-reviews-as-blueprint-for-renovations.html', 'snippet': 'Hotel managers are relying more and more on reviews from websites like TripAdvisor for direction reg