d': 'nyt://article/49ad53f1-f57a-5738-8038-6227cbd4649d', 'word_count': 938, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49ad53f1-f57a-5738-8038-6227cbd4649d'}, {'abstract': 'Secretary of State John Kerry and Irina Bokova, the chief of Unesco, will appear together at a program on antiquities Monday, three years after the United States pulled funding for the agency.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/news/un-general-assembly/2014/09/22/kerry-to-participate-in-unesco-event/', 'snippet': 'Secretary of State John Kerry and Irina Bokova, the chief of Unesco, will appear together at a program on antiquities Monday, three years after the United States pulled funding for the agency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 9:58 p.m. | Three years after the United States pulled its funding from Unesco over the admission of Palestinians as full members, Secretary of State John Kerry made an unusual appearance Monday evening alongside the agency’s executive director, Irina Bokova, to draw attention to one of Unesco’s principal mandates: the need to protect antiquities.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kerry Participates in Unesco Event', 'kicker': 'United Nations General Assembly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bokova, Irina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerry, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-22T22:34:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73a9ed7b-4558-5e62-94a0-9a111a03b