a8a-4ba969c6dc00'}, {'abstract': 'A more effective running game, which has racked up 243 yards in the Giants’ last six quarters, has reduced the pressure on Manning to put up big passing statistics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/23/sports/football/giants-ground-game-sharpens-eli-mannings-aim.html', 'snippet': 'A more effective running game, which has racked up 243 yards in the Giants’ last six quarters, has reduced the pressure on Manning to put up big passing statistics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Giants’ new quarterback coach, Danny Langsdorf, said during training camp that the team wanted Eli Manning to complete 70 percent of his passes in the regular season. It is an understatement to say that Langsdorf’s comment produced something of an uproar. Nationwide, the remark elicited mostly guffaws. Manning had completed only 57.5 percent of his passes the previous season. His career completion percentage was 58.5, and his career high in any season was 62.9 percent in 2010. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-GIANTS/Y-GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-GIANTS/Y-GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-GIANTS/Y-GIANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-GIANTS/Y-GIANTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1294, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': N