e Jets did not catch. They did not bat down passes. They committed turnovers. They did not sustain drives. And they did not monitor Martellus Bennett, who scored what proved the winning touchdown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Rex Ryan windmilled his arm and stamped his foot and flung his hat to the turf, and at that moment it required a supreme amount of willpower for him not to run on the field, gather the Jets and give them an impromptu lesson in fundamentals.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1477, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hapless in Big Moments, Jets Fall to the Chicago Bears', 'kicker': 'Bears 27, Jets 19', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hapless in Big Moments, Jets Fall to the Bears ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bennett, Martellus', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Geno', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Bears', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-23T04:21:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/461b616e-ff6d-561b-bfef-fbf32b1730d4', 'word_count': 1367, 'uri': 'nyt://article/461b616e-ff6d-561b-bfef-fbf32b1730d4'}, {'abstract': 'No major laws are likely to pass in the next two years, regardless of which party controls the Senate. The reasons that the midterms matter are subtler.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/23/upshot/why-senate-control-matters.html', 'snippet': 'No major laws are likely to pass in the next two years, regardless of which party controls the Senate. The reasons that the midterms matter are subtler.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Democrats need to find a way to succeed in two red states this year. If they can do that — preventing Republican victories in some combination of Alaska, Arkansas, Kansas, Louisiana or North Carolina — Democrats can pull off a modest upset and keep control of the Senate this year. Otherwise, Mitch McConnell will probably achieve his dream of becoming Senate m