nding, but just barely, with the index falling to its lowest level this year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/24/business/international/eurozone-growth-is-slowing-survey-of-purchasing-managers-suggests.html', 'snippet': 'The survey showed that business activity in September was still expanding, but just barely, with the index falling to its lowest level this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The eurozone’s economic expansion continued to lose traction in September, a private-sector report said on Tuesday, the latest indication that the stagnation of the second quarter might be taking hold.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Eurozone Growth Is Slowing, Survey of Purchasing Managers Suggests', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'European Output Index Falls to Low for Year', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jolly, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Markit Group Ltd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-23T09:23:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Jolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jolly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fd2e949-cac4-5acd-80c8-22453de9c7e5', 'word_count': 441, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fd2e949-cac4-5acd-80c8-22453de9c7e5'}, {'abstract': 'After a summer of acrimonious contract negotiations, the opera began its season with a production of “Le Nozze di Figaro” by the British director Richard Eyre.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/24/arts/music/metropolitan-opera-opens-with-le-nozze-di-figaro.html', 'snippet': 'After a summer of acrimonious contract negotiations, the opera began its season with a production of “Le Nozze di Figaro” by the British director Richard Eyre.', 'lead_paragraph': 'That the Metropolitan Opera opened its season as scheduled on Monday night with a new production of Mozart’s “Le Nozze di Figaro” was good news, no matter what your take on the show. This summer, as acrimonious contract negotiations between the administration and the unionized workers reached a bitter impasse, the possibility of a lockout that could threaten the season was all too real.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/24/arts/24LENOZZE/24NO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/24/arts/24LENOZZE/24NO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/24/arts/24LENOZZE/24NO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/24/arts/24LENOZZE/24NO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/24/arts/24LENOZZE/24NO