a sense of his experience at the Freetown burial site.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ebola: A Grave Site Report', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nossiter, Adam', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sierra Leone', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-23T16:08:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Nossiter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nossiter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b9f7571-3ad7-5ffe-acaa-d3071a7f7911', 'word_count': 251, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b9f7571-3ad7-5ffe-acaa-d3071a7f7911'}, {'abstract': 'The message of the moment is to embrace the act of cooking dinner. It is an easy habit to form, and offers many benefits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/24/dining/just-make-dinner-a-manifesto-for-home-cooking.html', 'snippet': 'The message of the moment is to embrace the act of cooking dinner. It is an easy habit to form, and offers many benefits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just cook. That is the message of the moment, the act to embrace. Just cook dinner. It is a habit as easy to form as a bad one, and more beneficial by far. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Make Dinner: A Home Cooking Manifesto', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Just Cook', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sifton, Sam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'