mbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/business/dealbook/dbpix-rocket/dbpix-rocket-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/23/business/dealbook/dbpix-rocket/dbpix-rocket-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/business/dealbook/dbpix-rocket/dbpix-rocket-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rocket Internet of Germany Sets Price Range for Its I.P.O.', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rocket I.P.O.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-23T19:30:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c41f2543-0ee6-5694-abc9-5e422f8ca0c0', 'word_count': 441, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c41f2543-0ee6-5694-abc9-5e422f8ca0c0'}, {'abstract': 'The artist has assembled a cabinet of curiosities using items from the storied boutique. An online auction mirroring its contents will take place next month on Paddle8.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/23/damien-hirst-deyrolle-collaboration-paddle-8/', 'snippet': 'The artist has assembled a cabinet of curiosities using items from the storied boutique. An online auction mirroring its contents will take place next month on Paddle8.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Deyrolle, the storied Paris taxidermy and entomology shop, has been cataloguing specimens of the natural world since 1831, providing a resource for researchers, scientists and artists — including Salvador Dalí and Jean Dubuffet — along the way. Now, just in time for Paris Fashion Week, the boutique is showcasing a collaboration with the artist Damien Hirst, whose work addresses themes of man’s relationship to nature. Hirst has assembled a cabinet of curiosities — titled “Signification (Hope, Immortality and Death in Paris, Now and Then)” — drawn from Deyrolle’s collections. In it, his favored leitmotifs (butterflies, skulls) are mixed with manmade objects (bottles of Raid and the British household cleaning product Domestos), teasing out themes of nature versus manufacture, the organic versus the inanimate.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/t-magazine/23deyrolle-moroz/23deyrolle-moroz-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/23/t-magazine/23deyrolle-moroz/23deyrolle-moroz-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/t-magazine/23deyrolle-moroz/23deyrolle-moroz-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/t-magazine/23deyrolle-moroz/23deyrolle-moroz-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/t-magazine/23deyrolle-moroz/23deyrolle-moroz-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/23/t-magazine/23deyrolle-moroz/23deyrolle-moroz-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/t-magazine/23deyrolle-moroz/23deyrolle-moroz-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Damien Hirst Collaborates With Deyrolle, Paris’s Treasure Trove of Taxidermy', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Perfect Pairing: Curiosities', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hirst, Damien', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deyrolle (Paris, France, Retailer)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-23T19:30:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Moroz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moroz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c397d3c0-1376-5a95-baea-9e2f81a63e81', 'word_count': 296, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c397d3c0-1376-5a95-baea-9e2f81a63e81'}, {'abstract': 'Climate activists should note that the arms-reduction movement is experiencing significant setbacks.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/23/from-nuclear-freeze-to-global-warming-and-back/', 'snippet': 'Climate activists should note that the arms-reduction movement is experiencing significant setbacks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In June 1982, up to a million demonstrators gathered in Central Park calling for a nuclear freeze. They were protesting the Reagan-era nuclear arms buildup and other developments they saw, not unreasonably, as a threat to civilization and to life on Earth, including talk by some Reagan aides about fighting and winning a nuclear war.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Nuclear Freeze to Global Warming – and Back', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caldicott, Helen Broinowski', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gore, Al', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-23T19:30:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Teresa Tritch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Teresa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tritch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/14342957-32b4-5622-95ea-82703c568979', 'word_count': 559, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14342957-32b4-5622-95ea-82703c568979'}, {'abstract': 'The second edition of “True Detective,” once again written by Nic Pizzolatto, will begin production this fall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/24/business/media/colin-farrell-and-vince-vaughn-to-star-in-season-2-of-hbos-true-detective.html', 'snippet': 'The second edition of “True Detective,” once again written by Nic Pizzolatto, will begin production this fall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HBO will try to repeat the success of its series