82f45600', 'word_count': 401, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0af1b3f0-fd50-5f7f-8d16-a47282f45600'}, {'abstract': 'President Xi Jinping lends his authority to efforts to restrict democratic expansion during meeting with some of territory’s leading tycoons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/24/world/asia/chinese-president-sends-signal-against-political-change-in-hong-kong.html', 'snippet': 'President Xi Jinping lends his authority to efforts to restrict democratic expansion during meeting with some of territory’s leading tycoons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — President Xi Jinping of China has used a meeting with some of Hong Kong’s leading industrialists to reinforce Beijing’s unyielding position against political change in the former British colony, lending his personal authority to the government’s efforts to undermine the pro-democracy movement here and to signal to the city’s business elite that it should toe the official line.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/25/business/25hongkong-01/25hongkong-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 463, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/25/business/25hongkong-01/25hongkong-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 463}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/25/business/25hongkong-01/25hongkong-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 791, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/25/business/25hongkong-01/25hongkong-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1582, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09