Paris Fashion Week, the chic native — whose shirting-based collection is stocked at Barneys New York and Dover Street Market — shares a list of her favorite places around town with T.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Atlantique Ascoli is to design-world lore what\xa0Charlotte Gainsbourg is to music legend: a Parisian daughter of two extremely cool people who grew up to create extremely cool things on her own. Ascoli’s mother, the fashion designer and onetime model Emmanuelle Khanh, personified Parisian chic in the ’70s and ’80s; her father, Quasar Khanh, is an avant-garde icon who pioneered inflatable furniture and a glass-cube car, among other inventions. Such an upbringing, Ascoli says, taught her to “be open, regardless of the situation.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22atlantique-hartman/22atlantique-hartman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22atlantique-hartman/22atlantique-hartman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22atlantique-hartman/22atlantique-hartman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22atlantique-hartman/22atlantique-hartman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/t-magazine/22atlantique-hartman/22atlantique-hartman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumb