m here voluntarily” during a 25-minute videotaped confession to the police.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/24/nyregion/detective-in-etan-patz-case-admits-he-added-words-to-suspects-transcript.html', 'snippet': 'The officer, at a hearing in Manhattan, said Pedro Hernandez did not say “I am here voluntarily” during a 25-minute videotaped confession to the police.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just before he was about to confess his role in the death of Etan Patz, the suspect offered a blander assertion, according to a transcript of his confession: “I am here voluntarily.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Detective in Etan Patz Case Admits He Added Words to Suspect’s Transcript', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Detective in Patz Case Added Words to Transcript', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Patz, Etan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hernandez, Pedro (1961- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'SoHo (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-24T01:11:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/085ec74b-4d7a-5768-affb-04941486f6c1', 'word_count': 657, 'uri': 'nyt://article/085ec74b-4d7a-5768-affb-04941486f6c1'}, {'abstract': 'Oklahoma and Baylor appeared to be well positioned to challenge college football’s reigning kingpin, the Southeastern Conference, thanks to improved defenses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/24/sports/ncaafootball/in-offense-rich-big-12-defense-rises.html', 'snippet': 'Oklahoma and Baylor appeared to be well positioned to challenge college football’s reigning kingpin, the Southeastern Conference, thanks to improved defenses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Morgantown, W.Va., on Saturday night, it looked like just another Big 12 scoring spectacle — for a half. There were sparks flying on the scoreboard, receivers out of breath and defenses flummoxed. No. 4 Oklahoma was tied, 24-24, with West Virginia, and all the conjecture that the Sooners, a national championship contender, had made strides in fixing their defense during the past two seasons seemed overblown in the 30-minute offensive bonanza. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/24/sports/ncaafootball/24big12-1/24big12-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 454, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/24/sports/ncaafootball/24big12-1/24big12-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 454}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/24/sports/ncaafootball/24big12-1/24big12-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 774, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/24/sports/ncaafootball/24big12-1/24big12-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1549, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/24/sports/ncaafootball/24big12-1/24big12-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 