e gate each time for lack of beds. He died at home, his arms thrashing violently and blood spewing out his mouth, in front of his sons.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Liberia, Home Deaths Spread Circle of Ebola Contagion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Home Deaths Spread Circle of Contagion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Onishi, Norimitsu', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Liberia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sierra Leone', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Doctors Without Borders', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Monrovia (Liberia)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-24T19:08:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Norimitsu Onishi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Norimitsu', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Onishi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43a50dee-76e4-5d62-9ca1-b5943d4238e4', 'word_count': 1468, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43a50dee-76e4-5d62-9ca1-b5943d4238e4'}, {'abstract': 'The director’s public service announcement about elephant poaching will be shown Saturday, and Ms. Bigelow will moderate a panel on the subject.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/24/kathryn-bigelow-joins-new-york-film-festival-lineup/', 'snippet': 'The director’s public service announcement about elephant poaching will be shown Saturday, and Ms. Bigelow will moderate a panel on the subject.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The premiere of a short film by the director Kathryn Bigelow (“Zero Dark Thirty”) about elephant poaching has been added to the New York Film Festival, the Film Society of Lincoln Center, which organizes the annual festival, announced on Wednesday. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kathryn Bigelow Joins New York Film Festival Lineup', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Bigelow Short to Run at New York Film Fest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Film Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poaching (Wildlife)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bigelow, Kathryn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Film Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-24T19:09:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lori Holcomb-Holland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lori', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holcomb-Holland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c525295c-6178-5910-888b-f1c07a44cd27', 'word_count': 197, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c525295c-6178-5910-888b-f1c07a44cd27'}, {'abstract': '“The Assassination of Margaret Thatcher” is Hilary Mantel’s latest short story collection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/books/the-assassination-of-margaret-thatcher-by-hilary-mantel.html', 'snippet': '“The Assassination of Margaret Thatcher” is Hilary Mantel’s latest short story collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Neither “Wolf Hall” nor “Bring Up the Bodies” is the Hilary Mantel book most relevant to “The Assassinatio