o end its claim that the federal government mismanaged tribal resources.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/us/navajos-to-get-554-million-to-settle-suit-against-us.html', 'snippet': 'The Navajo Nation will receive $554 million after agreeing to end its claim that the federal government mismanaged tribal resources.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOULDER, Colo. — In the largest settlement obtained by an American Indian tribe from the federal government, the Navajo Nation will receive $554 million to end a lawsuit alleging that the government mismanaged the community’s assets for more than 50 years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Navajos to Get $554 Million to Settle Suit Against U.S.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Navajos to Get $554 Million to Settle Suit Against U.S.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Native Americans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Navajo Indians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-25T00:04:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Turkewitz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Turkewitz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef1e7915-3135-5b4f-ad63-a7f08dd884a5', 'word_count': 512, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef1e7915-3135-5b4f-ad63-a7f08dd884a5'}, {'abstract': 'Montana’s Trail House recreates a sliver of the backwoods in a former auto repair shop in Bushwick, Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/fashion/bars-montanas-trail-house-