c24b4'}, {'abstract': 'For the first and only time, Jeter is set to play a game at Yankee Stadium with his team eliminated from playoff contention, and looking to rebuild for the future.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/sports/baseball/an-ouster-on-derek-jeters-way-out.html', 'snippet': 'For the first and only time, Jeter is set to play a game at Yankee Stadium with his team eliminated from playoff contention, and looking to rebuild for the future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Derek Jeter has played 1,390 regular-season games in the Bronx, and in every one of them, the Yankees have been alive for a playoff spot or have already clinched one. That could change on Thursday, when Jeter is set to play his first and only home game with the Yankees eliminated from the postseason.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/25/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 493, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/25/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 493}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/25/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 842, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/25/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1684, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/25/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/25/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/25/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Ouster on Derek Jeter’s Way Out', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Ouster on Jeter’s Way Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kepner, Tyler', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-25T01:13:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/194a1a84-55d7-50e5-97c2-d047ab58f73d', 'word_count': 907, 'uri': 'nyt://article/194a1a84-55d7-50e5-97c2-d047ab58f73d'}, {'abstract': 'The United Nations Security Council should take on the growing threat of foreign fighters, but it must adhere to the rule of law and human rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/opinion/a-new-focus-on-foreign-fighters.html', 'snippet': 'The United Nations Security Council should take on the growing threat of foreign fighters, but it must adhere to the rule of law and human rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In response to President Obama’s reassertion of American leadership in the Middle East, the United Nations Security Council moved to stanch the flow of foreign fighters, including those joining the Islamic State, by demanding that nations adopt laws to prevent their citizens from traveling abroad to join these groups. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Focus on Foreign Fighters ', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New Focus on Foreign Fighters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Middle East', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-25T01:15:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b45d5d92-26a8-5db5-aa63-4bb4b8555cdc', 'word_count': 666, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b45d5d92-26a8-5db5-aa63-4bb4b8555cdc'}, {'abstract': 'In appearances across New York, President Hassan Rouhani of Iran seems intent on conveying how different he is from his predecessor ahead of the United Nations General Assembly meeting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/world/middleeast/iranian-president-praises-cooperation-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'In appearances across New York, President Hassan Rouhani of Iran seems intent on conveying how different he is from his predecessor ahead of the United Nations General Assembly meeting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In two days of back-to-back interviews, speeches and meetings in New York this week, President Hassan Rouhani of Iran has gone to some lengths to sound much like President Obama in describing the need to defeat Islamic radicals and to seize what may well be a last opportunity over the next two months to reach an accord with the West over Iran’s nuclear program.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iranian President Praises Cooperation in New York', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iranian President Praises Cooperation in New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rouhani, Hassan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Assembly (UN)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-25T01:18:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsec