 the cost of keeping the aging system in working order at $32 billion, outpacing available funding by over $15 billion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/nyregion/in-mta-capital-budget-a-reappearing-cash-gap.html', 'snippet': 'The budget proposal released by the Metropolitan Transportation Authority put the cost of keeping the aging system in working order at $32 billion, outpacing available funding by over $15 billion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every five years, the Metropolitan Transportation Authority unveils a glossy long-term plan for its vast system of trains, buses and bridges. This week, the capital proposal it released put the cost of keeping the aging system in working order at $32 billion.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In M.T.A. Capital Budget, a Reappearing Cash Gap', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In M.T.A. Capital Budget, a Reappearing Cash Gap', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Transportation Authority', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fitzsimmons, Emma G', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transit Systems', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subways', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-25T03:15:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emma G. Fitzsimmons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emma', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'Fitzsimmons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0e6b54b-15c6-5986-9de8-18621ea62c81', 'word_count': 972, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0e6b54b-15c6-5986-9de8-18621ea62c81'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, September 25, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-thursday-september-25-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, September 25, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You come from a great tradition that stands for education, not ignorance; innovation, not destruction; the dignity of life, not murder. Those who call you away from this path are betraying this tradition, not defending it. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-25T03:19:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/a76141f7-93a0-5651-a698-05895f7a43b8', 'word_count': 56, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a76141f7-93a0-5651-a698-05895f7a43b8'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. McNamara, a former police chief in San Jose, Calif., and in Kansas City, Mo., was known for the farsighted policies he implemented and for his iconoclastic outspokenness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/us/joseph-d-mcnamara-father-of-community-policing-dies-at-79.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. McNamara, a former police chief in San Jose, Calif., and in Kansas City, Mo., was known for the farsighted policies he implemented and for his iconoclastic outspokenness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joseph D. McNamara, a onetime New York City patrolman who earned a doctorate from Harvard and went on to become a California police chief whose pio