t': 'A new poll has Senator Mark R. Warner, the Democratic incumbent in Virginia, up by 9 points over his Republican opponent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Senator Mark R. Warner, the Democratic incumbent in Virginia, has opened up a 9-point lead over his Republican opponent, Ed Gillespie, according to a poll released on Thursday by Quinnipiac University.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Warner Holds a 9-Point Lead in Virginia, Poll Finds', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gillespie, Ed', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warner, Mark R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Quinnipiac University', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-25T11:56:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marjorie Connelly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marjorie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Connelly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/407c36f3-c602-5bf1-8891-44bd8371a349', 'word_count': 166, 'uri': 'nyt://article/407c36f3-c602-5bf1-8891-44bd8371a349'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The Germans prepare for attacks in Tanzania in 1889.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/1889-wissmann-plans-attacks/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The Germans prepare for attacks in Tanzania in 1889.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The German Captain Wissmann has been at Bagamoyo for some time, and all the tailors in Zanzibar have been busy, making white cotton uniforms and bags for provisions. He is organizing a force of 2,000 men, with which he announces that he intends to proceed into the interior and attack Bushiri, who appears to be encamped somewhere near Mpwapwa. After defeating the Arab who has given him so much trouble, and hanging him if he falls into his hands, Captain Wissmann will proceed to Kilima ’Njara. — The New York Herald, European Edition, September 26, 1889', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1889: Wissmann Plans Attacks', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tanzania', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-25T11:59:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86143c05-cf39-57cf-8725-ecc35c6e27b2', 'word_count': 106, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86143c05-cf39-57cf-8725-ecc35c6e27b2'}, {'abstract': '“Star Wars Rebels” is a new computer-animated series on Disney Channel and Disney XD that aspires to capture the flavor of George Lucas’s original trilogy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/28/arts/television/star-wars-rebels-emulates-the-trilogy-of-old.html', 'snippet': '“Star Wars Rebels” is a new computer-animated series on Disney Channel and Disney XD that aspires to capture the flavor of George Lucas’s original trilogy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Forget the new “Star Wars” movie for now. At Lucasfilm headquarters here, the pressure is arguably more intense on a new animated TV series: “Rebels,” making its cable debut early next month, not only represents a dramatic shift back to non-prequel stories — for the first time since 1998 — it also formally ushers in the studio’s Disney era.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/arts/28STARWARS/28STARWARS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/28/arts/28STARWARS/28STARWARS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/arts/28STARWARS/28STARWARS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/arts/28STARWARS/28STARWARS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/arts/28STARWARS/28STARWARS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/28/arts/28STARWARS/28STARWARS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/arts/28STARWARS/28STARWARS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Empire Renewed ', 'ki