ri': 'nyt://article/176bc040-3d39-5667-9744-73bc8d24de71'}, {'abstract': 'My mother and I were out running errands one afternoon when she pulled the car over and told me the truth. It sounded like something from a horror movie.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/25/my-fathers-a-l-s/', 'snippet': 'My mother and I were out running errands one afternoon when she pulled the car over and told me the truth. It sounded like something from a horror movie.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was in college, my father David started walking with an odd, barely perceptible limp. He was in his mid-40s, a gregarious physician, teacher and researcher who was always upbeat. He told his four kids that he had a “back problem” — a deliberately vague cover story that I, for one, was willing to believe. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/health/well_als_roni/well_als_roni-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 754, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/22/health/well_als_roni/well_als_roni-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 754}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/health/well_als_roni/well_als_roni-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 967, 'width': 769, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/health/well_als_roni/well_als_roni-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 967, 'width': 769, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/22/health/well_als_roni/well_als_roni-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumb