online video, Chief Thomas Jackson expressed regret for the death of Michael Brown and the four hours it took officers to remove his body from the street.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/26/us/ferguson-police-chief-apology-michael-brown.html', 'snippet': 'In an online video, Chief Thomas Jackson expressed regret for the death of Michael Brown and the four hours it took officers to remove his body from the street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chief Thomas Jackson of the police force in Ferguson, Mo., issued a stark apology to the family of Michael Brown on Thursday, saying in a videotaped statement that he was sorry for the death of their son and for the four hours that the body of the unarmed 18-year-old lay in the street after he was fatally shot by a police officer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In a Video, Police Chief of Ferguson Apologizes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In a Video, Police Chief of Ferguson Apologizes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Michael (1996-2014)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ferguson (Mo)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Thomas (Ferguson, Mo, Police Chief)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Apologies', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Darren (1986- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-25T15:13:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 