as-you-charlie-a-feature-debut-about-dashed-hopes.html', 'snippet': '“It Was You Charlie,” written and directed by Emmanuel Shirinian, focuses on a man whose dream woman is wooed by his brother.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Abner Roth (Michael D. Cohen) has a birthday tradition: Every year, he and his brother, Tom (Aaron Abrams), go to see “On the Waterfront” at the Fox Theater in Toronto. (You presume that the movie house knows to program that film every year.) Like Marlon Brando’s character, Abner feels the sting of his brother’s betrayal. The day he turns 40, Abner learns that Tom is dating the love of Abner’s life, Madeleine (Anna Hopkins).', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/arts/25ITWASYOUCHARLIE/SUBITWASYOUCHARLIE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 314, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/26/arts/25ITWASYOUCHARLIE/SUBITWASYOUCHARLIE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 314}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/arts/25ITWASYOUCHARLIE/SUBITWASYOUCHARLIE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 536, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/arts/25ITWASYOUCHARLIE/SUBITWASYOUCHARLIE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 955, 'width': 1824, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/arts/25ITWASYOUCHARLIE/SUBITWASYOUCHARLIE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/26/arts/25ITWASYOUCHARLIE/SUBITWASYOUCHARLIE-thumbStandard