ing to tolerate than others, but that they generally preferred to address these matters internally rather than publicly.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/26/sports/football/in-nfl-and-other-sports-players-have-a-muted-reaction-to-teammates-wrongdoing.html', 'snippet': 'Players in different sports said that there were indiscretions they were far less willing to tolerate than others, but that they generally preferred to address these matters internally rather than publicly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As doping grew pervasive in cycling in recent decades, riders banded together and protected one another, even as laws were broken. The omerta permeated baseball, too, when players rarely grumbled publicly about their peers’ use of performance-enhancing drugs.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/sports/LOCKERROOMillo/LOCKERROOMillo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/26/sports/LOCKERROOMillo/LOCKERROOMillo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 439}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/sports/LOCKERROOMillo/LOCKERROOMillo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 749, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/sports/LOCKERROOMillo/LOCKERROOMillo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 792, 'width': 1083, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/sports/LOCKERROOMillo/LOCKERROOMillo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard'