ardness,” he added. “Mr. Sondheim’s score seems to grow more majestic each time you hear it (and more boisterous with raucous good-bad spirits), and the forward thrust of the drama as it reels into nightmare territory remains a model of musical theater writing.” Johnny Depp takes on the title role and Helena Bonham Carter is Mrs. Lovett in Tim Burton’s film version, at 1:45 p.m. on IFC.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On TV Friday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Friday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-26T05:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9662ade-9fa6-5f27-ba41-64dba93f7268', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9662ade-9fa6-5f27-ba41-64dba93f7268'}, {'abstract': 'South Carolina announced Thursday that it would guarantee four-year scholarships for football and men’s basketball players and would offer students getting full scholarships the “full cost of attendance.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/26/sports/ncaafootball/support-for-full-cost-scholarships-at-south-carolina.html', 'snippet': 'South Carolina announced Thursday that it would guarantee four-year scholarships for football and men’s basketball players and would offer students getting full scholarships the “full cost of attendance.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'South Carolina announced Thursday that it would guarantee four-year scholarships for football and men’s basketball players and would offer students getting full scholarships the “full cost 