 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Uber Technologies Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Berlin (Germany)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Frankfurt (Germany)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-26T14:58:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/adfadf48-f26b-58a5-91f7-5a0e5f4b8e82', 'word_count': 422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/adfadf48-f26b-58a5-91f7-5a0e5f4b8e82'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: British forces fight German troops in South Africa in 1914.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/26/1914-british-take-orange-river/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: British forces fight German troops in South Africa in 1914.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAPE TOWN — The important strategic position of Raman’s Drift, on the Orange River, has been occupied by British forces. The attack was made at daybreak. The Wachtmeister made a gallant attempt to hold the blockhouse commanding the Drift after his men had evacuated it, but he eventually surrendered. The patrol was then despatched up river. The Germans were discovered in a position from which they were dislodged after a smart skirmish and they retired. The South African force lost one killed, one wounded and two horses killed. The patrol then fell back. Regimental Sergeant-Major Thomas, of the 5th Regiment, behaved with the greatest gallantry, picking up a wounded rifleman and removing him out of danger while under heavy fire. Subsequent scouting disclosed the fact that an important grazing and watering station some miles within the border was held by the enemy. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Sept. 27, 1914\xa0', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica-jumbo.png', 'height': 546, 'width': 479, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica-superJumbo.png', 'height': 546, 'width': 479, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica/27iht-oldsept27-southafrica-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1914: British Take Orange River', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War I (1914-18)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Africa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-26T14:58:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/23a520d4-9722-5b8c-bca1-f554fc3fdc1a', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/23a520d4-9722-5b8c-bca1-f554fc3fdc1a'}, {'abstract': 'A new book and exhibition at the New-York Historical Society portrays some of the 101 objects that define New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/nyregion/100000003133055/new-york-in-101-objects.html', 'snippet': 'A new book and exhibition at the New-York Historical Society portrays some of the 101 objects that define New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new book and exhibition at the New-York Historical Society portrays some of the 101 objects that define New York.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/multimedia/101-objects/101-objects-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/23/multimedia/101-objects/101-objects-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/23/multimedia/101-objects/101-objects-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy'