t-viral-heres-what-i-learned/', 'snippet': 'I wanted the video of my 4-year-old talking about equality to be shared. But when it was stolen and shared by strangers, the experience changed how I think about posting images of my children online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When my oldest daughter turned 9, I stopped sharing new pictures and videos of her on my blog’s Facebook page. She was growing up and looking more and more like the teenager she would eventually become, and I didn’t want strangers to recognize her out in public. I didn’t think it would be right if her friends could go online and see pictures I was posting on my public sites. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/us/motherlode-cleo/motherlode-cleo-jumbo.png', 'height': 471, 'width': 266, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/us/motherlode-cleo/motherlode-cleo-superJumbo.png', 'height': 471, 'width': 266, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/us/motherlode-cleo/motherlode-cleo-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/26/us/motherlode-cleo/motherlode-cleo-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/26/us/motherlode-cleo/motherlode-cleo-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Stolen Video of My Daughter Went Viral. Here’s What I Learned.', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headli