nd-benjamin-among-top-rookies.html', 'snippet': 'Three weeks into the season, it has become evident how many skilled players have emerged from this rookie class.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before Week 1, this year’s rookies were regarded by many as a mediocre group for fantasy owners. Only three weeks into the season, however, we can already see how many skilled players are in this class. Here, we break down the performance of these rookies by position, and highlight the most important players so far this season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/sports/27fantasy1/27fantasy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/27/sports/27fantasy1/27fantasy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/sports/27fantasy1/27fantasy1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/sports/27fantasy1/27fantasy1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/sports/27fantasy1/27fantasy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/27/sports/27fantasy1/27fantasy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/sports/27fantasy1/27fantasy1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType'