A — Conflict and instability in the Middle East and parts of Africa look set to push the number of people seeking asylum in industrialized countries to the highest level in 20 years in 2014, the United Nations refugee agency said Friday, warning that the flow of refugees was increasing the strain on already overstretched humanitarian aid budgets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Refugee Flow to Industrialized Nations Is Poised for a 20-Year High', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central America', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Middle East', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-26T21:52:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Cumming-Bruce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ae4299fc-2057-549c-a86e-03a06f3c5698', 'word_count': 482, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae4299fc-2057-549c-a86e-03a06f3c5698'}, {'abstract': 'Cia. Unión Tanguera, a French-Argentine company, infuses tango with theatrical touches in “Nuit Blanche.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/27/arts/dance/cia-unin-tanguera-brings-its-tango-to-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Cia. Unión Tanguera, a French-Argentine company, infuses tango with theatrical touches in “Nuit Blanche.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Imagine this: A tango show has just ended, but its seven dancers don’t feel like calling it a night. They feel frisky. Instead of going home to soak in a tub, they linger behind in the nightclub, toying with props — wineglasses, red beanbag chairs —\xa0while teasing one another as a “Nuit Blanche,” or “Sleepless Night,” takes hold. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/TANGUERA/TANGUERA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 322, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/TANGUERA/TANGUERA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 322}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/TANGUERA/TANGUERA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 550, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/TANGUERA/TANGUERA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1099, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/TANGUERA/TANGUERA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/TANGUERA/TANGUERA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/TANGUERA/TANGUERA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Flirting With Temptation, Deep Into the Night', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Flirting With Temptation, Deep Into the Night', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tango', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cia Union Tanguera', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-26T21:57:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gia Kourlas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kourlas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/958ea4db-0388-5fd2-82a8-d84dba0d46cb', 'word_count': 463, 'uri': 'nyt://article/958ea4db-0388-5fd2-82a8-d84dba0d46cb'}, {'abstract': 'New York City Ballet presents a program of Igor Stravinsky’s work, choreographed by George Balanchine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/27/arts/music/new-york-city-ballet-dances-stravinsky-by-balanchine.html', 'snippet': 'New York City Ballet presents a program of Igor Stravinsky’s work, choreographed by George Balanchine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The rate at which New York City Ballet has been hurling its works back into the repertory at the start of its fall season is prodigious, even by this company’s own rapid-fire standards. The first four nights are bringing no fewer than 17 ballets. And the first three register like company proclamations of the causes in which it most believes. Tuesday provided 21st-century choreography, with three world premieres; Wednesday presented ballets by the founding choreographer George Balanchine to music by Tchaikovsky; and Thursday honored the company’s unmatched tradition of Balanchine choreography to music by Stravinsky.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/STRAVINSKY/STRAVINSKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/STRAVINSKY/STRAVINSKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 631}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/STRAVINSKY/STRAVINSKY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 974, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/STRAVINSKY/STRAVINSKY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1947, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/STRAVINSKY/STRAVINSKY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/STRAVINSKY/STRAVINSKY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/STRAVINSKY/STRAVINSKY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Transforming Sound Into Dizzying Sights ', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Transforming Sound Into Dizzying Sights', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York City Ballet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'va