he genesis of his signature red soles.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Christian Louboutin Shares Stories on Showgirls, Shoes and Theater', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Louboutin, Christian, LLC', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-26T22:33:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57ba9c36-c028-5817-99bd-a46a125e3f6b', 'word_count': 57, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57ba9c36-c028-5817-99bd-a46a125e3f6b'}, {'abstract': 'Some recent innovations in large-scale 3-D printing technology enabled Local Motors, a Phoenix-area company, to build the Strati, a 3-D printed vehicle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/09/28/automobiles/28printed-slides.html', 'snippet': 'Some recent innovations in large-scale 3-D printing technology enabled Local Motors, a Phoenix-area company, to build the Strati, a 3-D printed vehicle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some recent innovations in large-scale 3-D printing technology enabled Local Motors, a Phoenix-area company, to build the Strati, a 3-D printed vehicle.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/automobiles/28printed-slides-slide-H0DN/28printed-slides-slide-H0DN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/28/automobiles/28printed-slides-slide-H0DN/28printed-slid