o/38a4234b-49c7-57be-b2f8-150e616ee8b3'}, {'abstract': 'The Tony-winning “Vanya and Sonia and Masha and Spike,” by Christopher Durang, will be romping across regional stages this season as the most produced play on a Top 10 list.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/27/theater/christopher-durangs-vanya-and-sonia-and-masha-and-spike-heads-to-regional-theaters.html', 'snippet': 'The Tony-winning “Vanya and Sonia and Masha and Spike,” by Christopher Durang, will be romping across regional stages this season as the most produced play on a Top 10 list.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the playwright Christopher Durang, the view beyond the Hudson is looking very attractive these days. “Vanya and Sonia and Masha and Spike,” his American comedic riff on Chekhovian themes, will be produced in 27 theaters around the country in the coming season. That puts it at the head of the annual Top 10 list of most performed plays, not including Shakespeare or holiday shows, compiled by American Theater magazine. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/subjpdurang/subjpdurang-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/subjpdurang/subjpdurang-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/subjpdurang/subjpdurang-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/arts/subjpdurang/subjpdurang-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 955, 'width': 1417, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capti