nd troops.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/news/un-general-assembly/2014/09/26/raising-hands-to-join-peacekeeping-forces/', 'snippet': 'Mexico, Indonesia, Mongolia and Bangladesh pledge greater participation, and Japan says it will change its laws so it can send troops.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Japan said it would change its laws in order to be able to send soldiers on United Nations peacekeeping missions. Mexico said it would revive its involvement in United Nations peacekeeping. Indonesia, Mongolia and Bangladesh promised to prepare troops for rapid deployment. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Raising Hands to Join Peacekeeping Forces', 'kicker': 'United Nations General Assembly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-27T00:56:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7c7c4bd-e816-52b9-955e-c40ce3a54f89', 'word_count': 448, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7c7c4bd-e816-52b9-955e-c40ce3a54f89'}, {'abstract': 'The beatification Mass for a former leader of Opus Dei is an unusually public show of force for the movement, one of the most powerful and discreet in Catholicism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/27/world/europe/beatification-portillo-opus-dei.html', 'snippet': 'The beatification Mass for a former leader of Opus Dei is an unusually public show of force for the movement, one of the most powerful and discreet in Catholicism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID —