anizing support for stronger safety laws, but far more attention is needed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a sorry commentary on the shooting sprees that regularly afflict the nation that only recently has the Federal Bureau of Investigation been authorized to delve into how prevalent the threat has become. The bureau’s new survey across the past 13 years concludes that horrific shootings like those in 2012 at the Sandy Hook Elementary School in Newtown, Conn., and the movie theater in Aurora, Colo., are occurring with greater frequency. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Quickening Pace of Gun Sprees', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Quickening Pace of Gun Sprees', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'School Shootings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lobbying and Lobbyists', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-27T01:54:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/330ac12b-a694-5302-8c7c-c771789bfd2d', 'word_count': 327, 'uri': 'nyt://article/330ac12b-a694-5302-8c7c-c771789bfd2d'}, {'abstract': 'The John W. Engeman Theater at Northport is offering Andrew Lloyd Webber’s “Evita,” the 1979 Broadway musical about a young woman from the sticks who rises to become Argentina’s first lady and spiritual leader.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/28/nyregion/a-review-of-evita-in-northport.html', 'snippet': 'The John W. Engeman Theater at Northport is offering Andrew Lloyd Webber’s “Evita,” the 1979 Broadway musical about a young woman from the sticks who rises to become Argentina’s first lady and spiritual leader.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andrew Lloyd Webber’s musicals rarely garner critical acclaim but often achieve enormous staying power, on Broadway and in regional theaters. Consider “Evita,” one of the composer’s most popular shows, now at the John W. Engeman Theater at Northport in a production that highlights the insistent allure of its melodies — and underscores some of its flaws.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28ARTSLI1/28ARTSLI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28ARTSLI1/28ARTSLI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28ARTSLI1/28ARTSLI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28ARTSLI1/28ARTSLI1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28ARTSLI1/28ARTSLI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', '