o Pies had operated in various spots in Trenton for more than 100 years but has a new home in Robbinsville.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The tomato vine is a link between seasons. In summer, you stand over the sink, with a slurry of juice and seeds running down wrists and chin, chomping a sun-warmed fruit. In fall, the oven looks all right again and you begin to think about covering what food you’ve got in crust. In New Jersey, the tomatoes are still rolling in, but the nights are cool. What sounds better than tomato pie? ', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28DINENJ3/28DINENJ3-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28DINENJ3/28DINENJ3-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28DINENJ3/28DINENJ3-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28DINENJ3/28DINENJ3-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28DINENJ3/28DINENJ3-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28DINENJ3/28DINENJ3-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/nyregion/28DINE