campaign. The meeting was held in the Round Room of the Dublin Mansion House, and was attended by 3,000 persons, mainly Nationalists, but including many Unionists, among them Professor Mahaffy. The Nationalist Lord Mayor of Dublin presided, and among the speakers were Mr. John Redmond, Mr. Joseph Devlin and Mr. John Dillon.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 815, 'width': 541, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 815, 'width': 541, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/27/blogs/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster/27iht-retrospective-Irish-Poster-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1914: British Prime Minister Urges Irish to Enlist', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 1, 'major': '