as something I acquired from my father, among the many things he has given me for life, like the shape of my feet and my quirky, maneuverable eyebrows.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sunday-review/0928TSUIsub/0928TSUIsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 803, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/28/sunday-review/0928TSUIsub/0928TSUIsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 803}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sunday-review/0928TSUIsub/0928TSUIsub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 765, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sunday-review/0928TSUIsub/0928TSUIsub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1530, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sunday-review/0928TSUIsub/0928TSUIsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/28/sunday-review/0928TSUIsub/0928TSUIsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sunday-review/0928TSUIsub/0928TSUIsub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Like Father, Like Daughter, Like Son', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Like Father, Like Daughter, Like Son', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub':