ww.nytimes.com/2014/09/28/world/for-muslims-social-media-debate-on-extremism-is-reflected-in-dueling-hashtags.html', 'snippet': 'A prominent social media campaign has condemned extremist Islamic groups, but it has spawned a satirical reaction from Muslims who say it presumes that they are collectively responsible for the violence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — With concerns growing in the West about the recruitment of young people by extremist Islamic groups, President Obama brought new attention last week to Muslims who have condemned the radical movement when he singled out a British group for praise in his speech at the United Nations.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Muslims, Social Media Debate on Extremism Is Reflected in Dueling Hashtags ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Muslims, Social Media Debate on Extremism Is Reflected in Dueling Hashtags', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Active Change Foundation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-27T19:16:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kimiko de Freytas-Tamura', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kimiko', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'de Freytas-Tamura', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5384a29f-683d-51c4-b8f4-cd95879c81b9', 'word_count': 897, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5384a29f-683d-51c4-b8f4-cd95879c81b9'}, {'abstract': 'The White House and lawmakers will weigh in on how the United States should respond to the Islamic State.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/09/27/what-were-watching-today-sunday-shows/', 'snippet': 'The White House and lawmakers will weigh in on how the United States should respond to the Islamic State.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a fervent speech to the United Nations on Wednesday, President Obama vowed to dismantle and destroy the Islamic State’s “network of death.” Antony J. Blinken, the deputy national security adviser, will discuss the president’s strategy on the Sunday network shows, including CBS’s “Face the Nation,” CNN’s “State of the Union” and “Fox News Sunday.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We’re Watching: Sunday Shows', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-09-27T19:20:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elena Schneider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schneider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b226b898-8f53-53c9-83c2-2e44fbb244e5', 'word_count': 246, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b226b898-8f53-53c9-83c2-2e44fbb244e5'}, {'abstract': 'Gruden, in his sixth season with “Monday Night Football” on ESPN, had a head-scratching performance during the Jets-Bears game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/28/sports/football/as-an-analyst-jon-gruden-needs-a-lot-of-coaching.html', 'snippet': 'Gruden, in his sixth season with “Monday Night Football” on ESPN, had a head-scratching performance during the Jets-Bears game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jon Gruden is in his sixth season with ESPN’s “Monday Night Football,” and I’m still waiting for him to become an interesting and entertaining analyst. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sports/DOG-sandomir/DOG-sandomir-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/28/sports/DOG-sandomir/DOG-sandomir-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sports/DOG-sandomir/DOG-sandomir-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sports/DOG-sandomir/DOG-sandomir-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sports/DOG-sandomir/DOG-sandomir-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/28/sports/DOG-sandomir/DOG-sandomir-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/28/sports/DOG-sandomir/DOG-sandomir-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As an Analyst, Jon Gruden Needs a Lot of Coaching', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline'