alea,” a concert of new works composed for the group, at Roulette.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/29/arts/music/james-baker-leads-the-talea-ensemble-at-roulette.html', 'snippet': 'The Talea Ensemble performed “Written for Talea,” a concert of new works composed for the group, at Roulette.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During a concert of new works composed for the Talea Ensemble on Friday evening at Roulette, it sometimes seemed that limited material was being stretched to fill the time allocated by a commission, instead of being used more effectively in shorter works. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/29/arts/TALEA/TALEA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 516, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/29/arts/TALEA/TALEA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 516}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/29/arts/TALEA/TALEA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 881, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/29/arts/TALEA/TALEA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1761, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/29/arts/TALEA/TALEA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/29/arts/TALEA/TALEA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/29/arts/TALEA/TALEA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 1