llowing surgery. He was 75, according to his family. The death of Harpo, whose real name was Arthur, leaves only Groucho of the three brothers whose films had the world rocking with laughter in the 1930s. Harpo’s contribution to the Marx brothers’ act was a harp, a battered opera hat, baggy pants and an improbable frock coat, from which he pulled a wild assortment of junk. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Sept. 30, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/29/blogs/29iht-old30-harpo-marx/29iht-old30-harpo-marx-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 570, 'width': 449, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/29/blogs/29iht-old30-harpo-marx/29iht-old30-harpo-marx-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 570, 'width': 449, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/29/blogs/29iht-old30-harpo-marx/29iht-old30-harpo-marx-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/29/blogs/29iht-old30-harpo-marx/29iht-old30-harpo-marx-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/29/blogs/29iht-old30-harpo-marx/29iht-old30-harpo-marx-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1964: Silent Comic Harpo Marx Dies', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'