liage Travel Turns Adventurous', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Travel to Savor Fall Foliage Takes an Adventurous Turn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weed, Julie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Autumn (Season)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Adventure Travel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mohonk Mountain House', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-29T17:56:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Weed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f819ebb8-ce45-5b3f-aa41-245a2b365265', 'word_count': 843, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f819ebb8-ce45-5b3f-aa41-245a2b365265'}, {'abstract': 'A memoir by Charles M. Blow reveals his struggles with the standards of race and masculinity while growing up in small-town rural Louisiana.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/30/books/fire-shut-up-in-my-bones-by-charles-m-blow.html', 'snippet': 'A memoir by Charles M. Blow reveals his struggles with the standards of race and masculinity while growing up in small-town rural Louisiana.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was 10 and in the habit of following my father on his errands, I accompanied him on a trip to an electrical supply store. Just after we’d parked and gone inside, a clerk told my father that a police officer was about to give him a ticket. We rushed outside and, after receiving an apology for overlooking a no-parking sign, the officer let my father out of the ticket, provided he moved the car. I stood next to the officer as my father searched for another space. He asked how old I was and remarked that I was big for my age, a comment I was accustomed to hearing. Then he crudely asked if I was anatomically proportionate. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 536, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/BOOK/BOOK-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Child’s Village Leaves Lifetime Scars', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Child’s Village Leaves Lifetime Scars', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cobb, Jelani', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blow, Charles M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Fire Shut Up in My Bones (Book)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-29T17:56:29