stract': '“Peaky Blinders,” a BBC crime drama that takes place in early-20th-century England, is being released by Netflix on Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/30/arts/television/peaky-blinders-is-a-british-crime-drama.html', 'snippet': '“Peaky Blinders,” a BBC crime drama that takes place in early-20th-century England, is being released by Netflix on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a title, “Peaky Blinders” manages to be both more intriguing and more off-putting than usual. In early-20th-century Birmingham, England, apparently, the term referred to peaked caps worn by gang members that had razor blades sewn into the seams. In the new BBC series about those gangs, whenever someone whips off his cap during battle the action suddenly goes slow-motion and balletic, as if we’re watching a rhythmic gymnastics broadcast with blood instead of streamers.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/peaky/peaky-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/peaky/peaky-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/peaky/peaky-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/peaky/peaky-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/arts/peaky/peaky-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thu