itzsimmons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a66d1f32-d15c-548b-bb38-ccea07f61c42', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a66d1f32-d15c-548b-bb38-ccea07f61c42'}, {'abstract': 'Believed to be nearly eradicated, the voracious Asian long-horned beetle has been found in hundreds of trees in Long Island.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/30/nyregion/thousands-of-trees-will-fall-in-a-renewed-battle-to-stop-a-beetle.html', 'snippet': 'Believed to be nearly eradicated, the voracious Asian long-horned beetle has been found in hundreds of trees in Long Island.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a menace from Asia that over the past two decades has ravaged tens of thousands of trees in several states. But after being wiped out in New Jersey, it seemed to be in retreat in New York thanks to a warlike response from federal and state governments. It was gone from Staten Island and Manhattan, and the battle against it was tilting toward eradication in Queens, in Brooklyn and on Long Island.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/nyregion/NYBEETLE1/NYBEETLE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/30/nyregion/NYBEETLE1/NYBEETLE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/nyregion/NYBEETLE1/NYBEETLE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/30/nyregion/NYBEETLE1/NYBEETLE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'widt