ew money, raised from existing investors including Kleiner Perkins Caufield & Byers, would help bolster software development and a push into Western Europe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The simple act of connecting teachers with students and parents may not seem like a revolutionary business. But Remind, a start-up built around using smartphones to link the three groups, has gotten a big financial vote of confidence from prominent investors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/dbpix-remind2/dbpix-remind2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 902, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/01/business/dbpix-remind2/dbpix-remind2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 902}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/dbpix-remind2/dbpix-remind2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 681, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/dbpix-remind2/dbpix-remind2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1362, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/dbpix-remind2/dbpix-remind2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/01/business/dbpix-remind2/dbpix-remind2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/dbpix-remind2/dbpix-remind2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Remind, a Start-Up That Links Teachers and Parents, Raises $40 Million', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Venture Capital', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Doerr, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'First Round Capital', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kleiner Perkins Caufield & Byers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Social+Capital Partnership', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-30T13:01:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63f49517-8c2e-51b1-bafb-331cb77fc5da', 'word_count': 572, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63f49517-8c2e-51b1-bafb-331cb77fc5da'}, {'abstract': 'Stephanie Clifford supplies an inside look at her reporting on the case of a man who is accused of kicking a cat in Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2014/09/30/cat-kicker-incites-agressive-prosecution-a-reporters-notebook/', 'snippet': 'Stephanie Clifford supplies an inside look at her reporting on the case of a man who is accused of kicking a cat in Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This story is an example of why court coverage can be so interesting. I live in Brooklyn and find that almost every issue that touches lives here — including gun control, gentrification, housing, pay and relationships — comes through the courts one way or another. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cat Kicker Incites Aggressive Prosecution: A Reporter’s Notebook', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Animal Abuse, Rights and Welfare', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMALS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clifford, Stephanie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-30T13:28:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Clifford', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clifford', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bbbc50ca-0502-5578-9eff-03482b563b61', 'word_count': 342, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bbbc50ca-0502-5578-9eff-03482b563b61'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: British pilots drop leaflet over Germany and photograph German defenses in 1939.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/30/1939-british-unmask-reich-defenses/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: British pilots drop leaflet over Germany and photograph German defenses in 1939.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — With French artillery pounding at German positions on the Western front and the British Expeditionary Army nearly ready to go into action, the Air Ministry disclosed today [Sept. 30] that an almost endless series of British reconnaissance flights over the Siegfried Line during the first month of war enabled the British high command to build up ‘‘a comprehensive picture’’ of German defenses. British pilots have combined leaflet-dropping with high-speed camera work that has resulted in ‘‘a remarkable series of air photographs showing in clearest detail some of the most strongly fortified zones of the Siegfried Line.’’\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Oct. 1, 1939', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/blogs/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 497, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/01/blogs/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 497}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/blogs/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 679, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/blogs/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 679, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/blogs/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/01/blogs/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline/01iht-oldoct01-siegfriedline-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'c