': 'nyt://article/a640e4bb-6f9f-5c49-acd4-5a8b4ebccddd', 'word_count': 49, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a640e4bb-6f9f-5c49-acd4-5a8b4ebccddd'}, {'abstract': 'Marvel settled a copyright lawsuit with the heirs of the legendary illustrator.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/09/30/jack-kirby-finally-gets-his-due/', 'snippet': 'Marvel settled a copyright lawsuit with the heirs of the legendary illustrator.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Marvel entertainment juggernaut averted what could have become a nasty Supreme Court throw down last week when it settled a copyright lawsuit with the heirs of the legendary illustrator Jack Kirby, also known as “The King of Comics.” Kirby was the defining talent at the Marvel shop during the halcyon years that produced iconic characters such as the X-Men, Iron Man, The Fantastic Four, Spider-Man, Thor, the Silver Surfer and The Incredible Hulk. He never received the credit or money he was due and died in 1994.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jack Kirby Finally Gets His Due', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Copyrights and Copyright Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirby, Jack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Stan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Marvel Entertainment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walt Disney Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-30T16:26:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brent Staples', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brent', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Staples', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4501fed