two T28s have been flown from Texas airports into Mexico and then to Port-au-Prince, the Caribbean republic’s capital. The brutal Duvalier is anxious to use the planes to help in his fight against two bands of anti-government guerrillas who now virtually control the southern section of the country.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Oct. 1, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1964: Duvalier Gets Smuggled Planes', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Military Aircraft', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duvalier, Francois', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Haiti', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-30T16:33:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac8a07d0-69a4-50d7-a548-41410a1db098', 'word_count': 103, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac8a07d0-69a4-50d7-a548-41410a1db098'}, {'abstract': 'Lawmakers elicited several new disclosures from Julia Pierson, the Secret Service director, in the first two hours of an oversight hearing into problems at the agency.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/09/30/secret-service-hearing-yields-new-information-on-white-house-security-breach/', 'snippet': 'Lawmakers elicited several new disclosures from Julia Pierson, the Secret Service director, in the first two hours of an oversight hearing into problems at the agency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lawmakers elicited seve