56ef29c', 'word_count': 223, 'uri': 'nyt://article/745def89-7f25-5e33-b5c0-c828e56ef29c'}, {'abstract': 'Sixteen people have scaled the White House fence in the past five years, according to the Secret Service, which is nearly eight feet tall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/09/30/white-house-fence-intruders/', 'snippet': 'Sixteen people have scaled the White House fence in the past five years, according to the Secret Service, which is nearly eight feet tall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The White House perimeter fence is nearly eight feet high and adorned with ornamental spear-like tips. They are decorative but sharp enough to puncture the skin, as Diane Wilson learned last year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tall and Spiked, but Little Deterrent to Intruders', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'White House Building (Washington, DC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Codepink', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Secret Service', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-30T17:45:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Apuzzo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Apuzzo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bff2f4d-2b3e-511c-9bb2-335133ffcc71', 'word_count': 406, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bff2f4d-2b3e-511c-9bb2-335133ffcc71'}, {'abstract': 'In several tax havens, the profits reported by American-controlled companies are many times the size of the actual local economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.ny