etire/', 'snippet': 'Paloma Herrera, Julie Kent and Xiomara Reyes will retire near the end of American Ballet Theater’s 2015 season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'American Ballet Theater will celebrate its 75th anniversary this season by performing key dances from its past, staging a new production of “The Sleeping Beauty” choreographed by Alexei Ratmansky, and appearing as the subject of a new public television documentary by Ric Burns. But it will also close a more recent chapter of its history, as three ballerinas retire.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/30artsbeat-xiomara/30artsbeat-xiomara-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 832, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/30artsbeat-xiomara/30artsbeat-xiomara-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 832}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/30artsbeat-xiomara/30artsbeat-xiomara-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 739, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/30artsbeat-xiomara/30artsbeat-xiomara-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1477, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/30artsbeat-xiomara/30artsbeat-xiomara-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/30artsbeat-xiomara/30artsbeat-xiomara-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit':