lumbia University Miller Theater on Thursday, had many strict teachers. One was Edgard Varèse, the temperamental French-born Modernist and godfather of electronic music, who once showed his displeasure by throwing a score of Mr. Chou’s on the floor and ordering him to urinate on it. Then there was Bohuslav Martinu, the Czech symphonist, who reacted to a fugue Mr. Chou had written using Chinese melodic material with a single, withering, “Why?” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Modern Voice, Ancient Origins ', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Modern Voice, Ancient Origins', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chou Wen-chung', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'da Fonseca-Wollheim, Corinna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Varese, Edgard', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Columbia University', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-09-30T22:06:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corinna da Fonseca-Wollheim', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/24f0e5eb-7cae-5976-a916-6fcbf2ce705b', 'word_count': 1102, 'uri': 'nyt://article/24f0e5eb-7cae-5976-a916-6fcbf2ce705b'}, {'abstract': 'Prince has released two albums in one day: “Art Official Age,” a solo album, and “PlectrumElectrum,” backed by 3rdEyeGirl.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/01/arts/prince-releases-art-official-age-and-plectrumelectrum.html', 'snippet': 'Prince has released two albums in one day: “Art Official Age,” a solo album, and “PlectrumElectrum,” backed by 3rdEyeGirl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prince has made his career as syncopated as his music, juggling silence and noise, arena sellouts and secretive recordings. His latest confounding move is the simultaneous arrival of two albums: “Art Official Age,” a studio production billed as his first solo album since 2010 (though he had help) and “PlectrumElectrum,” on which he’s backed by the three-woman rock trio he has been touring with, 3rdEyeGirl.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/PRINCE/PRINCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 860, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/PRINCE/PRINCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 860}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/PRINCE/PRINCE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 715, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/PRINCE/PRINCE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1429, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/arts/PRINCE/PRINCE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/0